c1cc0bb49bc71460de48ce2723171e269559d5","node_id":"C_kwDOR2HEodoAKDViYzFjYzBiYjQ5YmM3MTQ2MGRlNDhjZTI3MjMxNzFlMjY5NTU5ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alimobrem/olm-console-plugin/commit/7a0ed09b8a075bf0d38df8d8f9649f77b6125c06","sha":"7a0ed09b8a075bf0d38df8d8f9649f77b6125c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimobrem/olm-console-plugin/commits/7a0ed09b8a075bf0d38df8d8f9649f77b6125c06"}],"sha":"5bc1cc0bb49bc71460de48ce2723171e269559d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimobrem/olm-console-plugin/commits/5bc1cc0bb49bc71460de48ce2723171e269559d5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimobrem/olm-console-plugin/commits/7a0ed09b8a075bf0d38df8d8f9649f77b6125c06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-01T03:49:41Z","email":"amobrem@example.com","name":"Ali Mobrem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-01T03:49:41Z","email":"amobrem@example.com","name":"Ali Mobrem"},"message":"Wire up full migrated components for all detail pages\n\nReplace simplified stub detail pages with the full migrated OLM\ncomponents that were already in the codebase but not wired up:\n\n- Enhance DetailsPage shim to support obj, pagesFor, customActionMenu,\n  loading/error states for rich detail page rendering\n- InstallPlan: full steps table, components tab, approval controls\n- Subscription: channel selection, approval strategy, catalog health\n- CatalogSource: operators tab, PackageManifest integration, create\n- CSV: conditions, deployments, dynamic API tabs, events, descriptors\n- Operand: descriptor-based UI, status/spec rendering, create form\n- Install Status: real-time tracking, approval workflow, error display\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"023b0f70bfde3e15b995bbfbe453074b22864f34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimobrem/olm-console-plugin/git/trees/023b0f70bfde3e15b995bbfbe453074b22864f34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimobrem/olm-console-plugin/git/commi