obrem/olm-console-plugin/commit/476fe64dc028d9314ab3cab82808e6b0c8c52474","node_id":"C_kwDOR2HEodoAKDQ3NmZlNjRkYzAyOGQ5MzE0YWIzY2FiODI4MDhlNmIwYzhjNTI0NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alimobrem/olm-console-plugin/commit/7678c579047a1a417a395845dc547ce562a5567c","sha":"7678c579047a1a417a395845dc547ce562a5567c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimobrem/olm-console-plugin/commits/7678c579047a1a417a395845dc547ce562a5567c"}],"sha":"476fe64dc028d9314ab3cab82808e6b0c8c52474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimobrem/olm-console-plugin/commits/476fe64dc028d9314ab3cab82808e6b0c8c52474"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alimobrem/olm-console-plugin/commits/7678c579047a1a417a395845dc547ce562a5567c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-01T03:07:23Z","email":"amobrem@example.com","name":"Ali Mobrem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-01T03:07:23Z","email":"amobrem@example.com","name":"Ali Mobrem"},"message":"Fix all TypeScript compilation errors (417 → 0)\n\nResolve all TypeScript errors across the plugin by adding missing type\nexports, compatibility wrappers, and PF6 API fixes:\n\n- Fix Card accessibility warning: move selectableActions to CardHeader (PF6 API)\n- Add compat wrappers for k8s CRUD functions (old multi-arg → new single-arg SDK)\n- Add missing K8s types (NodeAffinity, PodAffinity, Operator enum, etc.)\n- Add missing models (Job, Pod, ReplicaSet, Service, Role)\n- Add withFallback HOC, ErrorBoundaryFallbackPage, RadioGroup component\n- Fix sortField → sort, textExpanded → toggleTextExpanded (PF6 renames)\n- Add global.d.ts for Window.SERVER_FLAGS and SVG module declarations\n- Fix import paths for SDK, subscription-provider, catalog-source-provider\n- Add resourceURL, apiVersionCompare, modelFor, and other k8s utilities\n- Make TableData id/activeColumnIDs optional via wrapper\n- Support both curried and direct referenceForGroupVersionKind calling\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) 