GELOG — it was added to index.html in an earlier untracked edit\nbut never reflected in the docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78af6614ec4c49a811cd14a3a062b056a6ab6ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/78af6614ec4c49a811cd14a3a062b056a6ab6ced"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/b0fd4ffcbad9533f9725f02606dc2a4de8583f5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/b0fd4ffcbad9533f9725f02606dc2a4de8583f5c","node_id":"C_kwDOR2RjXNoAKGIwZmQ0ZmZjYmFkOTUzM2Y5NzI1ZjAyNjA2ZGMyYTRkZTg1ODNmNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/db3f6bfcfa8f0dd872bed59674e07b81263b41c0","sha":"db3f6bfcfa8f0dd872bed59674e07b81263b41c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/db3f6bfcfa8f0dd872bed59674e07b81263b41c0"}],"sha":"b0fd4ffcbad9533f9725f02606dc2a4de8583f5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/b0fd4ffcbad9533f9725f02606dc2a4de8583f5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/db3f6bfcfa8f0dd872bed59674e07b81263b41c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T17:03:14Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T17:03:14Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"message":"copy: rename Tenant Admin to School Admin across all visible content\n\nWGU employees outside the small dev team are now getting access to\nthis storyboard, and \"Tenant Admin\" (SOW/contract terminology) reads\nas confusing jargon to that audience. Replaced every visible mention\nacross all 5 portals and their READMEs with \"School Admin\":\n\n- Persona labels, nav links, aria-labels, LRPS table rows and badges\n- Driver-class name (SDPTenantAdminProviderDriver -> SDPSchoolAdminProviderDriver)\n- Audit-log event codes, OAuth placeholder, mailto/textarea sample content\n- Dynamic JS-rendered strings (School Admin scope banner)\n- README prose, persona descriptions, SOW cross-references, glossary rows\n\nLeft untouched (by design):\n- CHANGELOG.md and README.md''s own historical \"Earlier milestones\"\n  section - these are dated records of what was literally built/named\n  at each point in time, same principle as not rewriting git history\n- The tenant_admin/ folder and file path - the external Coda Contract\n  Requirements tracker deep-links into this path via ?screen=N; renaming\n  it would break those links. The portal already had precedent for this\n  split (chrome says \"School Admin\", path stays tenant_admin/) per a\n  prior terminology lock on 24 May 2026\n- Internal code identifiers never rendered to a viewer: TENANT_IDS,\n  data-tenant-* attribute names, data-filter-user=\"tenant\" filter keys,\n  and dev-facing comments\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb5d631e44674a417f6960e94a1fbbe92ea7bb28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/cb5d631e44674a417f6960e94a1fbbe92ea7bb28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/db3f6bfcfa8f0dd872bed59674e07b81263b41c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.