re work) — the storyboard pages were already correct; the docs lagged:\n\n- Super Admin README: Components + Notes + Scope described a pre-consolidation\n  layout (separate Compliance Report / User Management / Instructor Roster /\n  Schools & Settings / Rate Limits screens + a Skill wizard, S14-S26). Rewritten\n  to the current 11-screen reality (roles on S2, settings on S4, audit on S11,\n  inherited drill S6-S8, 5-level Analytics on S5).\n- School Admin README: SOW-ref \"Where covered\" cell + Components + Notes screen\n  numbers swapped to current (New Skill S6, Topics/LOs S7, Model S8, Deploy S9,\n  LRPS ticket S10, Analytics + Activity Log S11, drill S2-S4).\n- Instructor README: removed references to the conversation-transcript (S7) and\n  audit-trail (S8) screens retired in v4.121 (instructor is 5 screens; the\n  cross-tenant audit lives in Super Admin -> Logs).\n- Root README: personas list (Bob), surfaces table, and per-portal scenario tables\n  corrected (instructor 8->5, School Admin 2-scenarios/20->1/12 with SC-ADD-06\n  dropped, Super Admin 13->11); removed merged-away Token Usage / Rate Limits /\n  Compliance / Geo-redundancy / Instructor Roster / Schools & Settings descriptors.\n\nLive storyboard unaffected; documentation accuracy only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"173913b38e96fcf4a3dc50f88124d8c2f4d62ffe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/173913b38e96fcf4a3dc50f88124d8c2f4d62ffe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/1582f86020097e84cf5e9854d13a2e1ee16f205c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brad