e,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/01a2fa385d6142483bfe6f45738840e08c8593a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:02:11Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:02:11Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"message":"docs: refresh READMEs for the v4.160 unified export + version stamps\n\n- Root README platform-wide note: now describes the unified \"Export\" dropdown +\n  format-by-audience (PDF/CSV human, MD/JSON machine), and that editors / pick-lists\n  (Topics/LOs, model picker) carry no controls.\n- tenant_admin / super_admin \"Components introduced\": export bullet updated from the\n  old four-formats-everywhere to the unified dropdown with format-by-nature.\n- Per-portal Storyboard rev stamps bumped v4.156 -> v4.160 (covers chip removal,\n  filter-placement audit, logs de-dup, logo-home, subtitles, and unified export).\n\nCHANGELOG''s older PDF/CSV/MD/JSON entries are left intact as historical record.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa4fd521d4f2bcb1eb56b382aa3ea8212560c281","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/aa4fd521d4f2bcb1eb56b382aa3ea8212560c281"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/01a2fa385d6142483bfe6f45738840e08c8593a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","fo