ot for end-user display)\n\nPer Brady — WCAG 2.2 AA is an assumed contractual standard; surfacing it as a\nUI label adds noise without informing the viewer (same reasoning as not labeling\nTLS / FERPA on-screen). Reverted the three analytics / heatmap headers (Instructor,\nSchool Admin, Super Admin) to the plain eyebrow, and dropped the WCAG phrasing from\nthe visualization-key note (kept the functional point: each chart pairs a color with\nits numeric value). Regenerated the affected screenshots; student baseline left frozen.\nDev-only CSS comments referencing the focus-ring fix are untouched (not user-facing).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d2ebf8d128a5155050593236f24c742091d3aa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/0d2ebf8d128a5155050593236f24c742091d3aa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/fae2bda34b316a582e906c170e795213b611313d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/fae2bda34b316a582e906c170e795213b611313d","node_id":"C_kwDOR2RjXNoAKGZhZTJiZGEzNGIzMTZhNTgyZTkwNmMxNzBlNzk1MjEzYjYxMTMxM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/a44cf0a14c533573d21dd5a0cff333a7869f2a8c","sha":"a44cf0a14c533573d21dd5a0cff333a7869f2a8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/a44cf0a14c533573d21dd5a0cff333a7869f2a8c"}],"sha":"fae2bda34b316a582e906c170e795213b611313d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/fae2bda34b316a582e906c170e795213b611313d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/a44cf0a14c533573d21dd5a0cff333a7869f2a8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:46:24Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:46:24Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"message":"v4.156: design-system polish pass across the 3 admin portals\n\nConsistency (SkillProof Design System v1.3): 8-pt spacing enforcement\n(.badge-lg, unified skill-button + modal padding), token cleanup that fixes\ndark-mode rough edges (GraphQL/API code blocks, new-school review box), and a\n.role-pill class for the 8 Super Admin role selectors (keeps color-coding,\nadds a visible focus ring, removes inline duplication).\n\nLeadership-facing enhancements:\n- Export-confirmation toast (shared, accessible role=status / aria-live) wired\n  to every PDF / CSV / JSON export via one delegated handler in table-controls.js.\n- Live institution-branding preview on SA School Management (per-School brand\n  color + readable-text auto-contrast by luminance).\n- WCAG 2.2 AA contrast chip + collapsible Visualization key on both analytics\n  screens; \"Works on every device\" phone-preview card on the SA dashboard.\n\nNo new screens; ?screen=N deep links + screen counts (5 / 12 / 11) unchanged.\nShared assets bumped to ?v=12 (cache-bust). Screenshots regenerated for the\nadmin portals; student v1.2 baseline left frozen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fccabeadb605318015bcdd9bedc858d04ace88b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/fccabeadb605318015bcdd9bedc858d04ace88b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/a44cf0a14c533573d21dd5a0cff333a7869f2a8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-w