/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/ce0f20fb42281ce36bf752065c9c37b4c11ceb17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T13:38:33Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T13:38:33Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"message":"v4.154: dark mode working across all 5 surfaces\n\nThree concrete bugs fixed:\n\n1. `.tc-sort` (shared module): rule used descendant selector\n   `.table-controls .tc-sort` which excluded chip-bar sorts that\n   addChipBarSort injects into hand-coded chip bars (e.g. SA S2 Access\n   Control People/Skills/Schools). Changed to bare `.tc-sort` so it\n   matches universally. Also added `appearance: none` + URL-encoded SVG\n   caret so Chrome respects our `background-color` on native <select>\n   (without `appearance:none` Chrome paints the OS-default white and\n   ignores even longhand `background-color`).\n\n2. SA inline modals (#role-modal, #new-school-modal, #remove-modal): the\n   3 dialog divs hardcoded `background:#fff` instead of using the themed\n   token, so they stayed white-with-gray-text (unreadable) in dark mode.\n   Changed to `var(--pgn-color-white)` which dark-flips to `#0D1A2E`.\n\n3. Added `[data-theme=\"dark\"]` defensive overrides for `.tc-chip`,\n   `.tc-search input`, `.tc-sort`, `.tc-chip-search input`, `.an-tab`,\n   `.an-tabs` so all shared-module form controls render correctly in\n   dark mode regardless of paint-timing.\n\nVerified in dark mode:\n- LRPS root, Student (S1/2/5/7/8/9/15), Instructor (S1/3/4), Tenant\n  Admin (S1/11 + New Course modal), Super Admin (S1/2/5/9/10/11 + all 3\n  modals), Help. Zero light-bg suspects on any screen.\n- Light mode preserved (sort dropdown white, modals white).\n\nAsset version: ?v=10 -> ?v=11.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bc6d5a8366f8c149f49659ec5baa555109697e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/1bc6d5a8366f8c149f49659ec5baa555109697e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/ce0f20fb42281ce36bf752065c9c37b4c11ceb17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/ce0f20fb42281ce36bf752065c9c37b4c11ceb17","node_id":"C_kwDOR2RjXNoAKGNlMGYyMGZiNDIyODFjZTM2YmY3NTIwNjVjOWMzN2I0YzExY2ViMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/441147c11ce8b29253fbd7c2dee4861c732e6548","sha":"441147c11ce8b29253fbd7c2dee4861c732e6548","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/441147c11ce8b29253fbd7c2dee4861c732e6548"}],"sha":"ce0f20fb42281ce36bf752065c9c37b4c11ceb17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/ce0f20fb42281ce36bf752065c9c37b4c11ceb17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/441147c11ce8b29253fbd7c2dee4861c732e6548/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T13:10:59Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T13:10:59Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"message":"v4.153: add ?screen=N deep-link support to all 4 portals\n\nEach portal (student / instructor / tenant_admin / super_admin) now parses\n?screen=N from the URL on load and calls goToScreen(N), enabling deep-links\nto specific screens.\n\nUsed by the Coda Contract Requirements tracker to land reviewers on the\nexact screen evidencing each requirement, instead of the portal root.\n\nNo effect if the parameter is missing or out of range — defaults to S1.\n\nVerified locally:\n- SA ?screen=2 -> Access Control\n- TA ?screen=11 -> Analytics & Reporting\n- Instructor ?screen=3 -> Python Skill (Topic mastery)\n- Student ?screen=8 -> Progress Map\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5a3aab7d8b7f260f4918066923dc255c27bb22a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/f5a3aab7d8b7f260f4918066923dc255c27bb22a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/441147c11ce8b29253fbd7c2dee4861c732e6548","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","typ