 PhD"},"message":"Docs (v4.152): refresh README, CHANGELOG, and per-portal READMEs\n\n- Root README: version 4.152; total screens 70 -> 46; corrected per-portal counts\n  (instructor 5, tenant_admin 12, super_admin 11; student 18 screens / 34 steps);\n  added a platform-wide note (shared filter/search/sort, sticky analytics nav,\n  heat-scale colors, modals); Create-a-School is now a modal; flagged stale\n  screenshots; refreshed the changelog summary.\n- CHANGELOG: new v4.152 entry (shared table-controls module; status-color\n  unification; create/delete/remove modals; TA 12 / SA 11 screen counts;\n  External Tooling vs Data Hub de-overlap; known follow-ups).\n- tenant_admin / super_admin / instructor READMEs: corrected screen counts +\n  current-layout scenario descriptions + version stamps.\n- student README: clarified 34 scenario steps across 18 screens.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"696a8e1cc3d3c89a50cb96f8f97a51e8b87057e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/696a8e1cc3d3c89a50cb96f8f97a51e8b87057e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/7febdcb79187d2421ca65bb3a2f4f27b1f8edcf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use