D"},"message":"S2 Option 3 role-change pattern (SA v4.140): clickable role pill + modal\n\nBrady chose Option 3 from a 4-pattern design exploration.\n- Drop the Actions column on the People tab (header + each row''s per-role action variants)\n- Each row''s role badge becomes a clickable button that opens a modal\n- Modal: radio picker over Student / Instructor / School Admin / Super Admin, with the current role pre-selected; Cancel + Confirm change buttons; wireframe alert simulates the change + audit log write\n- Body-level modal (display:none/flex) so it overlays any screen; JS handlers openRoleModal / closeRoleModal / confirmRoleChange\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f79142bb48a359c0d0920eae56cb33d43e47656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/1f79142bb48a359c0d0920eae56cb33d43e47656"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/b374605ef1891e08b1ca4a8088179ef806701b9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api