 (SA v4.139): drop sidebar, full-width main card\n\n- Remove Pending Invariant Breaches box (breaches are communicated/enforced inline by the table itself: H320 \"No owner assigned\" row, Jordan''s \"Downgrade (blocks min 2)\" disabled button, etc.)\n- Remove Recent access changes panel (audit log lives on S15 Logs; rbac.role.elevate / rbac.instructor.assign / tenant.school.create events are already there)\n- Collapse row + col-8 wrappers; main card is now full-width with mb-3. This alone should resolve most of the button/text spillover Brady flagged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfdcb9d2f89d2609bae1a0188b832038d545af60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/dfdcb9d2f89d2609bae1a0188b832038d545af60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/221a62064e9b0791416932b81161f36e7be8511e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/br