ol (People tab Instructor filter)\n- Course view is now view-only (removed Skill create/edit/archive - SA views, TA authors)\n\nRenumber survivors to contiguous 01-15 and rebuild the DEMO-only bar into 6 flows matching the toolbar:\nA Dashboard & Access Control / B Schools / C Analytics / D Platform Settings / E External Tools / F Logs.\nTOTAL_SCREENS 24 -> 15. All 15 screens + every goToScreen/breadcrumb verified.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0ad388290644683460b57d263ea9c51d13edd41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/d0ad388290644683460b57d263ea9c51d13edd41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/29a01d4a06c5af1847b1299e80466ee5ff38215a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/29a01d4a06c5af1847b1299e80466ee5ff38215a","node_id":"C_kwDOR2RjXNoAKDI5YTAxZDRhMDZjNWFmMTg0N2IxMjk5ZTgwNDY2ZWU1Zm