ession transcript / S08 Audit Trail\n  (283 lines)\n- Stripped S05 Learner profile drill-downs: 13 Topic-row onclick handlers +\n  \"View conversation logs\" button + stale caption\n- Renumbered S09-S17 -> S06-S14 via placeholder substitution (IDs + goToScreen):\n    S09 Access Denied -> S06\n    S10-S14 New Skill wizard -> S07-S11\n    S15 Analytics & Activity Log -> S12\n    S16 New Course -> S13\n    S17 Archived Skills -> S14\n- Meta-bar rebuilt: Flow A 01-06 (drill + deny), Flow B 07-11 (wizard),\n  Flow C 12 (reporting), Flow D 13-14 (course/archive mgmt)\n- Removed 3 orphaned JS filter functions (filterSessions / filterAuditEvents /\n  filterTranscript) whose target screens no longer exist\n- TOTAL_SCREENS 17 -> 14\n\nFile: 4638 -> ~4310 lines. Verified visually via Claude Preview MCP.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18f37a810e383540ac52b71cb59ad4d7727460e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/18f37a810e383540ac52b71cb59ad4d7727460e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/79cbc83dab3329541673b5c2410922c86b1c1460","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.g