earn, PhD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T18:15:52Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"message":"B1: Instructor — remove S06-S08, drill chain stops at S05 (v4.121)\n\nContract basis (verified):\n- \"Capture integrity\" terminology removed from Coda lock 23 May 2026\n  (plan file lines 52, 272)\n- JFT meeting 26 May confirmed: \"The conversation is not stored;\n  it''s just a single Q and a single A. Screen 05 is probably where\n  we stop because the conversation is not stored.\"\n- Brady confirmed scope decision today (26 May 2026)\n- §10.4 Audit Logging is satisfied at TA Activity Log (S15 Section 6)\n  + SA Logs (S7) surfaces — not at per-Instructor session level\n\nChanges:\n- Deleted S06 Conversation logs (76 lines)\n- Deleted S07 Session transcript (117 lines)\n- Deleted S08 Audit Trail (89 lines)\n- Renumbered S09 Access Denied -> S06 (id=\"screen-6\", id=\"s6-heading\",\n  aria-labelledby, id=\"main-6\", HTML comment)\n- Stripped S05 Topic-row drill-down: removed onclick=\"goToScreen(6)\" and\n  cursor:pointer from 13 Topic rows (rows are no longer clickable since\n  the conversation-log destination no longer exists)\n- Removed S05 \"View conversation logs\" floating-action button\n- Removed S05 stale instructional caption \"Click any row to open Sally''s\n  conversation logs for that Topic\"\n- Meta-bar: dropped 06 Conv logs / 07 Transcript / 08 Audit Trail step\n  buttons; renumbered 09 Access Denied -> 06\n- TOTAL_SCREENS bumped 9 -> 6 with full contract-scope rationale in code\n  comment for future readers\n\nPlan file Group B1 (Instructor portion) unblocked + executed. TA mirror\n(S06-S08) and SA mirror (S18-S20) still need the same treatment — those\nwill land in a follow-up commit per Brady''s directive scope.\n\nFile: 2286 -> 1999 lines (-287). Verified visually via Claude Preview MCP.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab5b99f8b2bbc86b676478c36bad77