uttons (Analytics inherited + ops screens)\n  instructor/index.html     6 MD buttons (Heatmap + Learner profile + Audit Trail exports)\n\nPer Brady''s standing rule: no \"For humans\"/\"For machines\" labels added —\nthe gap alone signals the grouping.\n\nVerified visually via Claude Preview MCP before push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aeacc13192b4cbf5d7c48d3830703de5edc27ccf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/aeacc13192b4cbf5d7c48d3830703de5edc27ccf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/8211554652014226c796e61dba00a401300e2c31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/8211554652014226c796e61dba00a401300e2c31","node_id":"C_kwDOR2RjXNoAKDgyMTE1NTQ2NTIwMTQyMjZjNzk2ZTYxZGJhMDBhNDAxMzAwZTJjMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/ef402be49a3ab20c948fc4708d7