ates to S27\n  (previously had no onclick)\n- New screen S27 \"Create a new School\":\n  - Breadcrumb: Super Admin Dashboard > Schools & Settings > New School\n  - Form: School name + School short-code (tenant slug) + Initial School Admin\n    dropdown (Assign later / Alice / Diane / James / Priya)\n  - Info alert: explains multi-tenant provisioning per SOW §16.3 row 8.6\n  - Floating actions: Cancel (-> S12) + Create School (wireframe alert + S12)\n- Meta-bar Flow C \"Access & People\" gains 27 New School step button\n- TOTAL_SCREENS bumped 14 -> 27 (also catches up the constant from the\n  earlier drill-chain mirror expansion that was missed)\n\nVerified visually via Claude Preview MCP before push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34c93f754753e1ad5ea1867a32a2191e9cffce60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/34c93f754753e1ad5ea1867a32a2191e9cffce60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/ef402be49a3ab20c948fc4708d7cf5fe341021c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/