rn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"message":"A5 (SA): clean SA S7 Logs to SA-level only (v4.125)\n\nPer JFT meeting 26 May / Brady decision: two separate log surfaces. SA log\nkeeps only SA-level events; TA log keeps only TA-level events (A5 TA done\nin commit a1029cc).\n\nStripped from SA S7 Logs:\n- Alice \"data.export.create\" event (TA-level — Alice is School Admin)\n- System \"session.start lnr_4a3b2c1d\" event (per-learner, too granular)\n- Charlie \"conversation_log.read\" event (Instructor-level)\n- Alice \"skill.deploy e135-oop-python\" event (TA-level)\n\nAdded 4 SA-level events to keep log informative:\n- Bob \"rbac.role.elevate Alice -> School Admin\" (matches event stripped\n  from TA log in commit a1029cc)\n- Bob \"rbac.instructor.assign Charlie -> E135\" (matches event stripped\n  from TA log)\n- Bob \"tenant.school.create school_of_health\" (matches the S27 New School\n  flow being built next in A6)\n- System (Compliance scanner) \"compliance.ferpa.scan.complete\"\n\nResult: 11 rows total, all SA-level (Bob''s RBAC + tenant ops, platform\ninfra/system events, JFT CSM incident response, compliance scans).\n\nVerified visually via Claude Preview MCP before push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4788c1e96bd3cd38afb19de33a306d079b484de1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/4788c1e96bd3cd38afb19de33a306d079b484de1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/ff7f9fd5cd115e6ace2c1d8bdc9f534fea3378e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user