}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/a1029cc01dbd76d2774a053114ee57efe5f5f713/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T17:27:38Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T17:27:38Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"message":"A5 (TA): clean TA S15 Activity Log to TA-level only (v4.145)\n\nPer JFT meeting 26 May / Brady decision: two separate log surfaces. TA log\nkeeps only TA-level events; SA log keeps only SA-level events.\n\nStripped from TA S15 Activity Log:\n- Bob (Super Admin) \"Elevate role\" event (SA-level RBAC action)\n- Bob (Super Admin) \"Assign instructor Charlie -> E135\" event (SA-level)\n- Bob (Super Admin) \"Add instructor Noor -> E010\" event (SA-level)\n- \"Alice / Update branding / Tenant settings\" event (branding moved to\n  SA Schools & Settings in v4.114, so this is now an SA-level surface)\n\nAdded 4 TA-level events to keep log informative:\n- Create Course E135 (matches the new A2a flow)\n- Create Course E010 (historical, completes the Course-creation history)\n- Archive Skill pyt-000 Legacy Python Basics (matches S17 demo data)\n- Archive Skill sql-001 Deprecated SQL Skill (matches S17 demo data)\n\nFilter chips updated:\n- Old: All (11) / Create (1) / Edit (3) / Deploy (3) / Role changes (2)\n- New: All (11) / Create (3) / Edit (3) / Deploy (3) / Archive (2)\n  (dropped \"Role changes\" chip; added \"Archive\" chip)\n\nVerified visually via Claude Preview MCP before push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fb74a30b0d64df187804823fae0acb51175cdf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/2fb74a30b0d64df187804823fae0acb51175cdf9"},"url":"https://ap