tps://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/ee7328b69dbba5608a425b497594782733903193/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T17:19:28Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T17:19:28Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"message":"A3: TA S15 — Engagement report row improvements (v4.144)\n\nPer Brady decision: improve the existing Engagement report row in\nS15 Program Reports (option C in walkthrough).\n\n- Expanded the description to list all engagement metrics included:\n  Active learners · Sessions · Submissions · Time-on-Topic · Completion\n  rate · Weekly retention · Active-days/learner\n- Added inline metric preview row showing 6 key engagement numbers\n  (90 learners · 680 sessions/wk · 2,340 submissions/wk · 14.2 min\n  avg session · 84% completion · 76% W/W retention) so the TA sees\n  the actual data inline without needing to export first\n- Improved Filters preview text: \"Period: Last 30 days · Scope: 4\n  Courses · 7 Skills · All Topics\" (more specific than the old generic\n  \"Last 30 days · All Skills · All topics\")\n- Submissions + Topic-mastery rows kept compact for contrast — Engagement\n  is the featured report\n\nVerified visually via Claude Preview MCP before push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfc5c21f3ec56c909352b32636ac2c59d1cb4d02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/bfc5c21f3ec56c909352b32636ac2c59d1cb4d02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/ee7328b69dbba5608a425b497594782733903193","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/ee7328b69dbba5608a425b497594782733903193","node_id":"C_kwDOR2RjXNoAKGVlNzMyOGI2OWRiYmE1NjA4YTQyNWI0OTc1OTQ3ODI3MzM5MDMxOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commit/ae9a5645dc45f7b60f30036979b12f3a444a6214","sha":"ae9a5645dc45f7b60f30036979b12f3a444a6214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/ae9a5645dc45f7b60f30036979b12f3a444a6214"}],"sha":"ee7328b69dbba5608a425b497594782733903193","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/ee7328b69dbba5608a425b497594782733903193"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/commits/ae9a5645dc45f7b60f30036979b12f3a444a6214/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T17:14:13Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T17:14:13Z","email":"brady.redfearn@wgu.edu","name":"Brady Redfearn, PhD"},"message":"A2a + A2b: TA New Course + Archived Skills screens (v4.143)\n\nPer JFT meeting 26 May + Brady decisions: Courses are organizational folders\nfor Skills; TA needs a dedicated creation flow and a managed Archive view\ndistinct from the in-place Archive button on Skill cards.\n\nTA S1 toolbar — added 2 new buttons next to `+ New Skill` and `Analytics`:\n- `+ New Course` (btn-outline-primary, create_new_folder icon) -> S16\n- `Archived Skills` (btn-outline-primary, archive icon) -> S17\n\nNew screen S16 \"Create a new Course\":\n- Simple form: Course Code (text) + Course Title (text)\n- Floating actions: Cancel + Create Course (wireframe alert returns to S1)\n- Brady (verbatim): \"We need a button at the top for that function as well\n  with a simple form that includes the Course Code and Name\"\n\nNew screen S17 \"Archived Skills\":\n- Table of archived Skills with Restore + Permanently delete actions per row\n- Demo data: 2 example archived Skills (Legacy Python Basics, Deprecated SQL)\n- Columns: Skill / Parent Course / Owner / Archived date / Last activity / Actions\n- Info alert: 180-day retention before permanent delete (configurable per\n  School in Super Admin settings)\n- Two-step lifecycle per Brady: Archive first, then delete later\n\nMeta-bar: added Flow D \"Course & Archive Management\" with S16 + S17 step buttons.\nTOTAL_SCREENS bumped 15 -> 17.\n\nVerified visually via Claude Preview MCP before push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9f6cab7b0fd40cc682b70defca19eda58d646fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/trees/d9f6cab7b0fd40cc682b70defca19eda58d646fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brady-wgu/SkillProof/git/commits/ae9a5645dc45f7b60f30036979b12f3a444a6214","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266849667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brady-wgu","id":266849667,"login":"brady-wgu","node_id":"U_kgDOD-fNgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brady-wgu/repos","site_admin"