ail":"henrydegrasse@gmail.com","name":"HenryDeGrasse"},"message":"fix(e2e): resolve 13 flaky E2E test failures on CI\n\nRoot causes and fixes:\n\n1. Strict mode violations (locator.or() resolving to multiple elements):\n   - ai-deep.spec.ts, validation.spec.ts, team-deep.spec.ts: .or()\n     chains matched multiple coexisting elements. Fixed with .first()\n     where alternatives can coexist.\n\n2. Missing RCDO links causing lock validation to block:\n   - lifecycle.spec.ts, scope-change.spec.ts, validation.spec.ts:\n     commits added without RCDO link, so pre-lock hard validation\n     blocked the lock flow. Added { selectRcdo: true }.\n\n3. Wrong Playwright API:\n   - navigation.spec.ts: getByLabelText → getByLabel (Playwright, not\n     Testing Library).\n\n4. Stale assertions:\n   - golden-path.spec.ts: nav link count 5 → 7 (routes were added).\n   - ai-flows.spec.ts: insights toggle starts collapsed, not expanded.\n\n5. Timeouts too short for CI runners:\n   - playwright.config.ts: CI-aware timeouts (60s test, 15s expect,\n     15s action) vs local (30s/5s/10s).\n   - commit-crud.spec.ts: delete dialog timeout 3s → 10s.","tree":{"sha":"0fcd9277afb547b66db3f4701831ae064a1e53e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HenryDeGrasse/weekly-commit/git/trees/0fcd9277afb547b66db3f4701831ae064a1e53e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HenryDeGrasse/weekly-commit/git/commits/1421fa475a809f7c92be4563c7b30dfaa329f83e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92115824?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HenryDeGrasse","id":92115