b.com/users/HenryDeGrasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HenryDeGrasse/weekly-commit/commits/90792d76a978ec2c05642dd3f98fcc114d011268/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-01T03:43:48Z","email":"henrydegrasse@gmail.com","name":"HenryDeGrasse"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-01T03:43:48Z","email":"henrydegrasse@gmail.com","name":"HenryDeGrasse"},"message":"docs: update model references from Claude to GPT-4.1-nano\n\nProduction model switched from anthropic/claude-sonnet-4 to\nopenai/gpt-4.1-nano (25x cheaper, 100% schema compliance, 95% eval\npass rate). Updated all documentation to reflect the current model:\n\n- README.md: architecture diagram, tech stack table, RAG pipeline\n- architecture.md: system overview diagram, environment variables\n- ai-eval-roadmap.md: context line\n- ai-sample-outputs.md: generation methodology, RAG section, eval table\n\nHistorical decision docs (approach_thoughts_decisions.md) retain Claude\nreferences as they document the research process, not the current stack.","tree":{"sha":"aecb0657007bbc613c0d165cdf49eb51ea8e8b4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HenryDeGrasse/weekly-commit/git/trees/aecb0657007bbc613c0d165cdf49eb51ea8e8b4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HenryDeGrasse/weekly-commit/git/commits/90792d76a978ec2c05642dd3f98fcc114d011268","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92115824?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HenryDeGrasse","id":92115824,"login":"HenryDeGrasse","node_id":"U_kgDOBX2TcA","organizations_