users/HenryDeGrasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HenryDeGrasse","id":92115824,"login":"HenryDeGrasse","node_id":"U_kgDOBX2TcA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HenryDeGrasse/weekly-commit/commits/b79716f7c4b6724bf47bd79e58f8b24a421c9773/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-30T00:52:36Z","email":"henrydegrasse@gmail.com","name":"HenryDeGrasse"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-30T00:52:36Z","email":"henrydegrasse@gmail.com","name":"HenryDeGrasse"},"message":"feat(rag): add Voyage AI embeddings with dual-index A/B testing\n\nEmbeddingService:\n- Route voyage-* models to api.voyageai.com/v1 using VOYAGE_API_KEY\n- OpenAI models continue through OpenRouter unchanged\n- Add isVoyageAvailable() availability check\n- getDimensions() extended: voyage-4/lite → 1024, voyage-4-large → 2048\n- New @Value params: ai.voyage.api-key, ai.voyage.base-url\n\nPineconeClient:\n- Primary index dimension now configurable via ai.embedding.dimensions\n- Add weekly-commit-voyage secondary index (1024d) with lazy host resolution\n- Add upsertVoyage() and queryVoyage() for the secondary index\n- Refactor upsert/query to shared upsertToHost/executeQueryOnHost helpers\n- Backward-compat test constructor preserved\n\nSemanticIndexService:\n- Inject ExperimentService; dual-write chunks to voyage index when\n  embedding-model experiment is enabled and Voyage API key is present\n\nSemanticQueryService:\n- Check embedding-model experiment assignment per query\n- Treatment (voyage-4): embed with Voyage + query voyage index (dense-only)\n- Control: existing hybrid dense+sparse path unchanged\n- queryMultiHop extended with useVoyageIndex flag\n\napplication.yml:\n- Add ai.voyage.* config block\n- Add ai.pinecone.voyage-index-name / voyage-dimensions\n- Enable embedding-model experiment 50/50: OpenAI small vs voyage-4","tree":{"sha":"0d459c1fdf0f51117fa400d7031116429534cc3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HenryDeGrasse/weekly-commit/git/trees/0d459c1fdf0f51117fa400d7031116429534cc3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HenryDeGrasse/weekly-commit/git/commits/b79716f7c4b6724bf47bd79e58f8b24a421c9773","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92115824?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HenryDeGrasse","id":92115824,"login":"HenryDeGrasse","node_id":"U_kgDOBX2TcA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HenryDeGrasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HenryDeGrasse/weekly-commit/commit/b79716f7c4b6724bf47bd79e58f8b24a421c9773","node_id":"C_kwDOR2Ry-doAKGI3OTcxNmY3YzRiNjcyNGJmNDdiZDc5ZTU4ZjhiMjRhNDIxYzk3NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com