ados: actualización condicional atómica CANCELACION_PENDIENTE -> CANCELADA;\n  cualquier otro estado es no-op registrado; CANCELADA repetida es idempotente.\n- Las tres transiciones filtran también por tenant y proyecto del evento.\n- fondos_comprometidos exige un compromiso confirmado (movimiento_id y monto positivo).\n- Matriz, design, spec y tareas actualizados; 18 pruebas con PostgreSQL real.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb6bdfa3b2d9c75fb42bdbb4992c3a578a64328f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/bb6bdfa3b2d9c75fb42bdbb4992c3a578a64328f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/a34c0983a7ce7c3ecf82cf5f9db737a1e910197b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/a34c0983a7ce7c3ecf82cf5f9db737a1e910197b","node_id":"C_kwDOR2UC2NoAKGEzNGMwOTgzYTdjZTdjM2VjZjgyY2Y1ZjlkYjcz