an una actualización\ncondicional atómica (UPDATE ... WHERE id AND estado IN lista blanca): un\nevento tardío ya no resucita una OC cancelada/recibida a EMITIDA ni degrada\nuna EMITIDA a ERROR_FINANZAS. Matriz de estados en oc-estados.ts; el no-op\nse registra con el estado actual sin modificarlo. Sin cambios de payloads,\ncontratos, Finanzas, Contabilidad, routing keys, retry ni DLQ.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2bde48edeaeaca27e85d31129118770c4f670cfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/2bde48edeaeaca27e85d31129118770c4f670cfd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/8b86dac755a4e77128a821a02e44246a1dc9c50c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/8b86dac755a4e77128a821a02e44246a1dc9c50c","node_id":"C_kwDOR2UC2NoAKDhiODZkYWM3NTVhNGU3NzEyOGE4MjFhMDJlNDQyNDZhMWRjOWM1