.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/8afb4d161ed77be48677ad09690390dd9d88a4f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T03:24:34Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T03:24:34Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"message":"fix(finanzas): blindar compromiso y liberación de OC (concurrencia y orden de eventos)\n\nPrimer PR del change blindar-compromiso-oc-concurrencia-y-orden-eventos.\nUn único punto de escritura (compromiso-oc.ts) para HTTP, oc_creada,\noc_cancelada y partida_comprometida: advisory lock por tenant+OC, inserción\natómica sobre un índice único parcial, tombstone de cancelación anterior a\nla creación y UPDATE condicional del saldo. Migración con comprobación\nprevia de duplicados y rollback; RLS forzado en el tombstone.\nSolo Finanzas: sin cambios en Compras, Contabilidad, #182, routing keys,\nretry ni DLQ.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49258792a65b09a04f74ef5c5c6b8840ebf5e8b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/49258792a65b09a04f74ef5c5c6b8840ebf5e8b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/8afb4d161ed77be48677ad09690390dd9d88a4f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"uns