r lo que el smoke esta rojo\ndesde el deploy de #173 (test obsoleto, no regresion).\n\n- smoke: Ventas fuera de los modulos totalmente bloqueados; comprueba Clientes sin\n  proyecto y el aviso de Cotizaciones/Facturas; unica peticion permitida sin proyecto\n  = GET /api/v1/ventas/clientes (metodo + pathname exactos, sin prefijos)\n- ventas-alcance.ts + pruebas unitarias; pruebas hermeticas de App y VentasView\n- SDD: proposal/design/tasks del change fix-clientes-sin-proyecto-y-edicion-rfc y\n  delta de ci-playwright-smoke-post-deploy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71e28b288e65444303da370f5c1006733927d815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/71e28b288e65444303da370f5c1006733927d815"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/837f26d8a9e03824683b17ee91a539ac21ffb3cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GRo