-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/b3530be4db7587c6a36fe8ed8a5afadb16a35f3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T06:03:06Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T06:03:06Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"message":"fix(compras): habilitar y forzar RLS en la propia migración de outbox_eventos\n\nAntes la política solo se creaba con el workflow manual de RLS, así que\nentre la migración y ese workflow la tabla existía sin RLS (como ocurrió\ncon eventos_procesados en Almacén).\n\n- La migración 20260925130000_outbox_eventos ahora ejecuta ENABLE y FORCE\n  ROW LEVEL SECURITY y crea la política rls_outbox_eventos_context.\n- El workflow manual pasa a ser solo reaplicación y verificación.\n- Prueba: ejecuta únicamente la migración en un esquema temporal revertido\n  y comprueba RLS habilitado y forzado, política, aislamiento con un rol\n  sin privilegios (incluido GUC vacío) y que sus sentencias coinciden con\n  el bloque OUTBOX_EVENTOS de rls-policies.sql.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47957f3eb741f293974514a23b1496a1b61115de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/47957f3eb741f293974514a23b1496a1b61115de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/b3530be4db7587c6a36fe8ed8a5afadb16a35f3a","veri