r_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/a4aac20400914dbec0391e9bc54cc0c708b8ba82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T05:59:15Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T05:59:15Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"message":"fix(almacen): cola .v3 de recepciones de OC sin TTL y con dead-letter\n\nLa cola .v2 heredó el x-message-ttl de 24 h del EventBus sin dead-letter.\nComo el outbox de Compras marca PUBLICADO al confirmar el broker, un\nmensaje sin consumir más de 24 h (Almacén detenido) se perdía sin pasar\npor la DLQ.\n\n- Cola .v3 sin TTL y con dead-letter a su .dlq; se conservan .retry y .dlq.\n- La .v2 ya no se consume y se conserva sin borrar para rollback.\n- No se modifica @bocam/event-bus (queueArguments con x-message-ttl undefined).\n- scripts/ops/almacen-recepcion-oc/topologia.js: verificar y desvincular la\n  .v2 (solo el binding; se niega si .v3 no está operativa o .v2 tiene mensajes).\n- Pruebas con RabbitMQ real: argumentos, retención con Almacén detenido,\n  expirado a DLQ, retry, rechazo definitivo, bindings simultáneos.\n- Guía de operación y rollback en docs/operacion/almacen-cola-recepcion-oc-v3.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tr