an.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T04:25:57Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"message":"feat(compras): evento autosuficiente desde datos persistidos y sin eventos incompletos\n\nRediseño de #169 por instrucción del titular: todo ítem inventariable con\ninsumo_id produce un evento completo; nunca se publica uno incompleto y el\ndespacho no depende de Gerencia Técnica.\n\n- Migración compatible: columnas opcionales de snapshot en ordenes_compra_items\n  (clave, descripción, unidad, categoría).\n- convertir-oc guarda el snapshot al crear la OC; si el catálogo no responde, la\n  OC se crea igual con snapshot pendiente.\n- La recepción usa el snapshot persistido; si falta lo completa fuera de la\n  transacción y lo persiste; si no puede, responde 503\n  SNAPSHOT_INSUMO_NO_DISPONIBLE antes de escribir nada (sin recepción, evento\n  ni cambios en la OC).\n- El alta del outbox y el despachador validan que el payload sea completo: un\n  payload incompleto nunca va al broker ni se marca PUBLICADO (queda en ERROR\n  con causa PAYLOAD_INCOMPLETO, sin pasar por la DLQ).\n- La reemisión reconstruye el payload solo con datos persistidos conservando el\n  event_id, o responde 409 SNAPSHOT_INCOMPLETO sin republicar.\n- Pruebas: Gerencia Técnica caída, inventario inexistente, evento completo tras\n  reinicio, reproceso sin duplicados (test entre Compras y Almacén) y ningún\n  evento incompleto marcado como publicado. CI las ejecuta.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e60c2a364d4296fdfbfae2c33f44847b66ae2332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/e60c2a364d4296fdfbfae2c33f44847b66ae2332"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/eb71d806f6699694af45256286fba8045c06215c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/eb71d806f6699694af45256286fba8045c06215c","node_id":"C_kwDOR2UC2NoAKGViNzFkODA2ZjY2OTk2OTRhZjQ1MjU2Mjg2ZmJhODA0NWMwNjIxNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/6024a513c4ff778feb57101654a12e6de2c55184","sha":"6024a513c4ff778feb57101654a12e6de2c55184","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/6024a513c4ff778feb57101654a12e6de2c55184"}],"sha":"eb71d806f6699694af45256286fba8045c06215c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/eb71d806f6699694af45256286fba8045c06215c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/6024a513c4ff778feb57101654a12e6de2c55184/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:59:59Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T04:17:37Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"message":"feat(compras): outbox transaccional y evento compras.recepcion_oc_registrada.v1\n\nPR 3 del change fix-ingresos-almacen-por-recepcion-oc. Depende de #167 (bus) y\nse despliega después de #168 (Almacén).\n\n- Cada recepción de OC escribe su evento en outbox_eventos en la MISMA\n  transacción: si el outbox falla, la recepción no queda registrada; con el bus\n  caído, la recepción se registra y el evento queda PENDIENTE.\n- Contrato versionado compras.recepcion_oc_registrada.v1: event_id, versión,\n  contexto, orden y recepción, estado resultante de la OC e ítems con\n  recepcion_item_id, insumo_id y snapshot (clave, descripción, unidad, categoría;\n  texto libre con su descripción y unidad). Solo lo recibido en esa recepción.\n- Despachador: FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, publicación confirmada (publishConfirmed),\n  marca PUBLICADO solo tras la confirmación del broker, espera exponencial y\n  estado ERROR con log al agotar intentos. Una caída entre la confirmación y el\n  marcado republica con el mismo event_id. Al arrancar retoma lo pendiente.\n- Snapshot resuelto en la petición con el token del usuario (el despachador no\n  tiene token); si Gerencia Técnica no responde, la recepción no se bloquea.\n- RLS de outbox_eventos: política única con la variable interna del despachador\n  y comparación de los GUC con NULLIF, para no fallar con un GUC vacío en\n  conexiones reutilizadas del pool.\n- Endpoint de reemisión restringido a admin y procurement; otro tenant recibe 404.\n- Se retira la publicación de compras.oc_recibida_total (sin ítems, solo al\n  cerrar la OC), reemplazada por el evento nuevo.\n- CI: backend-e2e ejecuta las pruebas del outbox.\n\nPruebas primero: el módulo outbox no existía (rojo); ahora pasan 14 pruebas de\ncomportamiento y 3 con RabbitMQ real, y las suites de Compras que CI ejecuta.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c060d71f8222f6ee44d69680358169687174321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/3c060d71f8222f6ee44d69680358169687174321"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/6024a513c4ff778feb57101654a12e6de2c55184","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/6024a513c4ff778feb57101654a12e6de2c55184","node_id":"C_kwDOR2UC2NoAKDYwMjRhNTEzYzRmZjc3OGZlYjU3MTAxNjU0YTEyZTZkZTJjNTUxODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/be91d4bbcfd3c4b7587bebfee97679f30ee83d14","sha":"be91d4bbcfd3c4b7587bebfee97679f30ee83d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/be91d4bbcfd3c4b7587bebfee97679f30ee83d14"}],"sha":"6024a513c4ff778feb57101654a12e6de2c55184","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/6024a513c4ff778feb57101654a12e6de2c55184"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/be91d4bbcfd3c4b7587bebfee97679f30ee83d14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T04:17:30Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T04:17:30Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"message":"feat(almacen): exigir el snapshot completo de todo ítem con insumo_id\n\nUn ítem inventariable debe viajar con clave, descripción, unidad y categoría,\nexista o no el ítem en el inventario. El resultado del procesamiento ya no\ndepende del estado de Almacén: un evento sin snapshot completo es inválido\n(SNAPSHOT_INCOMPLETO, no reintentable). El publicador (Compras) nunca lo emite\ncomo procesable.\n\nPruebas primero: la de \"snapshot incompleto aunque el inventario exista\" fallaba\nantes; se añade también la de \"inventario inexistente se crea solo con el\nsnapshot del evento\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7b4319e50a1891410dbbb406643fbe4a2ce3ebb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/d7b4319e50a1891410dbbb406643fbe4a2ce3ebb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/be91d4bbcfd3c4b7587bebfee97679f30ee83d14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/be91d4bbcfd3c4b7587bebfee97679f30ee83d14","node_id":"C_kwDOR2UC2NoAKGJlOTFkNGJiY2ZkM2M0Yjc1ODdiZWJmZWU5NzY3OWYzMGVlODNkMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/2801ce08bc444313d6777e7bb7365295e22eca4c","sha":"2801ce08bc444313d6777e7bb7365295e22eca4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/2801ce08bc444313d6777e7bb7365295e22eca4c"}],"sha":"be91d4bbcfd3c4b7587bebfee97679f30ee83d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/be91d4bbcfd3c4b7587bebfee97679f30ee83d14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/2801ce08bc444313d6777e7bb7365295e22eca4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:41:53Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:41:53Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"message":"feat(almacen): consumir compras.recepcion_oc_registrada.v1 con idempotencia y DLQ\n\nPR 2 del change fix-ingresos-almacen-por-recepcion-oc. Depende de #167 (bus).\n\n- Handler nuevo: una transacción por evento (todos los ítems o ninguno), errores\n  propagados al bus, idempotencia por event_id (tabla eventos_procesados) y por\n  recepcion_id + recepcion_item_id (restricción única en movimientos_almacen),\n  bloqueo por insumo para eventos concurrentes y stock por incremento atómico.\n- Ítems sin insumo_id: no inventariables, solo un registro informativo con la\n  trazabilidad de la recepción.\n- Formato antiguo, versión no soportada, contexto inconsistente, cantidades o\n  snapshot inválidos: NonRetryableError, directo a la DLQ.\n- Suscripción en cola nueva .v2 con reintentos y DLQ; las colas actuales no se\n  modifican y sus handlers siguen igual.\n- /health sigue siendo prueba de vida; nuevo /ready (503 con detalle si falla\n  la base o el bus).\n- Migración, política RLS de eventos_procesados y cliente Prisma regenerado.\n- CI: backend-e2e aplica el esquema de Almacén, compila y ejecuta las pruebas de\n  recepciones (Almacén no se probaba en CI).\n\nPruebas primero: 9 de 9 fallaban antes de implementar; ahora pasan, junto con\nuna prueba extremo a extremo con RabbitMQ real.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0308b4e8f3c43aa4570953ac5fb90d3aff39d647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/0308b4e8f3c43aa4570953ac5fb90d3aff39d647"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/2801ce08bc444313d6777e7bb7365295e22eca4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/2801ce08bc444313d6777e7bb7365295e22eca4c","node_id":"C_kwDOR2UC2NoAKDI4MDFjZTA4YmM0NDQzMTNkNjc3N2U3YmI3MzY1Mjk1ZTIyZWNhNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/c087bf4a33f75556d57d90461f56ce1ef517a598","sha":"c087bf4a33f75556d57d90461f56ce1ef517a598","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/c087bf4a33f75556d57d90461f56ce1ef517a598"}],"sha":"2801ce08bc444313d6777e7bb7365295e22eca4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/2801ce08bc444313d6777e7bb7365295e22eca4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/c087bf4a33f75556d57d90461f56ce1ef517a598/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:33:57Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:33:57Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"message":"feat(event-bus): NonRetryableError e isReady()\n\nAmpliaciones que necesita el consumidor de Almacén, con pruebas primero (rojo\nantes de implementar):\n\n- NonRetryableError: un handler con retry/deadLetter puede marcar un error como\n  no reintentable (formato o versión no soportados); el mensaje va directo a la\n  DLQ con un solo intento.\n- isReady(): verdadero solo con conexión vigente y todas las suscripciones con\n  consumidor activo, para construir un /ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"139ea9af028116882bc3a9d4c44f1f8b54788007","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/139ea9af028116882bc3a9d4c44f1f8b54788007"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/c087bf4a33f75556d57d90461f56ce1ef517a598","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/c087bf4a33f75556d57d90461f56ce1ef517a598","node_id":"C_kwDOR2UC2NoAKGMwODdiZjRhMzNmNzU1NTZkNTdkOTA0NjFmNTZjZTFlZjUxN2E1OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/af980af1fa8c884a2a621497f804bb8784613cbe","sha":"af980af1fa8c884a2a621497f804bb8784613cbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/af980af1fa8c884a2a621497f804bb8784613cbe"}],"sha":"c087bf4a33f75556d57d90461f56ce1ef517a598","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/c087bf4a33f75556d57d90461f56ce1ef517a598"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/af980af1fa8c884a2a621497f804bb8784613cbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:28:07Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:28:07Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"German"},"message":"feat(event-bus): publicación confirmada, event_id y reintentos con DLQ opt-in\n\nPR 1 del change fix-ingresos-almacen-por-recepcion-oc. Todo es opt-in: las\nsuscripciones y publicaciones existentes no cambian.\n\n- publishConfirmed: canal de confirmación y mandatory; se resuelve solo cuando\n  el broker confirma y se rechaza sin canal, sin confirmación, por timeout o\n  cuando el mensaje no tiene cola enlazada.\n- event_id / event_version en BocamEvent; publish asigna un UUID si falta y lo\n  envía como messageId y header.\n- SubscriptionOptions.retry y deadLetter: reintento con espera vía <cola>.retry,\n  contador x-attempt y <cola>.dlq con el payload original, el motivo y un log\n  de error. Los mensajes ininterpretables van directo a la DLQ. El mensaje\n  original solo se confirma tras la confirmación de la republicación.\n- Procedimiento de reproceso en docs/operacion/event-bus-dlq-reproceso.md.\n\nPruebas primero: 7 de 8 fallaban antes de implementar; ahora pasan las 8 y la\nprueba existente. Los servicios que importan el bus compilan sin errores.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3113be63a8e469240925debfdac7e1339a6f3df3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/3113be63a8e469240925debfdac7e1339a6f3df3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/af980af1fa8c884a2a621497f804bb8784613cbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/af980af1fa8c884a2a621497f804bb8784613cbe","node_id":"C_kwDOR2UC2NoAKGFmOTgwYWYxZmE4Yzg4NGEyYTYyMTQ5N2Y4MDRiYjg3ODQ2MTNjYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commit/1e86d086b61435a4b8b2b29914488258df76d051","sha":"1e86d086b61435a4b8b2b29914488258df76d051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/1e86d086b61435a4b8b2b29914488258df76d051"}],"sha":"af980af1fa8c884a2a621497f804bb8784613cbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/af980af1fa8c884a2a621497f804bb8784613cbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237505529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GRojas-n8n","id":237505529,"login":"GRojas-n8n","node_id":"U_kgDODigL-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/1e86d086b61435a4b8b2b29914488258df76d051/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:21:07Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"GRojas-vibe-coding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:21:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(openspec): evidencia y decisiones del change de recepciones de OC (#166)\n\nIncorpora al change fix-ingresos-almacen-por-recepcion-oc el informe de\nevidencia de solo lectura del 2026-09-25 y las decisiones del titular. Solo\ndocumentación; no toca código, servicios ni producción.\n\nEvidencia: los logs cubren ~4 h sin recepciones; producción está vacía tras la\npurga; desde 2026-07-21 hubo a lo sumo 2 recepciones (ya purgadas) y Almacén no\ncreó ningún movimiento. No hay datos vivos afectados; el riesgo es prospectivo.\n\nDecisiones incorporadas: contrato versionado compras.recepcion_oc_registrada.v1\ncon snapshot autosuficiente e idempotencia por event_id y recepcion_item_id;\nítems sin insumo no inventariables; colas .v2 solo para las suscripciones\nnuevas; outbox transaccional dentro del change (atomicidad, reintento, marcado\ntras confirmación del broker y recuperación tras reinicios); publicación\nconfirmada en el bus; conciliación histórica bloqueada sin autorización.\n\nAbre el change independiente auditar-consumidores-eventbus-sin-perdida-silenciosa\npara los demás consumidores del bus, sin ampliar el anterior.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"803481a9006771328bd761016678f6cd4f22c5c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/803481a9006771328bd761016678f6cd4f22c5c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/1e86d086b61435a4b8b2b29914488258df76d051","verification":{"payload":"tree 803481a9006771328bd761016678f6cd4f22c5c0\nparent 3bde3187fe1440748d78611d7d9cdff33b10511d\nauthor GRojas-vibe-coding <german.rg@outlook.com> 1790306467 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790306467 -0600\n\ndocs(openspec): evidencia y decisiones del change de recepciones de OC (#166)\n\nIncorpora al change fix-ingresos-almacen-por-recepcion-oc el informe de\nevidencia de solo lectura del 2026-09-25 y las decisiones del titular. Solo\ndocumentación; no toca código, servicios ni producción.\n\nEvidencia: los logs cubren ~4 h sin recepciones; producción está vacía tras la\npurga; desde 2026-07-21 hubo a lo sumo 2 recepciones (ya purgadas) y Almacén no\ncreó ningún movimiento. No hay datos vivos afectados; el riesgo es prospectivo.\n\nDecisiones incorporadas: contrato versionado compras.recepcion_oc_registrada.v1\ncon snapshot autosuficiente e idempotencia por event_id y recepcion_item_id;\nítems sin insumo no inventariables; colas .v2 solo para las suscripciones\nnuevas; outbox transaccional dentro del change (atomicidad, reintento, marcado\ntras confirmación del broker y recuperación tras reinicios); publicación\nconfirmada en el bus; conciliación histórica bloqueada sin autorización.\n\nAbre el change independiente auditar-consumidores-eventbus-sin-perdida-silenciosa\npara los demás consumidores del bus, sin ampliar el anterior.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anth