d{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GRojas-n8n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/commits/203d453319531246dbabbffc0bc9f2d0da63920c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:40:53Z","email":"german.rg@outlook.com","name":"GRojas-vibe-coding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:40:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(openspec): migrar asistencia-qr-segura y detener qr-doble-scan (lote 5b) (#163)\n\nLote de seguridad de migrar-catalogo-openspec-vigente. Solo documentación.\n\n- asistencia-qr-segura: Purpose redactado a mano y contrato idéntico a HEAD\n  palabra por palabra (980 tokens). Cada requisito se trazó contra código y\n  pruebas (rol y sesión, token, proyecto, cooldown, geofencing, doble-scan,\n  RLS) sin diferencias; la tabla queda en inventory.md.\n- qr-doble-scan queda detenida: exige 200 OK para el tercer escaneo idempotente\n  y el handler responde 201, sin prueba que lo cubra. Se registra como change\n  funcional separado; la spec no se corrige durante la migración.\n- Specs válidas 99 -> 100; inválidas 64 -> 63. Actualiza validation-debt.md.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47a6979be15bf7cfc1776a8356eeb52d2978d566","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/trees/47a6979be15bf7cfc1776a8356eeb52d2978d566"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GRojas-n8n/ERP-Modular-Bocam/git/commits/203d453319531246dbabbffc0bc9f2d0da63920c","verification":{"payload":"tree 47a6979be15bf7cfc1776a8356eeb52d2978d566\nparent ba4d3b0ad9300d11b6eeda033b0aa594abf7fe2f\nauthor GRojas-vibe-coding <german.rg@outlook.com> 1790304053 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790304053 -0600\n\ndocs(openspec): migrar asistencia-qr-segura y detener qr-doble-scan (lote 5b) (#163)\n\nLote de seguridad de migrar-catalogo-openspec-vigente. Solo documentación.\n\n- asistencia-qr-segura: Purpose redactado a mano y contrato idéntico a HEAD\n  palabra por palabra (980 tokens). Cada requisito se trazó contra código y\n  pruebas (rol y sesión, token, proyecto, cooldown, geofencing, doble-scan,\n  RLS) sin diferencias; la tabla queda en inventory.md.\n- qr-doble-scan queda detenida: exige 200 OK para el tercer escaneo idempotente\n  y el handler responde 201, sin prueba que lo cubra. Se registra como change\n  funcional separado; la spec no se corrige durante la migración.\n- Specs válidas 99 -> 100; inválidas 64 -> 63. Actualiza validation-debt.md.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtd81CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQpoQAID7Bvaqtd+xsKmzfa34W0My\nvmhHDwqRB9p43lMsNl9FzQQAYWmxKQu1dmgl7eGU8MnEbuza0ePxyCJ3QxK4GJPF\n1XPQtqoXO+dSCSwoP0INPCadvHe/T2j6WBE0x+kydu/g2Qnb9/kcUSLi8f2kXJhS\nRgZO/DfjznLMf8HYI8dGDsCFQdBAsEvC2AyVD10KwatADDQwH7WyBnMK28Oqfu2q\nsEiFWyZhPDQoXnS8jPj6oG60SX/UQXplELH3f2KcHhVrLMj3B7IBPkzAWODWRlYf\nt8z3u4G1l3t6NdfyegRhXFTTO4jjv4TD9SG4hJ/SK/S/3ojLLrbHOjRLbTWb4IC4\npJncf8GT/Wbkan3DlPfJnpSPFWux2rYunoj5To0T8KPJlFpeFO7udUJwSa+uJqHu\n/HBz1Mb973J0WS3/iQKtNgw97OhyIGkqwHVKdcddKdXMHk/QnI9dv92bJbmqJOmO\n2Joc76v6SVcVTupO+hWYFsvjHJZlezLUoqFi7Oh8fOJoJU6kUeMm45vmU1KfO6XS\nNsCfTYcbmTLK0N5VIR6N8ZccII757OiZhwJXFIjuic5vryS7TI33B54PfEV5VIxl\nqjSlhBoRxzT4atQbkV6Du8R/NVRN6RedG8TzUw2cAYP/gK1NWIzjWHDEPcuIlQSs\nDvwKVDj6rCNwGR0GuWjl\n=+kQV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T02:40:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravata