s/mtdkjarvis/jarvis-mission-control/commits/0f82e23c2e26fe9756625e0d22790e5e899bd1ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T06:21:09Z","email":"thomas.willner@gmail.com","name":"Thomas Willner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T06:21:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gateway): use /health instead of /api/health for health probes (#481)\n\nThe gateway health probe in `buildGatewayProbeUrl()` hardcodes `/api/health`\nas the probe endpoint, but the OpenClaw gateway serves its health check on\n`/health`. This causes the server-side health probe to always return HTTP 404,\nmarking gateways as offline/error even when they are healthy and responsive.\n\nChanged the probe endpoint from `/api/health` to `/health` in:\n- `src/app/api/gateways/health/route.ts` (buildGatewayProbeUrl)\n- `src/app/api/channels/route.ts` (isGatewayReachable)\n\nCo-authored-by: Thomas Willner <B0tmaster@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0655a4465857073101dffab12809d51a567ac3d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mtdkjarvis/jarvis-mission-control/git/trees/0655a4465857073101dffab12809d51a567ac3d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mtdkjarvis/jarvis-mission-control/git/commits/0f82e23c2e26fe9756625e0d22790e5e899bd1ce","verification":{"payload":"tree 0655a4465857073101dffab12809d51a567ac3d2\nparent f3192a93016b77369f03fd23f8f1e37433e06a63\nauthor Thomas Willner <thomas.willner@gmail.com> 1774246869 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774246869 +0700\n\nfix(gateway): use /health instead of /api/health for health probes (#481)\n\nThe gateway health probe in `buildGatewayProbeUrl()` hardcodes `/api/health`\nas the probe endpoint, but the OpenClaw gateway serves its health check on\n`/health`. This causes the server-side health probe to always return HTTP 404,\nmarking gateways as offline/error even when they are healthy and responsive.\n\nChanged the probe endpoint from `/api/health` to `/health` in:\n- `src/app/api/gateways/health/route.ts` (buildGatewayProbeUrl)\n- `src/app/api/channels/route.ts` (isGatewayReachable)\n\nCo-authored-by: Thomas Willner <B0tmaster@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwNvVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/ZkQABL6kAN6n3uYZiwhadftbMkZ\njTPacqYz34hI6bwjh+Q9uKtRw0sl1A1A8DWFiBeJ7sMADxr17c6ocS/6TYRZCkH+\nmmycpe2nshD5uCXdG/t0/kd4foWaKJeMFU9J+Uz8vxYjBjOT/4R68ko3lJxbv6ix\nnhodYFdtK4fUKT2SGWrClvbZLQlGTN9/otTO3XXRUzqmGOysN5kkHniZGmwYUjzl\nqhUoeLRcXNKIqlj343iXhRT1LSJFExFetNiXlvmidw4D9qMSAhNysA6i6jwKlFqC\ni5o4Du0TEIKlKFDkhUeABPLykTom25VmgalHddSyX8TzC1xiq4POl6iBIIE1S+HN\nxShO0Y3/lSJkHfP2VEDyMo2Mqk54y02ykMYnWtIVywi4X0Y59vwVbR1Hw1SIjlry\nlJbFhir+LISeUDsA10nAE+vWeDQ91HXYTECfg8AEPGR4DQH9wntV7xfgG4SB8VLm\nQjSdacwBPZuKfct/wGepZQGGVbMRbOePkHmsJWNTXmX+yKpi5dSu5zwByHic0sry\nqQnidYRtF0bOcigdcFi2GcXPqvKMUYLHO4S+uqqssc9bhAR5cR2R1/GtXVM4nQAD\nHkM0z/UI/DQvWFhzq4cypzBHc6UDJMmUuoQaFCm3vxooS/vah/e1QsObUIiIVGCI\n4hCufIE7M6N3V8jBmCfl\n=mR+d\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-01T02:56:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:/