:13:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: restructure README with best-practice patterns (#484)\n\nApply hermes-agent README best practices:\n- Feature table (HTML <table>) at top for 10-second scan\n- Clear \"after installation\" moment (2 lines, not a wall)\n- Documentation table with \"What You''ll Learn\" column\n- API reference collapsed into summary table + link to OpenAPI\n- Removed inline 100+ endpoint API docs (use /api-docs Scalar UI)\n- Removed completed roadmap items (belong in CHANGELOG)\n- Consolidated duplicate feature descriptions\n- Reduced from 707 lines to 345 lines — same content, half the noise","tree":{"sha":"2a2d439c338ad9fedf5e57ef0e2048a9472c238c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mtdkjarvis/jarvis-mission-control/git/trees/2a2d439c338ad9fedf5e57ef0e2048a9472c238c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mtdkjarvis/jarvis-mission-control/git/commits/f3192a93016b77369f03fd23f8f1e37433e06a63","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a2d439c338ad9fedf5e57ef0e2048a9472c238c\nparent 648347cab75cd5232fafeba43bb723de62773b4c\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774246418 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774246418 +0700\n\ndocs: restructure README with best-practice patterns (#484)\n\nApply hermes-agent README best practices:\n- Feature table (HTML <table>) at top for 10-second scan\n- Clear \"after installation\" moment (2 lines, not a wall)\n- Documentation table with \"What You''ll Learn\" column\n- API reference collapsed into summary table + link to OpenAPI\n- Removed inline 100+ endpoint API docs (use /api-docs Scalar UI)\n- Removed completed roadmap items (belong in CHANGELOG)\n- Consolidated duplicate feature descriptions\n- Reduced from 707 lines to 345 lines — same content, half the noise","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwNoSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADzIQADYovE6aiXvnlXqEoiJjIbQI\nLKsfUQSiV+dvYw8gsljNnXCCc+6PNf1hDdZMq0VV0usZ1kfLOxHeZHkIxyqXtONa\nqZbl9fq