9cdd8ba71dabc19ef9ba99587ee6a5c629f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264638470?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HonzysClawdbot","id":264638470,"login":"HonzysClawdbot","node_id":"U_kgDOD8YQBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mtdkjarvis/jarvis-mission-control/commits/0acf7daf320dd7b0a4e1dbbe506af7a4ad0cdeac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T04:34:28Z","email":"janclawdbotstratil@gmail.com","name":"HonzysClawdbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T04:34:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: task assignment session targeting (#399)\n\n* feat: add task session targeting - dispatch tasks to specific agent sessions (#395)\n\nWhen assigning a task to an agent, users can now optionally select an\nexisting session to dispatch the task to instead of creating a new one.\n\nChanges:\n- task-dispatch.ts: When target_session is set in task metadata, use\n  gateway chat.send to dispatch to that specific session instead of\n  creating a new one via call agent\n- task-board-panel.tsx: Add session selector dropdown in both Create\n  and Edit task modals that appears when an agent is selected and has\n  active sessions\n- store/index.ts: Add agent and channel fields to Session interface\n\nCloses #395\n\n* fix(gateway): ensure gateways table exists before health probe\n\nThe gateways table is created lazily by the gateways API (ensureTable).\nThe health route was querying it directly without CREATE IF NOT EXISTS,\ncausing SqliteError: no such table: gateways in fresh databases (E2E tests,\nDocker first-boot).\n\nAdd ensureGatewaysTable() inline to mirror the pattern in route.ts.","tree":{"sha":"4d8bc162ed0bf6a7d607b4083c538e2fac9c470b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mtdkjarvis/jarvis-mission-control/git/trees/4d8bc162ed0bf6a7d607b4083c538e2fac9c470b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mtdkjarvis/jarvis-mission-control/git/commits/0acf7daf320dd7b0a4e1dbbe506af7a4ad0cdeac","verification":{"payload":"tree 4d8bc162ed0bf6a7d607b4083c538e2fac9c470b\nparent e7aa7e6a917715e52b40f1d5012f1402f6a5209d\nauthor HonzysClawdbot <janclawdbotstratil@gmail.com> 1773635668 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773635668 +0700\n\nfeat: task assignment session targeting (#399)\n\n* feat: add task session targeting - dispatch tasks to specific agent sessions (#395)\n\nWhen assigning a task to an agent, users can now optionally select an\nexisting session to dispatch the task to instead of creating a new one.\n\nChanges:\n- task-dispatch.ts: When target_session is set in task metadata, use\n  gateway chat.send to dispatch to that specific session instead of\n  creating a new one via call agent\n- task-board-panel.tsx: Add session selector dropdown in both Create\n  and Edit task modals that appears when an agent is selected and has\n  active sessions\n- store/index.ts: Add agent and channel fields to Session interface\n\nCloses #395\n\n* fix(gateway): ensure gateways table exists before health probe\n\nThe gateways table is created lazily by the gateways API (ensureTable).\nThe health route was querying it directly without CREATE IF NOT EXIS