ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/I-am-nothing","id":56163905,"login":"I-am-nothing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTYzOTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/62d432bfd0aaecf4262920c598e3201599b91c4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:07:16Z","email":"56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sheng Kun Chang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:07:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: revert dataimport import-mode contract (#236) (#237)\n\nOwner decision D132 chose the throwaway import plan; the heavy plan''s\npieces must not stay in V2. Pure `git revert` of 08c9486a (#236): the\ntree is identical to its pre-#236 parent.\n\nNothing on any default branch in the org imports\napp-module-sdk/dataimport or pins 08c9486a, and no release tag contains\nit (latest tag v0.4.20 predates it).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf93553dcaccdc5b159b9f55096179cf5dbb19fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/trees/cf93553dcaccdc5b159b9f55096179cf5dbb19fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/commits/62d432bfd0aaecf4262920c598e3201599b91c4d","verification":{"payload":"tree cf93553dcaccdc5b159b9f55096179cf5dbb19fa\nparent 08c9486a65e6b83feef6deca7d8ffb76d096a128\nauthor Sheng Kun Chang <56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com> 1790183236 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790183236 +0800\n\nrefactor: revert dataimport import-mode contract (#236) (#237)\n\nOwner decision D132 chose the throwaway import plan; the heavy plan''s\npieces must not stay in V2. Pure `git revert` of 08c9486a (#236): the\ntree is identical to its pre-#236 parent.\n\nNothing on any default branch in the org imports\napp-module-sdk/dataimport or pins 08c9486a, and no release tag contains\nit (latest tag v0.4.20 predates it).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtAdECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADQMQAHD2LOed6Dmk8On3j8TlddAS\n4UbLYFiNsVO555u5cMarTelcvLjfUj8mnwTf+aIcIjfNQljq9lP2N4Fy75f9ljv0\nRQ34nVsltbhCjpVUrJI/GTDL98FR1zzZ5u9O44rhuK7uxhD3m/XxY6JXv98CLa0m\nhlNCXeGct49lH2keAZ3WrjfUnbwMwsBHo1ff4NKTunxD3C+9jIWn43ExYOPrpJNu\nNlPgY4AETia+HRaZdEoqyl1eZtZilAXHzImqxm9eZGu7kzyM0uCk0TAEhSxzZlwV\nXO+48QbGJ4BYFI+5f5JA3XEL/Be8k9qTwxPauJmBFb39ArtdfzMbXpNdRviYYAZ+\nGVMe8+LqZn5X0oT2q8mmsTaZMpzx0fidJVZY2NiTdscO7QmMR3w5I2zyzUxR4GNv\n5BBk2oebOFPy/g8wTmCBe92UK7K5sZNIcPRX/BqNZcV3+kfgpaODUdrXNGcgAa/E\nBzvtVzEUzRrODf8srUqLv0+jy9hGRmDye8CwOIGNl98DuTO2E6s8DR3D+bKVhyAZ\nYkyrYhiGwDDlgM423veudHNfFHyDf/DeMC8xJ/uHmVXvmnVWLQ07KA5wTphCgcGv\nUVX6U3IkzZD2bhGGmm62h/tvw7ipaZFtAY9VYt938ArkJ8MYhhidQ5QN7OhkWt4n\nw6qGufzIojaDqYq1eom7\n=Nbm9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T17:07:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commit/62d432bfd0aaecf4262920c598e3201599b91c4d","node_id":"C_kwDOR2zucNoAKDYyZDQzMmJmZDBhYWVjZjQyNjI5MjBjNTk4ZTMyMDE1OTliOTFjNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commit/08c9486a65e6b83feef6deca7d8ffb76d096a128","sha":"08c9486a65e6b83feef6deca7d8ffb76d096a128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/08c9486a65e6b83feef6deca7d8ffb76d096a128"}],"sha":"62d432bfd0aaecf4262920c598e3201599b91c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/62d432bfd0aaecf4262920c598e3201599b91c4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56163905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/I-am-nothing","id":56163905,"login":"I-am-nothing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTYzOTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/08c9486a65e6b83feef6deca7d8ffb76d096a128/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:38:04Z","email":"56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sheng Kun Chang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:38:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(dataimport): source-agnostic import contract for module write paths (#236)\n\nA bulk import reaches a module''s own import handler with an import-mode flag\nin the context, set by the invoke shim from a new trusted envelope field\n(LambdaRequest.Import) that the platform sends only with a short-lived import\ncredential.\n\n- dataimport.Mode{RunID, DryRun} + With/From/Active/DryRun.\n- dataimport.Suppressed(ctx, Effect): lifecycle_outbox, meter_outbox,\n  transcode_meter_outbox, signup credit grant, default role grant are all\n  suppressed in import mode; module write paths ask before each one.\n- db.Tx (so ms.Tx) rolls back instead of committing in a dry run: the same\n  computation, nothing written. The post-commit audit drain is skipped.\n- meter: a Record in import mode is validated and then dropped.\n- Per-row RowResult inserted|updated|unchanged|rejected(code) with provenance\n  (run id, source key, source hash, dry run, prior values), and a Report.\n\nNo source names or formats in the SDK.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81f3bf87de8c8ca143ea36553b3a5d9f3592bdf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/trees/81f3bf87de8c8ca143ea36553b3a5d9f3592bdf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/commits/08c9486a65e6b83feef6deca7d8ffb76d096a128","verification":{"payload":"tree 81f3bf87de8c8ca143ea36553b3a5d9f3592bdf5\nparent 4d003f2c9fc398cdb221411e9b4d862567dfdbaa\nauthor Sheng Kun Chang <56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com> 1790170684 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790170684 +0800\n\nfeat(dataimport): source-agnostic import contract for module write paths (#236)\n\nA bulk import reaches a module''s own import handler with an import-mode flag\nin the context, set by the invoke shim from a new trusted envelope field\n(LambdaRequest.Import) that the platform sends only with a short-lived import\ncredential.\n\n- dataimport.Mode{RunID, DryRun} + With/From/Active/DryRun.\n- dataimport.Suppressed(ctx, Effect): lifecycle_outbox, meter_outbox,\n  transcode_meter_outbox, signup credit grant, default role grant are all\n  suppressed in import mode; module write paths ask before each one.\n- db.Tx (so ms.Tx) rolls back instead of committing in a dry run: the same\n  computation, nothing written. The post-commit audit drain is skipped.\n- meter: a Record in import mode is validated and then dropped.\n- Per-row RowResult inserted|updated|unchanged|rejected(code) with provenance\n  (run id, source key, source hash, dry run, prior values), and a Report.\n\nNo source names or formats in the SDK.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs9Y8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgUkQAAr/NG+WnpafKDyoIP9glqUS\nsawRvAFWQJ4ND0aKs0YKzsTwGypjp/MEtouuSVz8QBj+T22QH2Znf1iJgz6+s0vd\neDaVkgT6gDwF2rdBga0Q6kij0fQLgVCDUmn88IUHfXOe7e4LQ4dYXc+Oxi2iHwFa\ngIy2NLgASxVN997DCv330Gy0eXKdG0pVwK0H5sCTjMMMNMZRu58/PtlT9kzrow0o\nQyL7Vv4+zfe4ZoS8VgEChfuUDUTnRDuOjVwNb8W0x+3IYouBUIg40z3AFY1XlaAO\neMjWz10hhHc1rhchKJL5Bdowb6QV0xzt59LFSNvGDResw7urch3vDw/oq0LomSco\nW3KlNsytSuEJeeepfJNiOUSLg+uiPzWISBMobDXNb/1iOvL2nLKDSPpv6mzCsDWC\nFf5584n/qVkQU7Bgh1+T8EhoZgRAxGiu/gdMpxKG3tZxEscBknT3rqBSbFQ5CxBm\n+I0law