"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commit/4d003f2c9fc398cdb221411e9b4d862567dfdbaa","node_id":"C_kwDOR2zucNoAKDRkMDAzZjJjOWZjMzk4Y2RiMjIxNDExZTliNGQ4NjI1NjdkZmRiYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commit/474dd3456dde687e08c15d01a4867cf4a40b9ecb","sha":"474dd3456dde687e08c15d01a4867cf4a40b9ecb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/474dd3456dde687e08c15d01a4867cf4a40b9ecb"}],"sha":"4d003f2c9fc398cdb221411e9b4d862567dfdbaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/4d003f2c9fc398cdb221411e9b4d862567dfdbaa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56163905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/I-am-nothing","id":56163905,"login":"I-am-nothing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTYzOTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/474dd3456dde687e08c15d01a4867cf4a40b9ecb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:37:42Z","email":"56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sheng Kun Chang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:37:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(core): n.Optional() — an optional dependency that is not event-scoped (#233)\n\nDependsOn always wrote Optional:false, and the only producer of\nOptional:true was OptionalDependOn, which returns an OnEventOption — so a\nmodule could only declare an optional dep through ms.OnEvent. A request-path\nconsumer (ad-core resolving member names via user-core) had no way to say\n\"install without it\".\n\nNeed gains Optional(); DependsOn carries it into the registry entry, which\nalready merges with required-wins. OptionalDependOn''s output is unchanged\n(it still forces Optional:true; n.Optional() inside it is a no-op). The\nshared parse+configure path is folded into newDependency.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40f7821d87879731790dc0396cad9065cc766009","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/trees/40f7821d87879731790dc0396cad9065cc766009"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/commits/474dd3456dde687e08c15d01a4867cf4a40b9ecb","verification":{"payload":"tree 40f7821d87879731790dc0396cad9065cc766009\nparent f7f8ea74ca4e1ee141c7aade99c18ac3a802a442\nauthor Sheng Kun Chang <56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com> 1789627062 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789627062 +0800\n\nfeat(core): n.Optional() — an optional dependency that is not event-scoped (#233)\n\nDependsOn always wrote Optional:false, and the only producer of\nOptional:true was OptionalDependOn, which returns an OnEventOption — so a\nmodule could only declare an optional dep through ms.OnEvent. A request-path\nconsumer (ad-core resolving member names via user-core) had no way to say\n\"install without it\".\n\nNeed gains Optional(); DependsOn carries it into the registry entry, which\nalready merges with required-wins. OptionalDependOn''s output is unchanged\n(it still forces Optional:true; n.Optional() inside it is a no-op). The\nshared parse+configure path is folded into newDependency.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq4q2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAu84QAGMAQCLc8PT8BSw85HxPrF1c\nkiO53wxCfiVFjuEwGVEe2XruR03bcjBN4Jn1MQeMJjGC2v31aXV0/K/eORnRN5hg\naJZTveax6GWFMB85cBt6eZVmJR0WHjMg0HI+UvezXO5IGi6V3Yde3rotSEejJri4\njeXPIRxQ38FUjIil+ylk29oPI23P+lpu2hmYLaAY8aurTaIaE08wlZ0ZTpTdNHvf\nwKTm16Pq52LUYHHZ77g1XS2pZHnFjFFDN0lEx+ezqAKbnCU2eJdA2pYfOD81zfx3\nY4gMasvDks2Z1eddI8N39YrxQITAtFH6lIHksgGCVBnxyZMSa7iTEnizGGbJG8NQ\ntzA8aysTQ02nS8/D2gYqZ83dVzciMOLJWHyOBKDiuiLWb5yCTJ1wckAPZc1CbC9I\nL227zi1/G8gBNYkRU4nAai/ZFuF388AM2GCbDghQt12gYoY0G+XXVhSQLr1XUv7v\nkbI5mEYPxmiJIGEA+qtMAERBW1XzM26HTnHvAFag4u0HQtxwxXCwR/qyEQ5L7hP5\nVZrE5fwr1JWXmq4PaAlEgfSMlvp9nlLELFJvFIGjjmGLAvJ9FP7hf5KAoadaI0bZ\nhDrrRIXw9QhNn/b0FdbbsR1vTNRrKzuzFz0FmRemqJbyhAP2pYpmLJlDGvNRyXVv\nth62qNbdMDBzc7NoG4LS\n=DSez\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T06:37:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/