release v0.4.19 — binary response bodies survive the envelope (#232)\n\nTags the fix merged as 54b2276e so modules can pin it. video-core rebuilds on\nthis tag as 1.0.9; its AES playback key is the body that made the defect\nvisible.\n\nThe platform half (api-platform c6d4d90e) is already serving — dispatch''s live\nalias is version 224 — so a base64 body is decoded rather than relayed as text.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019LLaQQeGtSbECUttDeGKam\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55352ba503e2e8f2c6f118b2d1903430f76fd70e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/trees/55352ba503e2e8f2c6f118b2d1903430f76fd70e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/commits/f7f8ea74ca4e1ee141c7aade99c18ac3a802a442","verification":{"payload":"tree 55352ba503e2e8f2c6f118b2d1903430f76fd70e\nparent 54b2276e87b100eec15692be5127f6e0c7ff0567\nauthor Sheng Kun Chang <56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com> 1789569767 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789569767 +0800\n\nchore: release v0.4.19 — binary response bodies survive the envelope (#232)\n\nTags the fix merged as 54b2276e so modules can pin it. video-core rebuilds on\nthis tag as 1.0.9; its AES playback key is the body that made the defect\nvisible.\n\nThe platform half (api-platform c6d4d90e) is already serving — dispatch''s live\nalias is version 224 — so a base64 body is decoded rather than relayed as text.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019LLaQQeGtSbECUttDeGKam\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqqrnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6FQQAHZeVPlxIXVhXU+os//0wLrZ\nyREfeNbW8bPBkEfotBKLqks8jwvcnlizDkDS1xHCLeylXT0vtQv+6AcIs9J3UZ5v\nDY2/B6244KcaSG3DcFmgjBegYXDj41cn/1hecB0HB/xwG55+i9FOQ3z81wkvT8UX\ndmP6AMBWpnWOu29W92k5P9xW9gr2wIKNIy9Fl8IVIMpi/d0DHQZO6NbayeSlvK2K\nplPC7Po