displayed\ndue to license restrictions\") because its latest recorded version was the\nhand-made v0.4.16 tag, which still carried FSL-1.1-ALv2. v0.4.17 (the\nApache-2.0 release) was in proxy.golang.org and index.golang.org but had\nnever been fetched by pkg.go.dev, so its page 404''d.\n\nRequesting the fetch resolved it: the module page now resolves to v0.4.17,\nreports Apache-2.0, and renders the package documentation.\n\nRefs mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk#221\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WvxPSyUr7GuBYRzG3NtmRJ\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34ad8c9bb10d269b66dbd76c12eba1c0ae31a639","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/trees/34ad8c9bb10d269b66dbd76c12eba1c0ae31a639"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/commits/81b5829e20dd330edbecb704c3540948c0ae77b3","verification":{"payload":"tree 34ad8c9bb10d269b66dbd76c12eba1c0ae31a639\nparent e1203be5402857d041bac23f28855dace98655f2\nauthor Sheng Kun Chang <56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com> 1789269384 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789269384 +0800\n\ndocs: add the Go Reference badge now that pkg.go.dev serves the docs (#224)\n\npkg.go.dev withheld the SDK''s documentation (\"Documentation not displayed\ndue to license restrictions\") because its latest recorded version was the\nhand-made v0.4.16 tag, which still carried FSL-1.1-ALv2. v0.4.17 (the\nApache-2.0 release) was in proxy.golang.org and index.golang.org but had\nnever been fetched by pkg.go.dev, so its page 404''d.\n\nRequesting the fetch resolved it: the module page now resolves to v0.4.17,\nreports Apache-2.0, and renders the package documentation.\n\nRefs mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk#221\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WvxPSyUr7GuBYRzG3NtmRJ\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\