emoved or\nchanged (506 before, 506 after across every non-internal, non-examples package);\nboth halves live in internal/. The behavioural break — a module on v0.4.13\nanswers 400 on every route once the platform emits the new envelope — is carried\nby the [!IMPORTANT] callout in the entry rather than by an inflated number.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"297298a7fac31d12ddbe4607f9a5ae3d48145fae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/trees/297298a7fac31d12ddbe4607f9a5ae3d48145fae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/commits/20ba41e8de58832067a1d96744994788e77b2a99","verification":{"payload":"tree 297298a7fac31d12ddbe4607f9a5ae3d48145fae\nparent e69e09d096b1341463b6f1e914cb28dfdeb2985f\nauthor Sheng Kun Chang <56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com> 1788593168 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788593168 +0800\n\nchore: release v0.4.14 (#211)\n\nModule URL cut-over. Patch, not minor: 0 exported symbols added, removed or\nchanged (506 before, 506 after across every non-internal, non-examples package);\nboth halves live in internal/. The behavioural break — a module on v0.4.13\nanswers 400 on every route once the platform emits the new envelope — is carried\nby the [!IMPORTANT] callout in the entry rather than by an inflated number.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqm8QQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxVsQACNwAPt9RLdknduXjI3ZmtyZ\nVYazUdTtlP22OLk1p/etQVrEhJU4A3vq8Q1SuHeglZVSKcTM3KyVMYyuX3K6Wt/G\nkxtVTZAFf55HM16HDubGggHw+CSvzhro9SyKrkHGFqfxsAQYH5f74Vd+yLATWsoF\npHXY6jqbCHC94ZUjJ4m7lGyI78Lbk8sw27DXIHSOjGt1kuzXi8vDmBqoOESFd8hP\nRjs8E8816pLrTDjfCYSh1tLCcz2nJd4mZvOdp3b2lqtNDFwBqyalFoy9KXKY60BK\nDQ0dG8o0jkTlZjWdC3yxVpJ7BQPp3FoNpURHsmypWR+j2BJ/xPp8BErx/52XaWV+\ndn98G4XUX+b5A4fSf8yHxSdskpUQubnTadZkYPBEaZLgy+F9QxuPUVrXfoYdBFis\ndhNtxUItvQicz