YzOTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commit/df84a7a3b2bda48c14c87865149e81a7e1aacf05","node_id":"C_kwDOR2zucNoAKGRmODRhN2EzYjJiZGE0OGMxNGM4Nzg2NTE0OWU4MWE3ZTFhYWNmMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commit/2550b20ac7fa5dd1e431ee9fcc1a63253d3c385c","sha":"2550b20ac7fa5dd1e431ee9fcc1a63253d3c385c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/2550b20ac7fa5dd1e431ee9fcc1a63253d3c385c"}],"sha":"df84a7a3b2bda48c14c87865149e81a7e1aacf05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/df84a7a3b2bda48c14c87865149e81a7e1aacf05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56163905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/I-am-nothing","id":56163905,"login":"I-am-nothing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTYzOTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/2550b20ac7fa5dd1e431ee9fcc1a63253d3c385c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T07:31:11Z","email":"56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sheng Kun Chang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T07:31:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: run on every pull request, not only those targeting main (#190)\n\n`pull_request: branches: [main]` means a PR targeting anything else gets NO\nworkflow runs at all — not a failure, not a skip: an EMPTY check list, which\nreads as \"nothing to worry about\". A stack is exactly where verification\nmatters most, because each link is reviewed on top of code that has not\nlanded yet.\n\nLatent here rather than live: this repo has no stacked PR open right now. It\nwas live in the siblings — ms-app-modules had three stacked PRs reporting\npass=0, api-platform two — and all four repos carry the same copied\nconvention, so this is the same defect waiting for the first stacked PR\nsomebody opens.\n\n🔴 THE FAILURE IS AN ABSENCE, AND ABSENCE LOOKS IDENTICAL TO SUCCESS. Fixing\nit in one repo and moving on is how it survived here: a grep across every\nrepo takes seconds and is the only reliable sweep.\n\n`push` keeps its filter. A push run exists to protect main, and running the\nsuite on every branch push would only duplicate the PR run.","tree":{"sha":"d202465c78103b8c2156eb87400208fdfcaae83e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/trees/d202465c78103b8c2156eb87400208fdfcaae83e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/commits/2550b20ac7fa5dd1e431ee9fcc1a63253d3c385c","verification":{"payload":"tree d202465c78103b8c2156eb87400208fdfcaae83e\nparent 67541494f18128c69198b2b56feed30f79f246e5\nauthor Sheng Kun Chang <56163905+I-am-nothing@users.noreply.github.com> 1787815871 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787815871 +0800\n\nci: run on every pull request, not only those targeting main (#190)\n\n`pull_request: branches: [main]` means a PR targeting anything else gets NO\nworkflow runs at all — not a failure, not a skip: an EMPTY check list, which\nreads as \"nothing to worry about\". A stack is exactly where verification\nmatters most, because each link is reviewed on top of code that has not\nlanded yet.\n\nLatent here rather than live: this repo has no stacked PR open right now. It\nwas live in the siblings — ms-app-modules had three stacked PRs reporting\npass=0, api-platform two — and all four repos carry the same copied\nconvention, so this is the same defect waiting for the first stacked PR\nsomebody opens.\n\n🔴 THE FAILURE IS AN ABSENCE, AND ABSENCE LOOKS IDENTICAL TO SUCCESS. Fixing\nit in one repo and moving on is how it survived here: a grep across every\nrepo takes seconds and is the only reliable sweep.\n\n`push` keeps its filter. A push run exists to protect main, and running the\nsuite on every branch push would only duplicate the PR run.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqj+e/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALb0QAB4XJ/q270yXzeQI9KPk15Ss\nNvnQiDM8F3J+dEAyFQVeO+Z/FbO5uAunaHgeKbBXbE4R3bcMgZxxz1QplWovypAC\nGjtkQLJsIv1fl/IN+9OTvXA9rUCF9GwAC+Z++gsjuNzhd/FZJTfvEpn1r0Cnjk/n\n+RMoGFMNaTBjqhP6s3ueyeOPqGl/5oWZ60Bjywb1uViIK8mzwHEQjoQ22lERuw8i\nRRjMYhoHaWXEm77ZIaZsicyqiPMRniO4ALZukplpv+CSPkkvWVIvUPor+KnsJ2Kr\nM3bh9XGhpBBItGuPUcHcbyPsjTTqfQ4sy2zY9mxMyZs8nxXHw+k82HvwEmH9R7/a\neXC3rbv3Ay8qYZp9NeqZ/KWyjpV+WHdqHo9isNFfPCVdGLZkAc6aIA5PtYaoeHJt\nH1bbJnws3e76eHZBZxmcKu8ir992qPjMEt2Oaxx4vyd09GPUoQ190IjdK+l2XBNh\nZ1MnYTCFjtvYORhPc6MUwQ01ptXH6rgAfwBKfY3hQF/s+ZrUDOIkTBkOHJl+Wmxw\nHH2WWJdSb5WKqSgj9u2DJQX0qIIMzE7ec6OYjK8vZkxTI1/rAh9kyAP4J6NFQ9KZ\ngF5yaBud0wirup85Kn1G6PY/+HtkHEJWj9ekvxYgdQTTALioSuiSu4KCn/1oCwSn\n068UIE37KA7LuQ9we8OG\n=+KKC\n-----