ha256(served body))\non its response — the single source of truth for a module''s Go-declared manifest\nhash. The platform and CLI both READ this header (never recompute), so their\nhashes can never disagree. The hash reflects the declared surface\n(pages/permissions/schedules/migrations/...) and is stable across esbuild JS\nrebuilds (the manifest body carries no JS).\n\nThe body is encoded exactly as before (httputil.JSON''s HTML-escaping encoder +\ntrailing newline) and hashed over those same bytes, so the served manifest stays\nbyte-identical. Header-only (not in the body → no self-reference). Additive wire\nchange; old readers ignore it.\n\nPart of the 3-repo manifest hash-beat (api-platform + mirrorstack-cli).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49c5df161d1f82c25f57d166722dfb14e43c9960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/trees/49c5df161d1f82c25f57d166722dfb14e43c9960"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/commits/c1ae24d0a1a9245566c4ade6953f49150403b7d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56163905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/I-am-nothing","id":56163905,"login":"I-am-nothing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTYzOTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing