thub.com/users/I-am-nothing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/I-am-nothing","id":56163905,"login":"I-am-nothing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTYzOTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/I-am-nothing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/commits/457a2c4b00dd31bf084b3954d9fa97adcacb51ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T22:19:43Z","email":"nothingchang@mirrorstack.ai","name":"Sheng Kun Chang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T22:19:43Z","email":"nothingchang@mirrorstack.ai","name":"Sheng Kun Chang"},"message":"refactor: dedup deployed-read tenancy-scope + consumer field\n\nTwo safe simplify follow-ups on the deployed-plane DependencyDB path,\nno behavior change:\n\n- TxReadOnly now acquires a *pgxpool.Conn and begins the READ ONLY tx on\n  it (conn.BeginTx), reusing the single applyScope seam for search_path +\n  the ms.app_id RLS GUC instead of a divergent setScopeLocalTx copy. The\n  tenant-scoping SQL now lives in exactly one place (no RLS-drift footgun)\n  and runs in one batched round trip instead of two sequential Execs.\n  setScopeLocalTx is deleted.\n- Dependency.consumer was always == mod.config.ID; dropped the redundant\n  field and read q.dep.mod.config.ID at the single dev-plane use site.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ecf375f07caabf7990c8192b857f34a2246f2ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mirrorstack-ai/app-module-sdk/git/trees/1ecf375f07caabf7990c8192b857f34a2246f2ad"},"url":"https://api