l_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/e9b6c069e4fff835eb09098acccca338e0de85bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:28:12Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:28:12Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix: mark the active app, not a dock button\n\nswitchToApp marked the item at the app''s position among all .dock-item\nelements, which include the night-mode and fullscreen buttons, so the\nmarker landed one item early per button shown. With both buttons, the\nautostarted second app marked the fullscreen button. It now marks the\nitem whose data-index is the app''s index.","tree":{"sha":"a615792e0e9e6e839534c96fadbc724b6671751a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/trees/a615792e0e9e6e839534c96fadbc724b6671751a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/commits/e9b6c069e4fff835eb09098acccca338e0de85bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/app-dock/commit/e9b6c069e4fff835eb09098acccca338e0de85bf","node_id":"C_kwDOR3H0CtoAKGU5YjZjMDY5ZTRmZmY4MzVlYjA5MDk4YWNjY2NhMzM4ZTBkZTg1YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/app-dock/commit/2eb2a70288201012d7496ea1e4fead47ede1b171","sha":"2eb2a70288201012d7496ea1e4fead47ede1b171","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/2eb2a70288201012d7496ea1e4fead47ede1b171"}],"sha":"e9b6c069e4fff835eb09098acccca338e0de85bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/e9b6c069e4fff835eb09098acccca338e0de85bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/179156b2f3398695c6e373dbb60be37bdf42e89c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:16:30Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:18:54Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix: read saved settings while plugin is stopped\n\nWith the plugin disabled, /settings served the empty runtime state, so\nvisitors who are not admins got an empty dock while an admin, reading\n/config, saw the saved apps. /dismiss-tour saved {tourDismissed: true}\nas the whole configuration, because savePluginOptions replaces it, so\n\"Don''t show again\" erased the saved app list, and the previous commit\nopened that route to readwrite users.\n\nWhile the plugin is not running, both routes now start from the saved\nconfiguration (app.readPluginOptions()). The README notes that everyone\nwho gets the configured apps can read their URLs.","tree":{"sha":"0c3f5f05323e500e3fa3a9d9b6e07f4d8db53b66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/trees/0c3f5f05323e500e3fa3a9d9b6e07f4d8db53b66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/commits/179156b2f3398695c6e373dbb60be37bdf42e89c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/app-dock/commit/179156b2f3398695c6e373dbb60be37bdf42e89c","node_id":"C_kwDOR3H0CtoAKDE3OTE1NmIyZjMzOTg2OTVjNmUzNzNkYmI2MGJlMzdiZGY0MmU4OWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/app-dock/commit/316af07e3da2405aee6ade94da253c83303b38b5","sha":"316af07e3da2405aee6ade94da253c83303b38b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/316af07e3da2405aee6ade94da253c83303b38b5"}],"sha":"179156b2f3398695c6e373dbb60be37bdf42e89c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/179156b2f3398695c6e373dbb60be37bdf42e89c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/316af07e3da2405aee6ade94da253c83303b38b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T19:35:47Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T19:42:13Z","email":"dirkwahrheit@gmail.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"feat: show the configured dock to non-admin users\n\nsignalk-server keeps a plugin''s routes admin-only unless the plugin\nopens them with router.access() (2.31 and later), so every visitor who\nwas not an admin got the built-in app list, never saw the day/night\nstate, and could not dismiss the welcome tour.\n\nThe plugin now opens GET /settings and /mode to readonly users and\nPOST /dismiss-tour to readwrite users; /webapps and the reserved\n/config stay admin-only. On servers without router.access() every\nroute is registered on the router as before.\n\nThe dock reads /settings when the visitor is not an admin, including\nan empty app list, refreshes from it every 5 s, and falls back to the\nbuilt-in list when the route refuses the visitor. The night-mode\nbutton and \"Don''t show again\" are shown to readwrite users and admins\nonly, so readonly users and visitors who are not signed in no longer\nget a night-mode button that cannot switch the mode.","tree":{"sha":"8edd20063406d657f5ad309a51c8a64408018b1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/trees/8edd20063406d657f5ad309a51c8a64408018b1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/commits/316af07e3da2405aee6ade94da253c83303b38b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"http