ves\n- Guard tour button listeners with null checks\n- Persist tourDismissed in plugin config (applies to all devices)\n  instead of per-browser localStorage, with POST /dismiss-tour endpoint","tree":{"sha":"801798f29f832e82ef36418d25db05ca488b7225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/trees/801798f29f832e82ef36418d25db05ca488b7225"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/commits/884ccdb4ce63bb07f17de4f27860bafcdfb327bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/app-dock/commit/884ccdb4ce63bb07f17de4f27860bafcdfb327bc","node_id":"C_kwDOR3H0CtoAKDg4NGNjZGI0Y2U2M2JiMDdmMTdkZTRmMjc4NjBiYWZjZGZiMzI3YmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/app-dock/commit/cdb663df78f8acab7c72e7565024f8fa30eebb0b","sha":"cdb663df78f8acab7c72e7565024f8fa30eebb0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/cdb663df78f8acab7c72e7565024f8fa30eebb0b"}],"sha":"884ccdb4ce63bb07f17de4f27860bafcdfb327bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/884ccdb4ce63bb07f17de4f27860bafcdfb327bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7792779?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msallin","id":7792779,"login":"msallin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTI3Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/0ec339aa801ff975bca2e8c74c2fd696bc356f24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T17:00:20Z","email":"marc.sallin@outlook.com","name":"Marc Sallin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T17:34:31Z","email":"marc.sallin@outlook.com","name":"Marc Sallin"},"message":"ci: modernize release_on_tag workflow\n\nSeveral small modernizations on a workflow that''s served as the\ntemplate for the SignalK plugin family. This updates the template\nso other repos (nmea0183-signalk, nmea0183-utilities,\nsignalk-to-nmea0183, signalk-derived-data) can mirror it without\nregressions.\n\n- actions/create-release@v1 -> softprops/action-gh-release@v2.\n  actions/create-release was archived by GitHub earlier this year\n  and no longer receives updates.\n- mikepenz/release-changelog-builder-action: v1 -> v5.\n- github.ref -> github.ref_name for release title. github.ref is\n  refs/tags/v1.2.3 which the old actions/create-release passed\n  through as-is, so releases were named \"refs/tags/vX.Y.Z\" in the\n  GitHub UI. github.ref_name is just the bare tag (v1.2.3).\n- Drop redundant `if: startsWith(github.ref, ''refs/tags/'')` guard;\n  the on.push.tags filter already guarantees it.\n- Tag filter ''v*'' instead of ''*'' so stray tags don''t trigger a\n  release.\n- npm install -> npm ci against the committed lockfile.\n- Drop `npm install -g npm@latest && npm --version` preamble; it\n  adds a failure point for no obvious benefit.\n- Add concurrency group with cancel-in-progress: false so a publish\n  that''s in flight is never cancelled by a newer tag push.\n- Add timeout-minutes: 10 on both jobs.","tree":{"sha":"8120de7081cb8f4f6bf8a4ad0cb3a42bf82e614e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/trees/8120de7081cb8f4f6bf8a4ad0cb3a42bf82e614e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/commits/0ec339aa801ff975bca2e8c74c2fd696bc356f24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7792779?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msallin","id":7792779,"login":"msallin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTI3Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msallin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/app-dock/commit/0ec339aa801ff975bca2e8c74c2fd696bc356f24","node_id":"C_kwDOR3H0CtoAKDBlYzMzOWFhODAxZmY5NzViY2EyZThjNzRjMmZkNjk2YmMzNTZmMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/app-dock/commit/86ea9ec66dc9a5ae73b679a728e55768d83bd2ef","sha":"86ea9ec66dc9a5ae73b679a728e55768d83bd2ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/86ea9ec66dc9a5ae73b679a728e55768d83bd2ef"}],"sha":"0ec339aa801ff975bca2e8c74c2fd696bc356f24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/0ec339aa801ff975bca2e8c74c2fd696bc356f24"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/cdb663df78f8acab7c72e7565024f8fa30eebb0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T17:28:30Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T17:28:30Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"message":"feat: 0.2.1 defaults, welcome tour, save feedback, live refresh\n\n- Seed default apps (Freeboard-SK autostart, KIP, Settings) on first run\n- showNightModeButton defaults to true in seeded config\n- First-run welcome tour with localStorage dismiss, in-dock admin link\n- Config panel shows Saving/Saved status, auto-clears after 5s\n- Dock polls /settings every 5s and rebuilds on config change\n- Brighter app icon (blue gradient) with white backdrop for rounded corners\n- Dock stays visible during tour (z-index 40 above overlay at 30)","tree":{"sha":"6925f784d7afd0b86c3dba96b5f2e45e834a94d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/trees/6925f784d7afd0b86c3dba96b5f2e45e834a94d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/commits/cdb663df78f8acab7c72e7565024f8fa30eebb0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/app-dock/commit/cdb663df78f8acab7c72e7565024f8fa30eebb0b","node_id":"C_kwDOR3H0CtoAKGNkYjY2M2RmNzhmOGFjYWI3YzcyZTc1NjUwMjRmOGZhMzBlZWJiMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/app-dock/commit/86ea9ec66dc9a5ae73b679a728e55768d83bd2ef","sha":"86ea9ec66dc9a5ae73b679a728e55768d83bd2ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/86ea9ec66dc9a5ae73b679a728e55768d83bd2ef"}],"sha":"cdb663df78f8acab7c72e7565024f8fa30eebb0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/cdb663df78f8acab7c72e7565024f8fa30eebb0b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/commits/86ea9ec66dc9a5ae73b679a728e55768d83bd2ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T03:53:45Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T03:53:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add night/day toggle and exit utility buttons #1\n\n## Summary\n\n- Adds two optional utility buttons to the dock, disabled by default\n- **Night/Day toggle**: registers a PUT handler for `environment.mode`, toggles between day/night via the Signal K V1 API. Compatible with Freeboard-SK and Kip night mode subscriptions\n- **Exit button**: redirects to `/admin/` (Signal K admin UI dashboard)\n- Both buttons are visually separated from app icons with a thin divider and participate in the dock magnification effect\n- New `GET /mode` plugin endpoint to read current mode without requiring V1 API auth\n- Bumps version to 0.2.0","tree":{"sha":"33bc737620ed1e1fe3ed33c0b0875fa0b2fd910c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/trees/33bc737620ed1e1fe3ed33c0b0875fa0b2fd910c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/app-dock/git/commits/86ea9ec66dc9a5ae73b679a728e55768d83bd2ef","verification":{"payload":"tree 33bc737620ed1e1fe3ed33c0b0875fa0b2fd910c\nparent 0f03764b31f2e8e871f7a36cbdde2b199005edf6\nparent b9698743404f850e6cd81a293dccdbeb872dbb5d\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.