7b7809c182c7724f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T21:10:48Z","email":"atharvadeore04@gmail.com","name":"atharva-4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T21:10:48Z","email":"atharvadeore04@gmail.com","name":"atharva-4"},"message":"server: implement document revocation, activity tracking, and dashboard services\n\n- Implemented \revokeDocumentController to allow issuers to invalidate documents.\n- Hardened uploadDocumentController with role-based restrictions (blocking issuance to admins) and organizational isolation (ensuring issuer and recipient belong to the same org).\n- Introduced ActivityLog model and \u0007ctivityLogger utility to track all issuance, verification, and revocation events.\n- Created issuer.dashboard and \recipient.dashboard services/controllers to provide real-time analytics, status counts, and document lists.\n- Updated Document model with isRevoked status, organisationId, and unique \u000berifyId generation logic.\n- Integrated revocation status checks into the public verification controller.\n- Added global error handling for Multer file size limits (5MB) in \u0007pp.js.\n- Refactored routes to include dedicated dashboard endpoints for both user roles.","tree":{"sha":"c3a4f80209f0eaf359ec9fb9048a468822c8cb27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/me-athxrva/ether-vault/git/trees/c3a4f80209f0eaf359ec9fb9048a468822c8cb27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/me-athxrva/ether-vault/git/commits/49edf4636ab41e3e4e9db497b7809c182c7724f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112089821?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-athxrva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-athxrva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-athxrva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-athxrva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":