rl":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohammadShehadeh/multi-zones/commits/1d54dea0372bc44ba07141ed032fb1511ae551c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:18:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:18:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Use zone-named asset prefixes for cross-zone asset serving\n\nSwitch each zone''s assetPrefix to a path matching the zone name\n(/blog-static, /docs-static) and serve zone-owned public files from\nthe matching subfolder. The shell app rewrites these paths to the\nupstream zone so assets resolve consistently whether the page is\nvisited directly or proxied through the shell. Drops the now-unused\nNEXT_PUBLIC_ZONE_URL env var.","tree":{"sha":"1aa81dce80f601d4528e37243ee61cf8b0a162a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohammadShehadeh/multi-zones/git/trees/1aa81dce80f601d4528e37243ee61cf8b0a162a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohammadShehadeh/multi-zones/git/commits/1d54dea0372bc44ba07141ed032fb1511ae551c4","verification":{"payload":"tree 1aa81dce80f601d4528e37243ee61cf8b0a162a3\nparent 53921aedafb5ad6759c1af560dfab058ebdd78fe\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1779801537 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1779801537 +0000\n\nUse zone-named asset prefixes for cross-zone asset serving\n\nSwitch each zone''s assetPrefix to a path matching the zone name\n(/blog-static, /docs-static) and serve zone-owned public files from\nthe matching subfolder. The shell app rewrites these paths to the\nupstream zone so assets resolve consistently whether the page is\nvisited directly or proxied through the shell. Drops the now-unused\nNEXT_PUBLIC_ZONE_URL env var.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAAB