계열 위상 전부 흡수 — D-8·D-9·D-10 종결 (bless-two F-1~F-3 채택)\n\nD-8+F-2: Branch A에 저장소 형상 판별(.git 파일=linked worktree) + bare/worktree\n사전 점검(core.bare를 config.worktree로 이전 후 worktreeConfig 활성화 — bless-two\n실측: 건너뛰면 전 워크트리 git 즉사) + --worktree hooksPath.\nD-9: 훅 본문이 staged 경로를 react.root/java.root와 대조해 매칭 시에만 게이트 실행\n(PLUGIN-CHANNEL 규칙 6 정합). 구현 중 실버그 봉합: 말미 ''[test] && (...)''가 정당한\nskip을 exit 1로 누설 → 명시 exit 0, 실패 전파는 set -e로 유지(기능 하네스 5케이스).\nD-10: root를 ax.config.json에서 해석(python3/sed, bash3.2), 부재 시 명시 exit 1.\nF-3: probe ④를 ''빈 값''에서 ''형제 값·출처 불변 + config.worktree 신규 1건''으로 일반화\n(기존 hooksPath 선점 저장소에서도 성립). P2-78 규율 준수(heredoc-in-$() 0).\n버전 0.1.2→0.1.3 (3-필드 동기).","tree":{"sha":"2b0853110492e14030823021daf3927c53680b49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/2b0853110492e14030823021daf3927c53680b49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/0160d07fa2345dde3301b432d232117a725f5d35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"h