_proof: $() 중첩 quoted-heredoc이 본문 아포스트로피 홀수 개수에서\nbash 3.2.57 오파싱(최소 재현 확보) → 4곳 전부 temp-file 패턴(top-level cat > TMP 후\npython3 TMP)으로 면역화, live 76/76 PASS. pyyaml_preflight_coverage: probe가 ambient\nJAVA_HOME(JDK17)에 가려 PyYAML 축을 못 보던 것 → JDK21 해석 후 probe env에만 주입,\nrc=0. 잔여 동일-지뢰 3파일은 P2-78로 정직 등재(분모 324→325). 다운스트림 worktree\n실사용 피드백 3건은 D-8(--worktree hooksPath)·D-9(경로-스코프 게이트)·D-10(java.root\nplaceholder)로 등재.","tree":{"sha":"16230d5fd93bed8ae205254dea13ba1d299d9256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/16230d5fd93bed8ae205254dea13ba1d299d9256"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/792ca0e4833235b4a33868ed3720b7af569e9153","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/792ca0e4833235b4a33868ed3720b7af569e9153","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDc5MmNhMGU0ODMzMjM1YjRhMzM4NjhlZDM3MjBiN2FmNTY5ZTkxNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-tem