l":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/0b34e19f58ee0c72d977f6c95bd9935789453725/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T15:30:25Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T15:30:25Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"feat(plugin): D-7 종결 — plugin.json 버전 릴리스 규율 + 3-필드 일치 가드\n\nplugin.json version 0.1.0→0.1.1, marketplace.json entry version·metadata.version\n동반 상향(엔트리 값은 claude plugin update 비교 기준이 아님을 실측 확인한 채로 —\n세 필드가 서로 다른 이야기를 하면 안 된다는 이유로 상향).\n\ndoc_headline_count_guard.sh를 확장(새 guard 파일 미추가 — README.md/CLAUDE.md\n헤드라인 미터치 제약과 guard-개수 카운트 충돌을 피함)해 plugin.json↔marketplace.json\n버전 3-필드 일치를 매 실행 강제. --version-fixture-root 격리 진입점 + pass/fail\nfixture 쌍 신설, run-all-guards.sh [60] 섹션 등록, fixture_kill_manifest.yaml 등재\n(LIVE_MIN_ITEMS 73→74).\n\n상세 근거·측정치: practices/DECISIONS.md R111. BACKLOG D-7 closed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba627be1bdf75a9a3ff2f3cc0ba524aa48661f50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/ba627be1bdf75a9a3ff2f3cc0ba524aa48661f50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/0b34e19f58ee0c72d977f6c95bd9935789453725","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":""