kwDOR3zpP9oAKDRiYjY2M2RiMzE5M2M3MTJmNzIzMzMxOThhZGRlODdmMzE3MGNkODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/42ef3bef4b1968c62e93395265837c4a892f10ec","sha":"42ef3bef4b1968c62e93395265837c4a892f10ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/42ef3bef4b1968c62e93395265837c4a892f10ec"}],"sha":"4bb663db3193c712f72333198adde87f3170cd87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/4bb663db3193c712f72333198adde87f3170cd87"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/42ef3bef4b1968c62e93395265837c4a892f10ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T15:17:03Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T15:17:03Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs: PyYAML is not always yq-substitutable (catalog-guard steps require it)\n\nMeasured against practices/scripts/verify-completion.sh (its own header comment\nblock :12-31 already states this precisely, and the preflight code at :612 and\n:1298-1338 implements it):\n\n- (i) checklist parsing (line 612): PyYAML OR yq both work — the parser falls\n  back to `yq -o=json` when PyYAML is absent. Gated unconditionally.\n- (iv) catalog-guard steps (line 1298-1338, NEEDS_PYYAML): PyYAML specifically\n  required whenever the resolved step set runs any script under an `evals/`\n  directory (i.e. any full run). yq is explicitly NOT a substitute there — the\n  guards embed `import yaml` with no yq path and several SILENTLY SKIP without\n  it, which would report a PASS for guards that never ran. Gated on the\n  resolved step set, same as the node/npm check.\n\nSo \"PyYAML 또는 yq\" as a blanket, unconditional OR was only half-true: correct\nfor checklist parsing, wrong for any full run (which is what \"완료 선언 전\"\nR25 means). A reader who installs only yq and runs the full gate hits an\nundocumented block.\n\nFixed sites:\n- CLAUDE.md \"R25 toolchain prerequisites\" bullet — split into the two roles\n- docs/GETTING-STARTED.md §3-1 prerequisite table row — same split\n- docs/GETTING-STARTED.md §8 troubleshooting row (`ModuleNotFoundError: yaml`)\n  — same \"또는 yq\" overstatement, corrected too (same root cause, same fix)\n\nVerified: doc_headline_count_guard.sh exit 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7df37efb7f6177e29f804be642fe8cfef22fa84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/b7df37efb7f6177e29f804be642fe8cfef22fa84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/42ef3bef4b1968c62e93395265837c4a892f10ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/follo