api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/f54288a002ed28a80f23e258f894094114706ec2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T15:08:16Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T15:08:16Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(claude.md): fix stale React/ESLint rule counts (self-contradiction)\n\nMeasured: ls practices-react/rules/*.md | wc -l → 102;\nls practices-react/eslint-plugin-ax/rules/*.js | wc -l → 15.\n\n- :228 \"practices-react 100룰 + ESLint 14룰\" → 102룰 / 15룰\n- :239 \"React/Next.js 카탈로그(101 rules + 15 ESLint rules)\" → 102 rules\n\n:171 (\"233 Java rules + 102 React rules + 15 ESLint rules + 108 hard\nguards\") was already correct and used as the reference — left\nunchanged. Scope limited to these two React/ESLint-rule counts per\nteammate brief; did not sweep the rest of the file (many numbers there\nare historical snapshots, e.g. the R22 baseline test matrix, and must\nnot be \"updated\"). Did not touch the R25 MANDATORY section or the R26\nprivate-boundary section.\n\nVerified: doc_headline_count_guard.sh exit 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33420711c4da0a756baa200ee9a600d1b439e048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/33420711c4da0a756baa200ee9a600d1b439e048"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/f54288a002ed28a80f23e258f894094114706ec2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/f54288a002ed28a80f23e258f894094114706ec2","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGY1NDI4OGEwMDJlZDI4YTgwZjIzZTI1OGY4OTQwOTQxMTQ3MDZlYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/b8d020b7cef6fa861dbe28e2569c7ec41efa7792","sha":"b8d020b7cef6fa861dbe28e2569c7ec41efa7792","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/b8d020b7cef6fa861dbe28e2569c7ec41efa7792"}],"sha":"f54288a002ed28a80f23e258f894094114706ec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/f54288a002ed28a80f23e258f894094114706ec2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/b8d020b7cef6fa861dbe28e2569c7ec41efa7792/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T15:06:49Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T15:06:49Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs: fix stale doc numbers in README + GETTING-STARTED\n\nMeasured against disk (168 specs, 233 Java rules, 102 React rules, 15\nESLint rules, 108 hard guards, Spring Boot 4.1.0, 8-step R25 checklist\nincl. frontend-test):\n\n- docs/GETTING-STARTED.md: spec/rule/guard counts 142/229/99/14/90 →\n  168/233/102/15/108; R25 step enumeration 7→8 steps (was missing\n  frontend-test)\n- README.md: React rule count unified to 102 (was 99/100/101 across\n  4 sites), ESLint unified to 15 (was 14 at 2 sites), Spring Boot 3→4\n  (build.gradle.kts pins 4.1.0) at 2 sites describing the stack\n  generally\n- JAVA_HOME recipe (GETTING-STARTED :54, :212): `java_home -v 21`\n  alone fails on Homebrew-installed JDK 21 (not auto-registered) —\n  added the Homebrew path explicitly, consistent with\n  docs/USAGE-GUIDE.md T-4\n- README npm install → npm ci (lockfile is committed, matches stated\n  reproducible-install intent); GETTING-STARTED already used npm ci\n- GETTING-STARTED §3: added `git submodule update --init` with an\n  honest note that it''s for portability fixtures only, not required\n  for guards/gates\n- README testPortability quickstart line: noted fresh-clone fixtures\n  aren''t built yet, so tests SKIP via JUnit Assumptions until\n  practices/evals/portability/run.sh --full runs\n- GETTING-STARTED §5-4 push-gate row: corrected from \"unconditional\n  full regression\" to \"runs when the diff touches backend/practices/\n  seed spec\" (matches .githooks/pre-push actual scope logic)\n\nVerified: doc_headline_count_guard.sh exit 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6b17c1fe9b8bdbace687af3b65fcc6045e0a676","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/e6b17c1fe9b8bdbace687af3b65fcc6045e0a676"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/b8d020b7cef6fa861dbe28e2569c7ec41efa7792","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/b8d020b7cef6fa861dbe28e2569c7ec41efa7792","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGI4ZDAyMGI3Y2VmNmZhODYxZGJlMjhlMjU2OWM3ZWM0MWVmYTc3OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/41cda10cd1265802c2d541a75ebe247149bad32a","sha":"41cda10cd1265802c2d541a75ebe247149bad32a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-de