tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/b2c0fc98fde20c9e68a894fd4462d14bedd84b43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T14:17:57Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T14:17:57Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(start-prompts): 경로 A/B 복붙용 시작 프롬프트 + README·문서지도 진입","tree":{"sha":"0ce9d355e6a004ecdfd8356751930cc4c05f04b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/0ce9d355e6a004ecdfd8356751930cc4c05f04b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/b2c0fc98fde20c9e68a894fd4462d14bedd84b43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/b2c0fc98fde20c9e68a894fd4462d14bedd84b43","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGIyYzBmYzk4ZmRlMjBjOWU2OGE4OTRmZDQ0NjJkMTRiZWRkODRiNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/44e9b0238a8712100dc13435f6e1ba66e81666d7","sha":"44e9b0238a8712100dc13435f6e1ba66e81666d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/44e9b0238a8712100dc13435f6e1ba66e81666d7"}],"sha":"b2c0fc98fde20c9e68a894fd4462d14bedd84b43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/b2c0fc98fde20c9e68a894fd4462d14bedd84b43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/44e9b0238a8712100dc13435f6e1ba66e81666d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T14:03:41Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T14:03:41Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(usage-guide): fix false private-repo assumption — ax-template is public\n\nMeasured (2026-08-09): `gh repo view ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template --json\nvisibility,isPrivate` -> {\"isPrivate\":false,\"visibility\":\"PUBLIC\"}. Confirmed\nindependently with an unauthenticated `git ls-remote https://github.com/...`\nwhich returned the HEAD sha without any credential prompt.\n\n§1 prerequisite row asserted ''private repo — 계정별 SSH 키(또는 HTTPS 토큰) 필요''\nand pointed the confirm-command at an SSH URL. Both are wrong for a public repo\nand actively mislead a reader who lacks (or doesn''t want to configure) an SSH\nkey for this account. Replaced with an HTTPS ls-remote check that needs no\nauth, keeping the SSH case only as a documented exception (git configured\nwith url.*.insteadOf rewriting https->ssh).\n\nRewrote T-3''s diagnosis tree to match reality — a public repo''s\n''marketplace add'' failures are actually caused by: owner/repo typos, an old\ngit in PATH (same root cause as T-4''s git<2.28 case — preserved, it is\ngenuinely measured), an insteadOf https->ssh rewrite forcing an unconfigured\nSSH key, network/proxy blocking github.com, or a marketplace name collision.\nAlso corrected the FAQ team-deployment answer, which likewise assumed access\nneeded to be granted before running §2''s install commands.\n\nSwept docs/PLUGIN-CHANNEL.md, README.md, CLAUDE.md, skills/**/SKILL.md for\nthe same assumption — no other site asserts privateness (the one ''private''\nhit in skills/ax-install-java-enforcement/SKILL.md is a Java\n`private static final` code snippet, unrelated).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dcd54ec1e458ccb3fc1cab20cf7713fbab275b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/dcd54ec1e458ccb3fc1cab20cf7713fbab275b2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/44e9b0238a8712100dc13435f6e1ba66e81666d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user