itter":{"date":"2026-08-02T00:28:40Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(plugin-channel): 소비 경로 가이드 — fork vs plugin 채널 세팅·사용 흐름 문서화\n\n경로 A(fork-as-base) vs 경로 B(plugin 채널) 비교표 + B의 전체 흐름:\nmarketplace 설치 → /ax-init-config 레이아웃 선언 → /ax-practices 지식 라우팅\n(CRITICAL 총순서 8룰 캡, deny-by-default) → 강제 배선 3종 opt-in.\n보장/비보장 경계(guard·R25는 카탈로그 자기검증 — 대상 프로젝트로 이식 안 됨)와\nmaintainer 유지보수 노트(INDEX 수동 재생성 사유) 포함. README에 진입 링크 1줄.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed892929c6e9c89275ec6365ed21ff58262b0918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/ed892929c6e9c89275ec6365ed21ff58262b0918"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/096614b5ffd18be51cc92e4a02ffec9ab4710424","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/096614b5ffd18be51cc92e4a02ffec9ab4710424","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDA5NjYxNGI1ZmZkMThiZTUxY2M5MmU0YTAyZm