한 census 제외 → exit 1) +\nfail_malformed_header fixture + [108] 등록 (불변식 6→7, anchor 유일성 유지).\ndeslop: layoutFrom 동결-사본 구성 중복 2곳 → cloneLayout 단일화 (행동 불변,\n52/52 green + frontend lint 0 재확인).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c14ae74b4f7e149d3c310d9768c8050f1cf88289","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/c14ae74b4f7e149d3c310d9768c8050f1cf88289"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/3f66e088fa3ea080e035d0d12ba2e03395c05491","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/3f66e088fa3ea080e035d0d12ba2e03395c05491","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDNmNjZlMDg4ZmEzZWEwODBlMDM1ZDBkMTJiYTJlMDMzOTVjMDU0OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/e1af0683139b30df41b00db223a8e5cd782447f1","sha":"e1af0683139b30df41b00db223a8e5cd782447f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-templa