NlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/f8be8fdfb4eea2ba8f47464e6f8b7d5bae04c478/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:19:41Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:19:41Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"feat(plugin,guards): marketplace.json + 파생블록 provenance 대장 + derived_block_license_guard [108] — D-4\n\nmarketplace.json: 실측 9개 marketplace 스키마 역추출, 단일 plugin source \"./\",\nplugin.json name/version 일치(ax-transform 0.1.0). skills[] 필드 의도적 생략 —\n멀티플러그인 subset 용도이고 단일 plugin은 plugin.json 자동 발견이 정본.\nclaude plugin validate rc=0 (비-strict + strict 둘 다 — F14-a는 plugin.json 직접\n검증 시에만 발화함을 실측, PRD 예상보다 강한 결과).\nDERIVED-SOURCES.yaml: @ax-codified-from 13/13 기계 추출 등재, 자기참조 함정\n(대장 산문이 태그를 인용→자기 등재 요구) 실행으로 적발·이중 봉합.\nguard [108]: 불변식 6종(완전성/역방향/일대일/헤더↔대장 정확 대조/중복/포함 강제),\nfixture 6종 rc 전건 기대값, 0-item exit 2 + LIVE_MIN_DERIVED=13.\nkill-proof: manifest 등재(anchor 유일성 검증, 1-item 미니 manifest로 non-vacuity\n증명 original=1→neutered=0), min_items/LIVE_MIN_ITEMS 72→73 lockstep.\n헤드라인: ''hard guards'' 7 occurrence 107→108 + 인접 105+2→106+2 1건 +\n''102 live guards''→103. doc_headline_count_guard rc=0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45500b157fef1f696f9be6dbcb37c15a723dacf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/45500b157fef1f696f9be6dbcb37c15a723dacf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-te