,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/5412fb29e8c86a4d23a9fe9bf415dd38b13e67a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T15:53:32Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T15:53:32Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(decisions,backlog): D-track — Claude Code plugin 소비 채널 ADR(R109) + 분모-제외 백로그 등재\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a77227e92ef7c9e4c346ab45e5567d69236536d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/a77227e92ef7c9e4c346ab45e5567d69236536d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/5412fb29e8c86a4d23a9fe9bf415dd38b13e67a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/5412fb29e8c86a4d23a9fe9bf415dd38b13e67a7","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDU0MTJmYjI5ZThjODZhNGQyM2E5ZmU5YmY0MTVkZDM4YjEzZTY3YTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/0952ca9cf975737fcf9728c27b9d1c7d4f6215b9","sha":"0952ca9cf975737fcf9728c27b9d1c7d4f6215b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/0952ca9cf975737fcf9728c27b9d1c7d4f6215b9"}],"sha":"5412fb29e8c86a4d23a9fe9bf415dd38b13e67a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/5412fb29e8c86a4d23a9fe9bf415dd38b13e67a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/0952ca9cf975737fcf9728c27b9d1c7d4f6215b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T12:09:39Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T12:09:39Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(backlog): P2-72·P3-138 종결 + P3-139 등재 — 317/318, P2 100%\n\nP2-72: Lane H의 미출하 사유(''가드가 BSD stat -f를 써서 Linux 불가'')가 재측정으로 반쪽만\n  맞음 — stat -f를 쓰는 12개 파일 전부 GNU fallback 보유(이번 웨이브 P2-67 산출물)이고\n  한쪽만 쓰는 파일 0. 즉 자기 웨이브 산출물을 블로커로 인용했다. 남은 미지수는 ''Linux에서\n  청결한가'' 하나이고 미측정 전제에는 advisory 측정기가 정답 — 주간 ubuntu-latest 크론 출하.\nP3-138: 같은 러너가 ext4 바이트 보존으로 정규화 반쪽까지 준다. done-when의 ''프로브 선통과,\n  skip 아닌 소리내어 실패''를 워크플로 첫 스텝으로 구현, 매 실행 측정(양·음 대조군 확보).\nP3-139: Linux 리허설(358 pass/4 fail)이 진짜 이식성 발견 1건 — prover의 symmid* 3케이스가\n  ''접는 파일시스템''을 전제해 ext4에서 구성 불가(결함 아니라 전제 불일치). blocking이 아니라\n  advisory여야 하는 이유의 실측 근거.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ee64fbc05612998f89c9c8bb19a338a15fc5e5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/9ee64fbc05612998f89c9c8bb19a338a15fc5e5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/0952ca9cf975737fcf9728c27b9d1c7d4f6215b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/0952ca9cf975737fcf9728c27b9d1c7d4f6215b9","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDA5NTJjYTljZjk3NTczN2ZjZjk3MjhjMjdiOWQxYzdkNGY2MjE1Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/9f2734644926e4e9f363896ade54cac9ea5fccbd","sha":"9f2734644926e4e9f363896ade54cac9ea5fccbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9f2734644926e4e9f363896ade54cac9ea5fccbd"}],"sha":"0952ca9cf975737fcf9728c27b9d1c7d4f6215b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/0952ca9cf975737fcf9728c27b9d1c7d4f6215b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9f2734644926e4e9f363896ade54cac9ea5fccbd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T12:06:56Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T12:06:56Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(ci): 프로브의 dirent 계수를 ls|grep에서 glob으로 — actionlint SC2010\n\nactionlint(docker rhysd/actionlint)가 프로브 스텝의 `ls -1 | grep -c` 두 곳을\nSC2010으로 지적. `shopt -s nullglob` + 글롭 계수로 교체 — 비영숫자 파일명에도\n안전하고 ls 출력 파싱이 사라진다. 교체 후 워크플로 5개 전부 actionlint exit 0.\n\n동작 불변 재확인 (양·음 대조군 모두 재실행):\n- Linux ext4 양성 대조군: exit 0, case entries=2 (inode 상이), norm entries=2 (inode 상이)\n- macOS APFS 음성 대조군: exit 1, case entries=1, norm entries=1, GITHUB_OUTPUT에 no/no 기록\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e390c1b1cd2753f5be6862d715540f5b28f7beed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/e390c1b1cd2753f5be6862d715540f5b28f7beed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/9f2734644926e4e9f363896ade54cac9ea5fccbd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/9f2734644926e4e9f363896ade54cac9ea5fccbd","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDlmMjczNDY0NDkyNmU0ZTlmMzYzODk2YWRlNTRjYWM5ZWE1ZmNjYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/2c0bf3555011b7433d25bca45ee92e2b4b79a862","sha":"2c0bf3555011b7433d25bca45ee92e2b4b79a862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/2c0bf3555011b7433d25bca45ee92e2b4b79a862"}],"sha":"9f2734644926e4e9f363896ade54cac9ea5fccbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9f2734644926e4e9f363896ade54cac9ea5fccbd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/2c0bf3555011b7433d25bca45ee92e2b4b79a862/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T12:05:16Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T12:05:16Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"feat(ci): Linux advisory 크론으로 비-aliasing 파일시스템 스윕을 스케줄 — P2-72 운영 잔여 + P3-138 능력 잔여\n\n`.github/workflows/practices-case-normalization.yml` 신설 — 주간 `ubuntu-latest`\nadvisory 크론(`continue-on-error: true`) + `workflow_dispatch`.\n`practices-portability.yml`의 모양과 관례를 그대로 따른다.\n\n동작 순서가 핵심이다 — **전제를 먼저 측정한다**:\n1. 파일시스템 능력 프로브를 체크아웃 안에서 실행. `A`/`a`와 NFC `café`/NFD\n   `cafe`+U+0301을 만들어 각각 **다른 inode 2개**임을 단언하고, 측정치를 항상\n   출력한다. 하나라도 실패하면 스윕을 **아예 돌리지 않고** job summary에\n   \"PREMISE NOT ESTABLISHED — no measurement was taken\"을 적는다. skip이 아니라\n   소리내어 실패한다 — 접는 파일시스템 위의 pass는 무측정보다 나쁘기 때문.\n   프로브는 자기가 `git status --porcelain`을 더럽히지 않았음도 단언한다.\n2. 통과할 때만 `run-all-guards.sh --include-fixtures`를 돌리고 pass/fail 수와\n   모든 `FAIL [` 라인을 job summary에 싣는다. 로그는 `$RUNNER_TEMP`에 쓴다\n   (워크스페이스에 쓰면 porcelain 검사 가드가 자기 로그에 걸린다).\n3. 커버 안 하는 것(gradle·npm 스텝, R25 전체)을 스스로 출력한다 — 러너에\n   JDK·node_modules를 일부러 프로비저닝하지 않는다.\n\n선행 검증: 앞 레인이 인용한 이식성 사유(\"가드 4개+가 BSD `stat -f` 사용\")를\ngrep으로 재측정한 결과 **실행 파일 12개 전부가 GNU `stat -c` fallback을 이미\n동반**하고(P2-67에서 도입) 한쪽만 쓰는 파일은 **0**이다. 반쪽만 맞는 사유였다.\n\n정직한 경계: Linux에서 스위트가 청결한지는 **여전히 미측정**이다. 메커니즘만\n출하·스케줄됐고 측정치는 첫 스케줄/디스패치 실행이 만든다. 로컬 docker 리허설은\n**358 passed / 4 failed** — 그 중 `ax-prove-hermetic-runtime`은 툴체인 부재가\n아니라 자기 공격 케이스가 **접는 파일시스템을 전제**해서 ext4에서 성립하지\n않는다(\"premise broken (symmid*)\"). blocking이 아니라 advisory여야 하는 이유가\n바로 이것이다.\n\n문서: `practices/MAINTAINER.md` §5d(주기 작업 표 — 스케줄된 것/수동인 것 구분,\n정직한 미측정 상태 명시) · `CLAUDE.md` 강제 표면 표(신규 행 + macOS 스크립트가\n정규화 반쪽을 못 덮는다는 정정) · `practices/DECISIONS.md` TD-2026-08-01-Lane-I.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e66cf8c1b5fa40412f2ddf14481eb89694a30b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/e66cf8c1b5fa40412f2ddf14481eb89694a30b2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/2c0bf3555011b7433d25bca45ee92e2b4b79a862","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/2c0bf3555011b7433d25bca45ee92e2b4b79a862","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDJjMGJmMzU1NTAxMWI3NDMzZDI1YmNhNDVlZTkyZTJiNGI3OWE4NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/54463a9d355bbf76c1fbf9015e04a18f78b7a636","sha":"54463a9d355bbf76c1fbf9015e04a18f78b7a636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/54463a9d355bbf76c1fbf9015e04a18f78b7a636"}],"sha":"2c0bf3555011b7433d25bca45ee92e2b4b79a862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/2c0bf3555011b7433d25bca45ee92e2b4b79a862"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/54463a9d355bbf76c1fbf9015e04a18f78b7a636/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T10:54:42Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T10:54:42Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(backlog): P3-137 종결 + P2-72 잔여 사유 검증 갱신 + P3-138 분리 등재 — 315/317\n\nP3-137: 개명은 양쪽 모두 불가함을 클론에서 측정(RECEIPT_ORPHANED exit 2 양측 + practices\n  쪽은 보호 스윕 4 findings). 근본 원인은 receipts가 append-only로 id를 fetch된 본문에\n  결박한다는 것 — id는 라벨이 아니라 provenance의 일부. 대신 [107] 교차-카탈로그 충돌\n  가드 출하(같은 id ⇒ 같은 source; 실측 공유 4 중 3은 정당하므로 전면 금지 대신).\n  자체 적발: 메타가드 [95]가 [107]의 정규식 fallback을 잡음(46 vs 42 오독 후 PASS).\nP2-72: ''아무도 스케줄하지 않는다''를 자율성 원칙으로 닫으려던 내 논거를 레인이 repo 사실로\n  기각 — .github/workflows에 크론 3개가 이미 있고 practices-portability.yml이 바로 필요한\n  모양이다. 행은 열린 채 유지, 호출 시점은 MAINTAINER §5d에 문서화.\nP3-138: 정규화 반쪽을 분리 — P2-72 잔여는 운영(스케줄), 이 행은 능력(볼륨 부재)이라\n  한 행에 묶여 있으면 둘 다 안 닫힌다. Linux 러너면 공짜로 얻는다는 사실을 done-when에.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66ecdbd774471648dc5bf72b091c4840096ef42a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/66ecdbd774471648dc5bf72b091c4840096ef42a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/54463a9d355bbf76c1fbf9015e04a18f78b7a636","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/54463a9d355bbf76c1fbf9015e04a18f78b7a636","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDU0NDYzYTlkMzU1YmJmNzZjMWZiZjkwMTVlMDRhMThmNzhiN2E2MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/d0501279876bbd4338d04623b0149fbdd4a43783","sha":"d0501279876bbd4338d04623b0149fbdd4a43783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/d0501279876bbd4338d04623b0149fbdd4a43783"}],"sha":"54463a9d355bbf76c1fbf9015e04a18f78b7a636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/54463a9d355bbf76c1fbf9015e04a18f78b7a636"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/d0501279876bbd4338d04623b0149fbdd4a43783/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T10:50:33Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T10:50:33Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(decisions): Lane H 검증 수치 + [95]가 [107]을 잡은 기록\n\n전 스위트 362/0 exit 0(357→362, [107] 신규 5건), spotcheck 33개 등재 호출 전부 기대\nexit 일치·보호 census 66 files/70 anchors/0 findings 불변(래칫 66→66 superset),\nkill-proof 72/72 비공허(바닥 71→72), manifest integrity 92 ids/90 chain/0 changed,\nheadline 107 guards.\n\n메타가드 [95]가 같은 웨이브에서 추가된 [107]의 정규식 fallback을 적발한 사실을 기록한다\n(PyYAML 부재 시 react id를 46으로 오독하고 PASS). 잔여 1건 명시: source는 같은데 body가\n다른 교차카탈로그 발산은 두 가드 사이의 무주공산이다(현재 인스턴스 0).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6def6c82729b611a3c194355cdfbc3e8b801c1aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/6def6c82729b611a3c194355cdfbc3e8b801c1aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/d0501279876bbd4338d04623b0149fbdd4a43783","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/d0501279876bbd4338d04623b0149fbdd4a43783","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGQwNTAxMjc5ODc2YmJkNDMzOGQwNDYyM2IwMTQ5ZmJkZDRhNDM3ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/c19965b5f5210a3348229cd8e35e59dd8cd3a00d","sha":"c19965b5f5210a3348229cd8e35e59dd8cd3a00d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/c19965b5f5210a3348229cd8e35e59dd8cd3a00d"}],"sha":"d0501279876bbd4338d04623b0149fbdd4a43783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/d0501279876bbd4338d04623b0149fbdd4a43783"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/c19965b5f5210a3348229cd8e35e59dd8cd3a00d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T10:34:12Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T10:34:12Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): [107] PyYAML fallback 제거 — 메타가드 [95]가 잡은 침묵 성능저하 봉합\n\npyyaml_preflight_coverage_guard가 신규 가드의 hand-rolled 라인 리더를 즉시 적발했다:\nPyYAML 부재를 시뮬레이션하면 fallback이 practices-react id를 46개로 읽고(진실 42)\n그대로 PASS를 출력했다 — 트리의 census가 아닌 것에 대한 green 판정.\n\nprovenance 필드를 대조하는 가드에 정규식 fallback을 두는 것은 이 카탈로그가 반복해서\n잡아온 바로 그 결함이므로 fallback을 없애고 다른 28개 의존 가드와 동일한 fail-closed\npreflight로 교체한다: PyYAML 없으면 판정 없음(exit 2).\n\n라이브 exit 0(4 shared / 3 agree / 1 grandfathered), fixture 4종 0/1/1/1 불변,\n[95] pyyaml_preflight_coverage exit 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35f27af742b48b7895cdca69229a7eae2885efde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/35f27af742b48b7895cdca69229a7eae2885efde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/c19965b5f5210a3348229cd8e35e59dd8cd3a00d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/c19965b5f5210a3348229cd8e35e59dd8cd3a00d","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGMxOTk2NWI1ZjUyMTBhMzM0ODIyOWNkOGUzNWU1OWRkOGNkM2EwMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/792a0e162ab58c13c8b23a2733c7e1dc847d22cd","sha":"792a0e162ab58c13c8b23a2733c7e1dc847d22cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/792a0e162ab58c13c8b23a2733c7e1dc847d22cd"}],"sha":"c19965b5f5210a3348229cd8e35e59dd8cd3a00d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/c19965b5f5210a3348229cd8e35e59dd8cd3a00d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/792a0e162ab58c13c8b23a2733c7e1dc847d22cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T10:12:28Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T10:12:28Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"feat(gates): P3-137 카탈로그 간 upstream_id 충돌 금지 가드 [107] + P2-72 경계 논거 기각\n\nP3-137 — 같은 upstream_id가 두 카탈로그에서 다른 source를 가리키는 계열을 금지한다.\ntemplates 인용은 practices-FIRST로 해석되므로 인용의 진위가 해석 순서로 갈린다(Lane G 실측:\npractices 사본 제거 시 exit 0 → exit 1 / 4 findings). 불변식은 \"공유 금지\"가 아니라 \"source\n일치\" — 라이브 census 실측 61 x 42에서 공유 4건 중 3건(next-themes / stripe-billing /\ntoss-billing)은 양쪽 source가 동일한 정당한 공유다.\n\n개명은 양쪽 모두 거부됨을 클론에서 직접 측정: react 개명 → RECEIPT_ORPHANED exit 2,\npractices 개명 → RECEIPT_ORPHANED exit 2 + 보호 스윕 exit 1(66 files / 70 anchors / 4\nfindings). _FETCH-RECEIPTS.yaml은 append-only로 id를 fetch된 본문에 결박하므로 id는 라벨이\n아니라 provenance 기록의 일부다. 따라서 1건은 동결 frozenset으로 grandfather하되, 비중복성\n(양쪽 등록 + source 일치 시 STALE_GRANDFATHER)으로 padding이 될 수 없게 했다.\n\nfixtures 4종(pass / 충돌 / stale-grandfather / 공유본문 미등록), 충돌 fixture는 [87]\nkill-proof 등재(anchor ''a != b'' → neuter ''False''), 바닥 71→72 양쪽 래칫.\n\nP2-72 — \"아무도 스케줄하지 않는다\"를 설계 경계로 닫으려던 논거를 repo 사실로 검증해 기각한다.\n자율성 경계는 fork-receiver에게 게이트를 강제하지 않는다는 뜻이고, 이 repo는 자기 프로브를\n이미 스케줄한다(.github/workflows 크론 3개 + push/PR sentinel). 행은 열어두고 호출 시점을\npractices/MAINTAINER.md §5d에 문서화. 가장 싼 처방은 Linux 러너(대소문자-민감 + 바이트 보존)\n이나 이 트리의 가드는 macOS에서만 실행된 적이 있어 Linux 청결성은 미측정 — 미측정 전제로\n워크플로를 출하하지 않았다.\n\n헤드라인 정합: 디스크 가드 106 → 107 (README x3 / CLAUDE.md x2 / SKILL.md x2), 이미 썩어\n있던 비가드 산문 2건 정정(*_guard.sh 105→107, live guards 95→102).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0c3fda53106e8dedd40b67e9f2fed1883a0f76b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/c0c3fda53106e8dedd40b67e9f2fed1883a0f76b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/792a0e162ab58c13c8b23a2733c7e1dc847d22cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_u