ubscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/cf42258f17e59adbd6bd5113ef77713198e76208/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T04:51:44Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T04:51:44Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(backlog): Lane G — P2-73 종결, P2-72 잔여 명시, P3-137 등재. 314/316\n\nP2-73: Lane A 처방이 측정으로 뒤집혔다 — templates 인용은 practices-FIRST 해석이고\npractices 쪽 wcag-22-techniques는 Understanding 페이지라 규범 문장을 verbatim 보유\n(react 쪽만 인덱스). 클론에서 practices 사본 제거 시 스윕 exit0→exit1(4 findings)로 실증.\n또한 카운트 고정 respell은 설계상 불법(exit 5 PROTECTED_IDENTITY_REMOVED, ''핀 집합은\nGROW만'') → 가산 래칫 5면 64→66.\nP2-72: 메커니즘 출하(ax-case-sensitive-sweep.sh, 2회 357/0) + leak 검사가 공허했던 것을\n실행 중 자체 적발·봉합. 행은 ''아무도 스케줄하지 않는다''는 잔여로 열어둔다.\nP3-137: 같은 upstream_id가 두 카탈로그에서 다른 페이지를 가리키는 naming hazard.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53e09da0d3611ec1ae3b5d075908cbf59d41fb28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/53e09da0d3611ec1ae3b5d075908cbf59d41fb28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/cf42258f17e59adbd6bd5113ef77713198e76208","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs