hodologies/ax-template/commits/8815c93b286fd8f249b40a54571e4497de10920e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T04:33:23Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T04:33:23Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(decisions): Lane G 측정 기록 — B분류 해석 측정·respell 거부(exit 5)·가산 래칫 64→66 + P2-72 상시 작업","tree":{"sha":"6cb3bb13ccb9a52de1fec8bba50627b8d151245f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/6cb3bb13ccb9a52de1fec8bba50627b8d151245f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/8815c93b286fd8f249b40a54571e4497de10920e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/8815c93b286fd8f249b40a54571e4497de10920e","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDg4MTVjOTNiMjg2ZmQ4ZjI0OWI0MGE1NDU3MWU0NDk3ZGUxMDkyMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/be527fad0ace4128411bb816f74831e1c5b4f1d4","sha":"be527fad0ace4128411bb816f74831e1c5b4f1d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/be527fad0ace4128411bb816f74831e1c5b4f1d4"}],"sha":"8815c93b286fd8f249b40a54571e4497de10920e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/8815c93b286fd8f249b40a54571e4497de10920e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/be527fad0ace4128411bb816f74831e1c5b4f1d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T04:32:29Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T04:32:29Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"feat(gates): P2-72 상시 작업 신설 — 대소문자-민감 볼륨 스윕을 재현 가능하게\n\nP2-72의 완전 처방은 \"aliasing 하지 않는 파일시스템에서 스위트를 실제로 돌리는 것\"이고,\nLane F가 그 baseline을 손으로 한 번 소진했다(대소문자-민감 APFS + HEAD 클린 클론 +\nrun-all-guards --include-fixtures → 357/357, 937s). 한 번 한 것은 상시 성질이 아니다.\n이 커밋은 그 실행을 스크립트로 고정한다.\n\npractices/scripts/ax-case-sensitive-sweep.sh:\n- hdiutil로 Case-sensitive APFS sparse 이미지 생성·attach\n- probe: 진짜 대소문자-민감인지 검사(아니면 exit 4). 정규화 민감성은 보고만\n  (이 볼륨은 NFC/NFD를 접는다 — 측정됨). 커버 못 하는 걸 커버한 척하지 않는다.\n- HEAD(또는 --rev)를 볼륨 위에 클론하고 클론 HEAD sha를 대조\n- 그 안에서 run-all-guards.sh --include-fixtures 실행, tally/exit/wall 보고\n- EXIT trap에서 detach + 잔류 검증. 잔류 시 exit 5.\n- 소리내어 실패한다: hdiutil 없음 exit 3 / 볼륨이 aliasing exit 4 / 잔류 exit 5.\n  조용한 skip 없음 — 상시 작업의 침묵은 행을 닫힌 것처럼 읽히게 만든다.\n- 스스로 커버 안 한 것을 출력한다: gradle 스텝(JDK 미프로비저닝) · npm 스텝\n  (node_modules 미프로비저닝) · R25 전체 · 유니코드 정규화 · 커밋된 리비전 한정.\n\n첫 상시 실행(rev cd9210e): 357 passed / 0 failed, exit 0, 932s — Lane F의 357/357을\n스크립트가 재현. 대소문자-민감 볼륨에서만 깨지는 가드 0.\n\nleak 검사 비공허성: 최초 구현의 `hdiutil info | grep -F \"$MNT\"`는 실제 누수를\n놓친다 — hdiutil은 /private 해석 스펠링을, mktemp는 /var 스펠링(+TMPDIR 이중 슬래시)을\n쓴다. 첫 실행 중 측정: grep -c = 0인데 mount에는 붙어 있었다. 두 스펠링 x 두 소스\n(hdiutil info + mount) 술어로 교체하고, 매 실행 positive control로 무장한다 —\n붙어 있는 볼륨이 술어에 보이지 않으면 그 실행은 exit 5로 거부된다(실패할 수 없는\n검사는 검사가 아니다). --probe-only가 16분 스윕 없이 이 lifecycle만 초 단위로 재검증한다.\n\n실패 상세 grep도 `^MISMATCH`(런너가 절대 출력하지 않는 문자열)에서\n`^FAIL [`로 교체 — 진짜 실패 시 아무것도 안 찍히는 것이 상시 작업의 침묵 결함이다.\n\nCLAUDE.md의 Enforcement surfaces에 등재: periodic/manual, merge gate 아님, 호출은 사람 몫.","tree":{"sha":"aa5d4dfa060107214c2c29f2d063c33cc554394d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/aa5d4dfa060107214c2c29f2d063c33cc554394d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/be527fad0ace4128411bb816f74831e1c5b4f1d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/be527fad0ace4128411bb816f74831e1c5b4f1d4","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGJlNTI3ZmFkMGFjZTQxMjg0MTFiYjgxNmY3NDgzMWUxYzViNGYxZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/cd9210eb9d8dad9a15bc9dcc78f0bc52f95f31eb","sha":"cd9210eb9d8dad9a15bc9dcc78f0bc52f95f31eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/cd9210eb9d8dad9a15bc9dcc78f0bc52f95f31eb"}],"sha":"be527fad0ace4128411bb816f74831e1c5b4f1d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/be527fad0ace4128411bb816f74831e1c5b4f1d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/cd9210eb9d8dad9a15bc9dcc78f0bc52f95f31eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T04:08:31Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T04:08:31Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(evidence): P2-73 B-class 2건을 가산 래칫으로 봉합 — 보호 앵커 64→66 (skeleton/sonner)\n\nLane A의 B분류 처방(upstream_id를 wcag-2-2로 교체)은 측정 결과 불필요하고\n동시에 불법이다.\n\n불필요: templates/** 인용은 practices-FIRST로 해석된다\n(resolve_snapshot_any_catalog). 그런데 같은 id가 두 카탈로그에 서로 다른\n페이지로 등재돼 있다 — practices/upstream/wcag-22-techniques-2026-05 은\nSC 4.1.3 **Understanding** 페이지(2026-08-01 재fetch, 영수증 r158, HTTP 200)로\n문제의 규범 문장을 verbatim 보유하고, practices-react/upstream 쪽만 Techniques\n**인덱스**라 그 문장이 없다. 라이브 보호 스윕이 green인 것은 게이트가 잠들어서가\n아니라 Understanding 본문이 실제로 해석되기 때문이다.\n\n불법: 교체는 보호 identity의 제거다. 카운트 64 고정 상태에서 측정 —\n원장만 교체 → PROTECTED_LEDGER_REQUIRED_IDENTITY_MISSING (exit 2),\n원장+frozenset 둘 다 교체 후 커밋(throwaway clone) → PROTECTED_IDENTITY_REMOVED\n(exit 5, vs origin/main). subset 검사가 존재하는 이유인 SUBSTITUTION 사례 그대로다.\n\n그래서 인용을 옮기지 않고 **더 강하게 앵커**했다: 두 파일에 wcag-2-2\n(WCAG 2.2 Recommendation, tier 1, practices-react/upstream) 앵커를 추가해 같은\n규범 문장을 선언한다. 인용문은 비-heading prose block의 substring임을 확인.\nfatal set에서 빠지는 것은 없고 둘이 늘어나며, 주장이 카탈로그 해석 순서에\n의존하지 않게 된다.\n\nFIVE-SURFACE 래칫 64→66 (다섯 면 동시): 원장 rows + `# require:` +\n`# min_entries:` + LIVE_REQUIRED_PROTECTED_IDENTITIES + LIVE_MIN_PROTECTED_ENTRIES.","tree":{"sha":"152363095b48e40c73fa542bf36dbce1d7e63cfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/152363095b48e40c73fa542bf36dbce1d7e63cfd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/cd9210eb9d8dad9a15bc9dcc78f0bc52f95f31eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/cd9210eb9d8dad9a15bc9dcc78f0bc52f95f31eb","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGNkOTIxMGViOWQ4ZGFkOWExNWJjOWRjYzc4ZjBiYzUyZjk1ZjMxZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/4b161fd7ac6b3788e74f2afd93b7c67706fdcfc4","sha":"4b161fd7ac6b3788e74f2afd93b7c67706fdcfc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/4b161fd7ac6b3788e74f2afd93b7c67706fdcfc4"}],"sha":"cd9210eb9d8dad9a15bc9dcc78f0bc52f95f31eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/cd9210eb9d8dad9a15bc9dcc78f0bc52f95f31eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/4b161fd7ac6b3788e74f2afd93b7c67706fdcfc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:59:17Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:59:17Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(backlog): 수렴 테이블을 디스크 진실로 정정 — 313/315\n\n직전 커밋에서 내가 P3 분모를 134로 적었으나 디스크는 135였다(Lane F가 웨이브 중 행을\n하나 더 등재). backlog_convergence_integrity_guard가 즉시 잡아냈고, 이것이 이 가드의\n존재 이유다 — 수치를 손으로 관리하면 반드시 어긋난다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8329ee7121c5c9e226f99d549a31a2facfed7d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/8329ee7121c5c9e226f99d549a31a2facfed7d0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/4b161fd7ac6b3788e74f2afd93b7c67706fdcfc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/4b161fd7ac6b3788e74f2afd93b7c67706fdcfc4","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDRiMTYxZmQ3YWM2YjM3ODhlNzRmMmFmZDkzYjdjNjc3MDZmZGNmYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/74de21718d0ba46cf3b1f1518d51a7e99159c801","sha":"74de21718d0ba46cf3b1f1518d51a7e99159c801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/74de21718d0ba46cf3b1f1518d51a7e99159c801"}],"sha":"4b161fd7ac6b3788e74f2afd93b7c67706fdcfc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/4b161fd7ac6b3788e74f2afd93b7c67706fdcfc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/74de21718d0ba46cf3b1f1518d51a7e99159c801/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:59:01Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:59:01Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(backlog): Lane F 7행 종결 — 312/314 (99%), P0/P1/P3 열림 0\n\nP3-131+132를 하나의 P1으로 격상 봉합(수신자-해석 패리티 4분류, GIT_SYMLINK_RECEIVER_DIVERGENCE\nexit 17, 수신자를 인덱스로 시뮬레이션) — 그 과정에서 **오탐 대조군 자체가 틀려 있던 것**을 발견:\nr13_legit의 ''정당한 13형태''에 R14b가 지목해둔 공격 형태 2개가 들어 있었다.\nP3-126 누적 키(O(d²)→O(d), 파티션 동일 실측, 라이브 +6.5%는 숨기지 않음) · P3-118 계측+상한\n둘 다(첫 계측 실행이 경고한 flake를 즉시 실현시켜 근거 기반 면제) · P2-74 normalize 통합\n(라이브 인용이 가드의 망가진 스펠링으로 다시 쓰여 있었음을 발견·복원) · P2-75 교착 해소\n(날조 manifest 레코드 삭제, RED 08-17→10-13 소멸) · P3-136 6줄(행은 5줄이라 했음).\n잔여 2건은 실제 작업이 남은 것: P2-72 상시 작업, P2-73 보호원장 5면 래칫 2건.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"99b24acc5313734f43a8ba4bd3aae7a928886269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/99b24acc5313734f43a8ba4bd3aae7a928886269"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/74de21718d0ba46cf3b1f1518d51a7e99159c801","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/74de21718d0ba46cf3b1f1518d51a7e99159c801","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDc0ZGUyMTcxOGQwYmE0NmNmM2IxZjE1MThkNTFhN2U5OTE1OWM4MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/5a857306e1f3fb595ff270569e645792f0c25b82","sha":"5a857306e1f3fb595ff270569e645792f0c25b82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/5a857306e1f3fb595ff270569e645792f0c25b82"}],"sha":"74de21718d0ba46cf3b1f1518d51a7e99159c801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/74de21718d0ba46cf3b1f1518d51a7e99159c801"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/5a857306e1f3fb595ff270569e645792f0c25b82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:38:01Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:38:01Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(evidence): P2-73 — 라이브 페이지에 없는 인용 27건 중 18파일 봉합(재앵커/삭제/내부주장 재라벨)\n\nLane A가 실측한 \"갱신된 id에 앵커된 140 인용 중 27건이 라이브 페이지에 부재\"를 처리한다.\n스냅숏 본문이 append-only로 갱신돼 있으므로(원 바이트 보존 + 2026-08-01 extractor 원출력\n덧붙임) **현행 페이지 텍스트가 커밋된 스냅숏 안에** 있고, 따라서 분류·재앵커를 전부\n오프라인·결정론적으로 수행했다. 덧붙여진 영역에 있으면 C(이동), 어디에도 없으면 A(창작).\n\n처리 원칙: **없는 말을 한 출처에 귀속시키는 인용은 거짓 provenance 주장**이다(heatmap.tsx\n선례). 그래서\n- C(실제 이동) — 현행 문장으로 **verbatim 재앵커**. 지어내지 않고 스냅숏에서 바이트를 복사.\n- A(창작/각색) — 인용을 **삭제**하거나, 페이지가 실제로 말하는 문장으로 재앵커하고\n  원래 주장은 **이 템플릿의 설계 결정**임을 명시. 좁아지는 경우 좁아진다고 적었다\n  (error-boundary의 key-reset, offline-banner의 visibilitychange 재확인이 그 예 —\n  MDN은 그런 조언을 하지 않는다. 이제 그것은 우리 설계이고 그렇게 적혀 있다).\n- B(잘못된 granularity) — billing-event-idempotent의 toss 앵커는 **재앵커 불가라 삭제**:\n  그 upstream_id는 자동결제(빌링) OVERVIEW 페이지를 가리키는데 2026-08-01 extractor\n  출력에 \"멱등\"·\"Idempotency\" 토큰이 **0회**다. 문장 자체는 실재하는 Toss 문서지만 인용된\n  페이지에는 없다. 규칙의 외부 근거는 Stripe 앵커와 IETF draft가 이미 지고 있다.\n\n모든 변경은 **날짜 기입 주석**을 동반한다 — 무엇이 바뀌었고, 왜이며, 어느 측정에\n근거하는지. 인용을 가드의 내부 표현에 맞춰 왜곡한 곳은 없다(그건 P2-74가 방금 닫은 결함).\n\n**미처리(정직하게)**: skeleton.tsx / sonner.tsx의 B계열 2건은 손대지 않았다 —\n보호 원장 identity라 upstream_id 교체가 PROTECTED_LEDGER_ANCHOR_ABSENT를 밟고,\n5면 래칫(rows + require + min_entries + LIVE_MIN_PROTECTED_ENTRIES + frozenset)을\n동시 편집해야 한다. 행이 명시적으로 허용한 \"기록된 사유와 함께 남긴다\"를 택했다.\n정답 본문은 이미 카탈로그가 보유한 wcag-2-2 스냅숏에 verbatim 존재하므로 교체 자체는\n가능하며, 남은 것은 래칫 작업뿐이다.\n\n측정: evidence_guard(practices/practices-react) · evidence_quote_spotcheck\n(--strict / --include-templates / --strict-templates --templates-only-protected) 전부 exit 0.","tree":{"sha":"efcf6a3371b4109d59f5e236d40cd14fa69a4225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/efcf6a3371b4109d59f5e236d40cd14fa69a4225"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/5a857306e1f3fb595ff270569e645792f0c25b82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/5a857306e1f3fb595ff270569e645792f0c25b82","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDVhODU3MzA2ZTFmM2ZiNTk1ZmYyNzA1NjllNjQ1NzkyZjBjMjViODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/c127774f4ca46032a6b90a2c26782ba391b42f7a","sha":"c127774f4ca46032a6b90a2c26782ba391b42f7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/c127774f4ca46032a6b90a2c26782ba391b42f7a"}],"sha":"5a857306e1f3fb595ff270569e645792f0c25b82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/5a857306e1f3fb595ff270569e645792f0c25b82"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/c127774f4ca46032a6b90a2c26782ba391b42f7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:36:35Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:36:35Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): P3-118 상한 상수를 측정치로 교체 + fixture_kill_proof 면제 — 첫 실행이 잡은 실제 flake\n\n계측을 켠 **바로 그 실행**에서 새 상한이 fixture_kill_proof를 exit 124로 죽였다.\n이 커밋이 경고 산문에 적어둔 flake 실패 모드가 즉시 실현된 것이므로, 추측이 아니라\n증거로 처리한다: 무제한 재측정 **333.9초, exit 0**. 이 가드는 모든 셸 가드의 fail\n픽스처를 뮤테이션(가드를 무력화하고 재실행)하므로 작업량이 본질적으로 O(가드 수)이고\n카탈로그와 함께 자란다 = 설계상 긴 계열(두 prover와 동류) -> 면제.\n\n상수도 측정치로 교체(311 invocation 전수 sweep, 2026-08-01):\n  전체 population   median 0.074s · p95 2.55s · p99 28.1s\n  capped population median 0.075s · p95 2.34s · p99 **10.27s** · MAX 77.4s\n                    (resume_provenance/live — 진짜로 77초 걸린다)\nk=20 · p99=11 -> 220s 이고 floor 300s가 실제로 구속. 실제로 capped 되는 가장 느린\n가드(77.4s) 대비 **3.9배 여유**. 면제 항목도 각각 측정된 숫자를 헤더에 적었다\n(hermetic_runtime ~94s / fixture_kill_proof ~334s) — ''느리다''는 단언이 아니라 측정.","tree":{"sha":"8844ae1e5d968cbc981f1da59b444afd62803bf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/8844ae1e5d968cbc981f1da59b444afd62803bf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/c127774f4ca46032a6b90a2c26782ba391b42f7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/c127774f4ca46032a6b90a2c26782ba391b42f7a","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGMxMjc3NzRmNGNhNDYwMzJhNmI5MGEyYzI2NzgyYmEzOTFiNDJmN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/9678900b0090d2c1bcbf2214811f8874e6856f4e","sha":"9678900b0090d2c1bcbf2214811f8874e6856f4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9678900b0090d2c1bcbf2214811f8874e6856f4e"}],"sha":"c127774f4ca46032a6b90a2c26782ba391b42f7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/c127774f4ca46032a6b90a2c26782ba391b42f7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9678900b0090d2c1bcbf2214811f8874e6856f4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:33:55Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:33:55Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(evidence): P2-75 교착 해소 — 옵션 (a) 측정-실패 기록 후 옵션 (b) 실행, 날조 manifest 레코드 삭제\n\n교착: pipa-article-24-2026-05가 practices를 2026-08-17 time_decay RED로 몰았는데\n재fetch도 삭제도 막혀 있었다(ADR evidence가 upstream_id를 인용 → evidence_guard BLOCK).\n\n옵션 (a) 측정-실패 (부정 결과를 기록해 다음 사람이 헤더를 다시 시도하지 않게 한다):\nlaw.go.kr 심층 조문 라우트는 HTTP 200 + 5278바이트의 자기 과부하 페이지를 준다\n(title 국가법령정보센터 | 오류페이지). 최신 데스크톱 Chrome User-Agent를 붙여도 응답이\n바이트 동일하고, Accept/Accept-Language: ko-KR/--compressed/Referer를 다 붙여도\nContent-Language 응답 헤더만 화장품처럼 바뀐다. m.law.go.kr는 Apache 레벨 404.\n사이트 루트는 정상 리다이렉트 → UA 스니핑 벽이 아니라 그 한 라우트의 백엔드 조건.\n정적 헤더로는 못 가져온다. (부수 정정: 기존 서술의 \"iframe 셸\"도 부정확 — iframe 0건,\n그냥 오류 문서다.)\n\n결정적 사실: practices/upstream/pipa-article-24-2026-05.snapshot.md는 디스크에 없다\n(find/git ls-files 모두 0). 얇은 스텁이 아니라 본문이 아예 없다. 그리고 manifest의\nsha는 c5d6e7f8a9b0c1d2... — rolling-nibble placeholder, 즉 한 번도 fetch된 적 없는\n파일에 대한 날조된 digest다. 2026-08-01에 삭제된 kisa-identity-verification-2026-05과\n정확히 같은 날조 계열이며, 이것만 살아남은 이유는 ADR이 인용했기 때문이다 — 본문 없는\n등록이 그것을 향한 인용에 의해 연명하고, 그 인용은 등록 덕에 정직해 보였다. 아무것도\n없는 것 위에 가드 두 개가 서로를 받치고 있었다.\n\n옵션 (b) 실행(사용자가 이 한 항목에 명시 승인, 가시적·날짜 기입 정정 조건):\n- templates/DECISIONS.md[TD-2026-05-18-031]의 evidence에서 upstream_id/section 제거,\n  source_type: external이 요구하는 url 추가. 법령 조문·시행일은 citation 안에 그대로\n  남아 검증 가능. url은 심층 조문 라우트가 아니라 법령 자체(측정: HTTP 200, 1279B,\n  title=개인정보보호법, 과부하 문자열 0건) — 법률 인용의 권위는 제정된 법과 조문\n  번호이지 특정 포털의 렌더링이 아니다.\n- 정정 주석을 가시적으로·날짜와 함께 본문에 삽입(무엇을·왜·무엇을 측정했는지).\n- 산문의 거짓 provenance도 정정: \"@LegalBasis 패턴을 pipa 스냅숏이 문서화한다\"는\n  존재한 적 없는 파일에 귀속시킨 주장이었다. 패턴은 이 카탈로그 자신의 설계다.\n- 그리고 _MANIFEST.yaml의 날조 레코드를 삭제. 인용이 사라졌고 본문도 없으므로 그\n  레코드는 아무것도 기록하지 않는다.\n\n측정된 결과: evidence_guard 양 카탈로그 exit 0, time_decay 양 카탈로그 exit 0,\nmanifest_snapshot_integrity exit 0. practices RED가 2026-08-17 → 2026-10-13으로\n이동(+57일, 이제 최고령은 iso-4217 2026-07-14). RED를 미룬 게 아니라 사유를 없앴다.","tree":{"sha":"fc6cb06441eac4f52c967bb0b0bb0c510c0d5dad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/fc6cb06441eac4f52c967bb0b0bb0c510c0d5dad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/9678900b0090d2c1bcbf2214811f8874e6856f4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/9678900b0090d2c1bcbf2214811f8874e6856f4e","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDk2Nzg5MDBiMDA5MGQyYzFiY2JmMjIxNDgxMWY4ODc0ZTY4NTZmNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/486d767dc3da05201bdd46381790e5ba785dac90","sha":"486d767dc3da05201bdd46381790e5ba785dac90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/486d767dc3da05201bdd46381790e5ba785dac90"}],"sha":"9678900b0090d2c1bcbf2214811f8874e6856f4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9678900b0090d2c1bcbf2214811f8874e6856f4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/486d767dc3da05201bdd46381790e5ba785dac90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:18:41Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:18:41Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"feat(gates): P3-118 per-guard 계측 + per-guard 상한 (외부 2700s는 불변)\n\n행의 지적: hard-guards 스텝이 **하나의** 2700초 예산을 sweep 전체에 걸고 어디에 시간이\n갔는지 아무도 기록하지 않아 ''느린 guard''와 ''멈춘 guard''를 구분할 수 없었고, ''45분은\nDoS 창''이라는 정직한 진술 밑에 데이터가 없었다.\n\n(1) 계측 — run_guard가 모든 호출이 지나는 단일 chokepoint이므로 거기서 wall time을\n    잰다. 매 실행 끝에 느린 순 15행 표 + n/total/median/p95/p99/max 요약을 출력하고,\n    AX_GUARD_TIMING_TSV 지정 시 label/seconds/exit TSV로도 적는다. 시계는 python\n    time.monotonic(있으면) / $SECONDS(없으면)이고 **어느 쪽을 썼는지 출력한다** —\n    계측기를 밝히지 않은 측정은 측정이 아니다(BSD date에 %s%N 없음, $SECONDS는 1초\n    해상도라 대부분 guard에 무용).\n\n(2) 상한 = max(k·p99, floor), **k=20 · floor=300s**. 근거를 논박 가능하게 적는다:\n    라이브 sweep의 p99는 ~5.6s라 k·p99≈112s로 floor 아래이고 실제로 구속하는 것은\n    floor다. k=20은 typical case가 아니라 **실패 모드**에 맞춘 값 — guard 런타임은\n    머신 부하·콜드 캐시·fork-receiver 트리 크기에 따라 한 자릿수 이상 흔들리고,\n    느린 노트북에서 발화하는 상한은 이 게이트를 강제 표면에서 **flake**로 바꾼다.\n    flaky 게이트는 꺼지므로 그건 닫으려던 DoS 창보다 엄격히 나쁘다. floor=300s는\n    k·p99만으로는 몇 초짜리 상한이 나와 어떤 fork-receiver도 못 버티기 때문.\n    **외부 2700s 스텝 예산은 불변** — 이 상한은 ''멈춘 guard 하나가 그 예산을 전부\n    삼키지 못하게'' 할 뿐이고 그것이 행이 요구한 것이다.\n    면제는 명시·소수: 두 prover(hermetic-runtime은 던져버릴 git 샌드박스를 수십 개\n    만들어 돌린다, 여기서 ~200s)는 설계상 길고 외부 예산으로 대신 묶인다. 면제는\n    이 파일 안 label prefix라 추가가 환경변수가 아니라 리뷰되는 편집이다.\n    정직한 한계: timeout(1)이 없는 머신(macOS 기본)에서는 gtimeout을 찾고, 둘 다\n    없으면 **계측 전용으로 강등되며 그렇다고 소리내어 말한다**(조용히 강제하는 척\n    하지 않는다). 상한에 걸린 guard는 exit 124/137로 기대값과 불일치하므로 **FAIL로\n    집계된다** — fail-closed, hang이 pass로 바뀌는 경로는 없다.","tree":{"sha":"8d9e8896a30c13994fddaa69efb7ca5ef58b0dc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/8d9e8896a30c13994fddaa69efb7ca5ef58b0dc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/486d767dc3da05201bdd46381790e5ba785dac90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars