tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/aadcb64cf045a1a68dfeb6cf874aaa5fbf555b43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:16:50Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:16:50Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(prover): PASS 배너를 라운드 15까지 갱신 — 배너가 자기 커버리지를 과소진술하는 것도 과대진술과 같은 등급의 결함(P3-125 교훈)","tree":{"sha":"b6dad057fba86560839d00c92f59973f17d7d682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/b6dad057fba86560839d00c92f59973f17d7d682"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/aadcb64cf045a1a68dfeb6cf874aaa5fbf555b43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/aadcb64cf045a1a68dfeb6cf874aaa5fbf555b43","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGFhZGNiNjRjZjA0NWExYTY4ZGZlYjZjZjg3NGFhYTVmYmY1NTViNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/b3c26a6c0c899486632e2d863b22bf56cbca1cb6","sha":"b3c26a6c0c899486632e2d863b22bf56cbca1cb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/b3c26a6c0c899486632e2d863b22bf56cbca1cb6"}],"sha":"aadcb64cf045a1a68dfeb6cf874aaa5fbf555b43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/aadcb64cf045a1a68dfeb6cf874aaa5fbf555b43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/b3c26a6c0c899486632e2d863b22bf56cbca1cb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:14:36Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:14:36Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"test(prover): 라운드 15가 독립적으로 잡는 twin에 composite neuter 도입\n\ntwin의 존재 이유는 ''어떤 라운드의 refusal이 그 라운드에 귀속된다''를 보이는 것이고,\n그 논증은 **더 나중 라운드가 같은 트리를 독립적으로 잡지 않는 동안에만** 성립한다.\n라운드 15(수신자-패리티)는 14/14b를 computation-neuter 하면 같은 트리를 잡는다 —\nalias census가 더 이상 인식하지 못하는 타깃은 패리티 census 입장에서 그냥\n''여기선 해석·수신자는 불가''이고 그건 **참**이다(defence in depth이지 결함이 아님).\n측정: (AN2)/(AQ2)/(AR2)/(AS2)/(AT2)가 0->1로 뒤집히고 (AN3)/(AQ3)은 자기가 단언하는\n코드 대신 패리티 코드를 보고했다.\n\nround9_neuter가 콤마 구분 composite를 받도록 확장하고, 해당 twin 7개를 두 라운드\n동시 neuter로 갱신 — 그래야 다시 lands 하는 것이 정확히 한 라운드에 귀속된다.","tree":{"sha":"21429adf2843a165fae3f2d1df0f736563ecad97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/21429adf2843a165fae3f2d1df0f736563ecad97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/b3c26a6c0c899486632e2d863b22bf56cbca1cb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/b3c26a6c0c899486632e2d863b22bf56cbca1cb6","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGIzYzI2YTZjMGM4OTk0ODY2MzJlMmQ4NjNiMjJiZjU2Y2JjYTFjYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/a3dbedc8980924a8f95aacf4ec479cb83b6c9a22","sha":"a3dbedc8980924a8f95aacf4ec479cb83b6c9a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/a3dbedc8980924a8f95aacf4ec479cb83b6c9a22"}],"sha":"b3c26a6c0c899486632e2d863b22bf56cbca1cb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/b3c26a6c0c899486632e2d863b22bf56cbca1cb6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/a3dbedc8980924a8f95aacf4ec479cb83b6c9a22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:11:24Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:11:24Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): 수신자-패리티가 alias 계열을 흡수하던 것을 경계로 축소 (P3-131/132 후속)\n\n문제: class 2 규칙(\"여기선 해석·수신자는 불가\")이 라운드 13/14/14b의 alias 계열을\n전부 흡수했다 — 별칭 스펠링은 정의상 추적 경로가 아니므로 수신자 시뮬레이션이 항상\n실패한다. 측정: (AJ2) 이후 **모든** neutered twin이 exit 0 -> 신규 코드로 뒤집혀\n라운드별 귀속이 무너졌다.\n\n경계(사면이 아니라): 별칭 타깃은 **내용은 ship 된다** — 스펠링만 수신자 파일시스템이\n서비스하지 않는 것이고, 그것이 라운드 13/14/14b의 주제·코드·처방(ln -sf <기록된 스펠링>)이다.\nalias census가 판정을 가진 링크는 패리티 census가 건드리지 않는다. 빠져나가는 것은 없다 —\n그 링크는 이미 자기 코드로 BLOCK 중이고 그 판정이 이 census보다 **먼저** 계산된다.\n\n두 구현 대칭(_symlink_target_verdicts가 subjects 집합을 반환 / 12c는 _symsubjects).","tree":{"sha":"d17646ff82245118e3c9e153688a3fa114b43367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/d17646ff82245118e3c9e153688a3fa114b43367"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/a3dbedc8980924a8f95aacf4ec479cb83b6c9a22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/a3dbedc8980924a8f95aacf4ec479cb83b6c9a22","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGEzZGJlZGM4OTgwOTI0YThmOTVhYWNmNGVjNDc5Y2I4M2I2YzlhMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/43774a6173b9b699a30866c982c9d6b6c1a8272c","sha":"43774a6173b9b699a30866c982c9d6b6c1a8272c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/43774a6173b9b699a30866c982c9d6b6c1a8272c"}],"sha":"a3dbedc8980924a8f95aacf4ec479cb83b6c9a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/a3dbedc8980924a8f95aacf4ec479cb83b6c9a22"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/43774a6173b9b699a30866c982c9d6b6c1a8272c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:07:00Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T03:08:22Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"feat(gates): P3-131+P3-132 봉합 — 수신자-해석 패리티 4분류(GIT_SYMLINK_RECEIVER_DIVERGENCE, exit 17)\n\n두 행은 같은 문장 하나에 기대어 닫혀 있었다 — \"dangling 링크는 이쪽과 수신자 쪽에서\n동일하게 깨져 있으므로 증거가 거짓말을 하지 않는다\". 독립 레인이 커밋된 내용만으로\n그 문장을 반증했다:\n (a) link -> build/out.txt (build/ gitignore, 아티팩트 존재) — status EMPTY(ignored는\n     untracked가 아니다), 클린트리 상수, 여기선 바이트를 서비스. 수신자(추적 경로만\n     담긴 fresh clone)는 DANGLING. \"동일하게 깨짐\"이 아니라 여기선 동작·거기선 파손.\n (b) 같은 형태의 절대경로판(자기 체크아웃 안쪽) — P3-131의 \"설계상 census 밖\"은\n     과소주장이었다. 같은 false-green 채널의 다른 스펠링일 뿐.\n\n봉합: 추적 심링크별 수신자-해석 패리티 4분류.\n 1 추적 내용으로 양쪽 해석 -> PASS\n 2 여기서만, UNTRACKED/IGNORED 내용을 경유 -> 증거 발산 -> BLOCK\n 3 ABSOLUTE 타깃이 이 체크아웃 안쪽 -> 증거 발산 -> BLOCK\n 4 양쪽 DANGLING -> 위생 기록만, 비차단(라운드 13 문장이 실제로 성립하는 유일한 형태)\nblock 판정 근거: 이 게이트군의 명제는 \"R25가 검증한 트리 = 푸시될 트리\" 하나이고\n2·3은 모든 로컬 신호가 green인 채 그 명제를 위조한다. 처방은 값싸고 로컬(타깃을\n추적하거나 링크를 커밋하지 않는다).\n비차단 유지(측정이지 정책이 아니게): 체크아웃 밖 절대 타깃(P3-131이 옳게 지목한\n경계) · repo를 벗어나는 상대 타깃 · class 4 · 수신자에선 되고 여기선 안 되는 형태\n(false-RED이지 false-green이 아니다).\n\n수신자 시뮬레이션은 디스크가 아니라 인덱스로 걷는다(추적 경로 + 그 디렉터리\n컴포넌트 + 추적 심링크의 기록된 타깃), 커널과 같은 component-by-component 규칙과 같은\n예산 2종. 두 구현 대칭(helper _receiver_resolves/_symlink_receiver_divergences +\nrecency guard 12c).\n\n오탐 대조군이 이번 라운드의 핵심 리스크라 대조군을 고쳤다: r13_legit의 13형태 중\nuntracked(=재현 a)와 viaunt(=경로만 미추적)는 legitimate이 아니었다 — R14b가\n직접 이 형태를 지목하고 \"dangling 계열(P3-132)로 이월\"한 바로 그것이다. 두 형태는 RED\narm (BA)/(BB)로 이동했고, 그 자리에 진짜 정당한 build-artifact 링크가 들어갔다:\nbuildlink -> build/artifact-absent.txt, 아티팩트 부재 = class 4 = exit 0. 즉 build 링크는\n증거가 정직한 동안 정당하고, 로컬 산출물이 증거를 거짓말하게 만드는 순간에만 발산이 된다.\n\nprover: (BA)/(BB)/(BC) RED + 구현별 twin (BA2/BA3/BA4/BB2/BC2) + (BD) 경계 대조군 +\n(AM) 갱신. 각 arm은 premise 단언 동반(추적 120000 · 트리 CLEAN · 여기선 해석됨 ·\n경유 내용이 진짜 미추적 / 절대 타깃이 진짜 안쪽).\n\n부수: P3-126이 옮긴 R11 neuter 앵커를 누적 키 라인으로 갱신(같은 의미 —\nb\"/\".join(c.lower()) == prefix.lower()).","tree":{"sha":"1f60a371a06c9dfa071fc94b9e459fed0303391c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/1f60a371a06c9dfa071fc94b9e459fed0303391c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/43774a6173b9b699a30866c982c9d6b6c1a8272c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/43774a6173b9b699a30866c982c9d6b6c1a8272c","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDQzNzc0YTYxNzNiOWI2OTlhMzA4NjZjOTgyYzlkNmI2YzFhODI3MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/f134d99685f5b95fae59d83d830a9a23d17ae2f5","sha":"f134d99685f5b95fae59d83d830a9a23d17ae2f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/f134d99685f5b95fae59d83d830a9a23d17ae2f5"}],"sha":"43774a6173b9b699a30866c982c9d6b6c1a8272c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/43774a6173b9b699a30866c982c9d6b6c1a8272c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/f134d99685f5b95fae59d83d830a9a23d17ae2f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:54:02Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:54:02Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"perf(gates): P3-126 prefix 맵 키를 누적 구성으로 — 폴드 작업 O(d²)→O(d), 두 구현 대칭\n\n라운드 10의 prefix 워크는 매 레벨에서 b\"/\".join(comps[:n])으로 전체 prefix를 다시\n이어붙이고 그 **전체 prefix**를 _fold_path_key에 넘겼다 — 깊이 d 경로당 평균 길이\nd/2 문자열에 대한 d회 폴드 = O(d²)의 유니코드 작업(decode + Cf 카테고리 스캔 + NFD\n+ casefold + NFC). 폴드는 ''/''를 가로질러 **합성적**이므로(‘/’는 U+002F: ASCII·ccc 0·\nCf 아님·정규 합성/분해에 불참 → NFD 재배열도 NFC 합성도 넘지 못하는 세그먼트 경계이고,\ncasefold는 문맥 무관) 키를 누적할 수 있다: 부모 키 + b\"/\" + **컴포넌트**의 폴드.\n\n정확성 조건(= done-when이 요구한 것)을 측정으로 증명: 라이브 트리 5,841 추적 경로의\n전 prefix 8,453개에 대해 (prefix, key) 집합이 **바이트 동일**이고 유도되는 파티션도\n**동일**(8,453 클래스). 파티션이 달라지면 alias census가 보는 것이 조용히 바뀌므로\n이것이 유일한 정답 조건이다.\n\n측정된 비용 델타(정직하게):\n- 병리적 depth-65 x200: ASCII -37.3% / 비ASCII -67.0% (키 동일 확인)\n- 라이브 트리(전부 ASCII, 평균 깊이 6.9)의 키 구성 단계만: median +6.5%\n  (8.8ms→9.3ms). ASCII fast path에서 폴드는 사실상 .lower()라 거의 공짜이고,\n  누적은 레벨당 bytes 연결을 하나 더 하므로 얕은 ASCII 트리에서는 손해다.\n  전체 helper 실행(~0.28 s) 대비 +0.02%로 노이즈 이하.\n- foldcache 엔트리 8,453 → 4,865 (-42%) — 컴포넌트 키잉이라 항목 수가 더 적다.\n\n정직한 한계: 남는 O(d²)는 **키 문자열 자체의 실체화**이며 이는 축약 불가다(맵이\n서로 다른 d개 키를 실제로 보관해야 한다). 줄어든 것은 폴드 작업과 캐시 크기다.","tree":{"sha":"59286313e0cc4810b2402a978efe1a6d1a9ace5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/59286313e0cc4810b2402a978efe1a6d1a9ace5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/f134d99685f5b95fae59d83d830a9a23d17ae2f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/f134d99685f5b95fae59d83d830a9a23d17ae2f5","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGYxMzRkOTk2ODVmNWI5NWZhZTU5ZDgzZDgzMGE5YTIzZDE3YWUyZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/f8c2ac03150bd1181432a2cc23b9be54650ce398","sha":"f8c2ac03150bd1181432a2cc23b9be54650ce398","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/f8c2ac03150bd1181432a2cc23b9be54650ce398"}],"sha":"f134d99685f5b95fae59d83d830a9a23d17ae2f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/f134d99685f5b95fae59d83d830a9a23d17ae2f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/f8c2ac03150bd1181432a2cc23b9be54650ce398/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:50:12Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:50:12Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): generate_agents.sh의 verdict 카운트 assert가 stale — 14→15\n\n90e14b0(Lane D)이 scheduler-l4-verdict-v3.md를 추가했으나 generate_agents.sh의\ndisk-truth assert는 14로 남아 있었다. 결과: rules/ 를 건드리는 모든 커밋에서\nregen이 AGENTS.md를 새로 쓴 뒤 assert로 exit 1 하고, pre-commit 훅은 그 실패를\n삼킨 채 STALE AGENTS.md를 스테이징했다 — sentinel sha가 rules/ 와 어긋난 채\n커밋되는 경로(직전 커밋 966761f가 실제로 그렇게 됐다). assert를 디스크 진실 15로\n갱신하고 AGENTS.md를 재생성해 sha를 rules/ 와 다시 결박한다.","tree":{"sha":"cb9f49bbbdeefbbac9b4a52a13dcae7ab0959e4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/cb9f49bbbdeefbbac9b4a52a13dcae7ab0959e4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/f8c2ac03150bd1181432a2cc23b9be54650ce398","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/f8c2ac03150bd1181432a2cc23b9be54650ce398","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGY4YzJhYzAzMTUwYmQxMTgxNDMyYTJjYzIzYjliZTU0NjUwY2UzOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/966761f40769658ce89222de73f02b686153397c","sha":"966761f40769658ce89222de73f02b686153397c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/966761f40769658ce89222de73f02b686153397c"}],"sha":"f8c2ac03150bd1181432a2cc23b9be54650ce398","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/f8c2ac03150bd1181432a2cc23b9be54650ce398"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/966761f40769658ce89222de73f02b686153397c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:49:10Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:49:10Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): P2-74 각괄호 구멍 봉합 — strip_html을 인용문 쪽에도 대칭 적용 + P3-136 레시피 산문 정정\n\nP2-74: strip_html()이 스냅숏 쪽에만 적용돼, 원문이 미이스케이프 꺾쇠를 쓰는 페이지의\n인용은 구조적으로 검증 불가였다(스냅숏 V<VERSION>__<NAME>.sql -> V __ .sql, 인용문은\n꺾쇠 보존 -> 영원한 불일치). 실측 인스턴스의 인용문은 가드의 *망가진* 스펠링으로\n다시 쓰여 있었다 = 구멍이 인용을 페이지 텍스트에서 밀어냈다. strip_html을 단일\nnormalize 안으로 옮겨 양쪽을 같은 함수로 접고, 라이브 인용을 verbatim으로 복원.\n스냅숏 쪽 동작은 바이트 동일(호출자가 이미 strip->normalize 순서였음).\n회귀 픽스처 2종: pass_angle_bracket_quote(진짜 꺾쇠 인용 통과) +\nfail_angle_bracket_fabricated(.sql->.zzz, 여전히 차단 = 비공허).\n\nP3-136: recipes/**의 SKIP LOCKED 산문을 (P2-48)/(P2-61) 정정 시맨틱으로 갱신.\n행은 5줄이라 했으나 실측 6줄(L4-composition 2 + spec-trio-template 4). 잔여 언급은\n전부 부정문이거나 정당한 용법(transactional-outbox polling publisher).","tree":{"sha":"a39290699fa5500cd00676eeebe30559f4dfd034","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/a39290699fa5500cd00676eeebe30559f4dfd034"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/966761f40769658ce89222de73f02b686153397c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ky