/api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/274b6952a532b68c447b577fdfbd8743d7a5e962/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:43:44Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:43:44Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(backlog): Lane B 13행 종결 — 305/314 (97%)\n\nP2-64 부트스트랩 parity 가드[106](selfproof 6/6, 로스터=census) · P2-67 mktemp 절대해석+\nowner/mode 검증 · P2-69 JSON 인코딩+O_NOFOLLOW · P2-70 env -i 3/6(전이적 기준 재계산;\n측정: 상속형 61개 환경변수에 GITHUB_PAT·NEON_API_KEY까지 게이트로 유입되던 것 제거) ·\nP3-110 --full-history · P3-111 스냅숏 id가 경로 조각이던 진짜 구멍(이전 가드는 upstream/\n밖 파일을 ''검증된 id''로 PASS) · P3-112 인자 전달 단언(삭제해도 이전엔 16/0 green) ·\nP3-113 anchor_kind 라이브 검증 · P3-114 스키마 핀 결정화(이전 가드는 바뀐 writer를 세탁) ·\nP3-116 내용해시 결박 · P3-117 ref store 전수(주장의 정직성) · P3-119 P1 승격분 봉합\n(.gitmodules ignore=all → push 게이트 exit 0 CLEAN이던 false-green) · P3-121 백틱이 소음이\n아니라 매 스윕 git replace를 실행하고 있었음.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26cd2b57c95ddd14c13a8bce4e4f591442b50037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/26cd2b57c95ddd14c13a8bce4e4f591442b50037"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/274b6952a532b68c447b577fdfbd8743d7a5e962","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/us