ers/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/cfcca00a8583632d926f95335dd7d4d2f1363546/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:35:44Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:35:44Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): P3-114의 writer 교차검증에 relocated-copy affordance — [87]이 recency 픽스처 4건을 vacuous로 오판\n\nP3-114가 writer 미해독을 blocking으로 만들면서, fixture_kill_proof [87]이 이 가드를\nbare temp 경로로 복사해 돌릴 때 guard_repo에 verify-completion.sh가 없어 neuter와 무관하게\nexit 1 — 측정: recency 픽스처 4건이 \"VACUOUS fixture\"로 오판됐다.\n\nrelease-anchor 헬퍼의 기존 affordance와 동일하게 게이트: guard_repo가 git work tree가\n아닐 때만 writer 교차검증을 스킵한다. 라이브 트리에서 writer 삭제는 여전히 BLOCK —\n\"핀을 대조할 파일을 지운다\"가 바로 이 검사가 거부하는 형태이므로.\n\n측정: [87] recency 4건 FAIL→PASS(non-vacuous), recency --fixtures 21/21,\nP3-114 decoy RED demo 2종 여전히 차단(SCHEMA_DRIFT / SCHEMA_UNRESOLVED).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9315939adbda6dc2ded1347a05498d70cc9f4346","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/9315939adbda6dc2ded1347a05498d70cc9f4346"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/cfcca00a8583632d926f95335dd7d4d2f1363546","verification":{"payloa