gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/e2d4d66be4cf7cd2d1a5e44762faf0c21119e77d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:32:18Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:32:18Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(provers): P2-70의 env -i가 인스크립트 거부를 관측 불가로 만든 상호작용을 층별로 분리 (P2-70 후속)\n\n두 prover가 잡아낸 실측: env -i 재실행이 BASH_FUNC_* 항목을 프로세스 시작 전에 삭제하므로\n(B)/(C)/(D)/(a)/(a2)의 exported-function 공격이 \"거부\"가 아니라 \"무해\"가 됐다 — 경계 통제로는\n더 강하지만 인스크립트 통제가 관측 불가가 되면 썩는다. 두 층을 분리 증명한다:\n\n- 샌드박스 사본의 privileged 블록을 상속형으로 되돌려(anchor 1회 강제, 어긋나면 loud) 기존\n  케이스들이 검증하던 채널을 그대로 유지 — 상속형 3개 entry가 실제로 갖는 채널이자\n  P2-70 이전 모든 entry의 채널.\n- 신규 (BI)/(a3): 출하 형태(env -i)에서 동일 공격이 무해함을 단언 — exit 0 + 거부코드 부재\n  + 게이트가 자기 PASS 신호/자기 앵커에 도달했음(공격자 정의가 실행되지 않았다는 증거).\n\nax-prove-hermetic-runtime: PASS (violation 0), ax-prove-helper-injection-blocked: PASS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d599aa4a8de5db98047032773fdb0dec7cc591a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/8d599aa4a8de5db98047032773fdb0dec7cc591a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/e2d4d66be4cf7cd2d1a5e44762faf0c21119e77d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/e2d4d66be4cf7cd2d1a5e44762faf0c21119e77d","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGUyZDRkNjZiZTRjZjdjZDJkMWE1ZTQ0NzYyZmFmMGMyMTExOWU3N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/1a9293f9fc2a0ad4bb36bc4b859a15d9849bbc1d","sha":"1a9293f9fc2a0ad4bb36bc4b859a15d9849bbc1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/1a9293f9fc2a0ad4bb36bc4b859a15d9849bbc1d"}],"sha":"e2d4d66be4cf7cd2d1a5e44762faf0c21119e77d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/e2d4d66be4cf7cd2d1a5e44762faf0c21119e77d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/1a9293f9fc2a0ad4bb36bc4b859a15d9849bbc1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:28:22Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:28:22Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"feat(evidence): P2-57 allowlist 49→1 재fetch 소각 + 날조 sha 스텁 1건 삭제 (P2-57/P2-58)\n\nDECISION 2 — allowlist 잔여 49건을 wave-1과 동일 메커니즘으로 소각: snapshot-extract.sh 재fetch\n(시도 49건 전원 `kind: fetch` 영수증) → append-only 본문 갱신(기존 바이트 보존) → manifest sha/bytes를\n실제 whole-file digest로 동기화 → allowlist에서 제거. 48건 성공, 잔여 **1건**.\n잔여 `practices::iso-4217`는 iso.org가 plain client에 HTTP 403 Cloudflare 인터스티셜(58바이트)을\n반환하는 봇월이라 재fetch 불가 — entry를 유지하되 reason에 url/status/bytes/date/영수증 id(r117)를\n기록했다. 물려받은 주장이 아니라 도달 불가에 대한 증거다. baseline_universe(71)는 불변.\n\nDECISION 1 — `kisa-identity-verification-2026-05` 삭제. 본문 없음 + rolling-nibble 날조 sha\n(b4c5d6e7f8a9…) + rules/templates 인용 0(전 트리 grep; 참조는 폐기된 PRD 초안 산문뿐) +\nkisa.or.kr은 /robots.txt까지 전 경로 WAF 400(영수증 r067). 삭제 후 evidence_guard 양 카탈로그 PASS.\n`pipa-article-24-2026-05`는 **삭제하지 않음** — templates/DECISIONS.md[TD-2026-05-18-031] ADR\nevidence 블록이 upstream_id로 인용하며, evidence_guard의 entry_kind()는 upstream_id 키가 있으면\nsource_type: external보다 우선해 manifest 해석을 강제한다. 실측: 삭제 시 VIOLATION 발생. 따라서\npractices는 이 1건 때문에 2026-08-17 RED로 남는다(비용을 숨기지 않고 명시).\n\n인용 무결성: rules 185 quotes 0 miss, templates 74 anchors 0 findings (append-only이므로 불변).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"655706c7b992c0ddb6fdf8b2f5c0065edb06190f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/655706c7b992c0ddb6fdf8b2f5c0065edb06190f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/1a9293f9fc2a0ad4bb36bc4b859a15d9849bbc1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/1a9293f9fc2a0ad4bb36bc4b859a15d9849bbc1d","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDFhOTI5M2Y5ZmMyYTBhZDRiYjM2YmM0Yjg1OWExNWQ5ODQ5YmJjMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/9e2a3c3c1f0077828f1190ed46416564dcebe2ef","sha":"9e2a3c3c1f0077828f1190ed46416564dcebe2ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9e2a3c3c1f0077828f1190ed46416564dcebe2ef"}],"sha":"1a9293f9fc2a0ad4bb36bc4b859a15d9849bbc1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/1a9293f9fc2a0ad4bb36bc4b859a15d9849bbc1d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9e2a3c3c1f0077828f1190ed46416564dcebe2ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:22:07Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:22:07Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(bootstrap): 부트스트랩 parity·mktemp·env allowlist·JSON 인코딩·소스 결박 + 서브모듈 fail-open (P2-64/67/69/70, P3-116/119/123)\n\n- P2-64 hermetic_bootstrap_parity_guard [106] 신설: 8중복 부트스트랩의 preflight/scrub\n  바이트 동일성(라벨·EXIT·NEED_PY 3개 파라미터 제외) + privileged 블록의 클래스 내\n  동일성 + 로스터 census(미등록 9번째 사본·부트스트랩 상실 모두 BLOCK). selfproof 6/6.\n- P2-67 mktemp를 git/python3와 동일하게 절대경로 해석 + 반환 디렉터리 owner==euid,\n  (mode & 022)==0 검증(_ax_mktemp_d). 8 entry 공유 부트스트랩 + pre-push 앵커 추출 +\n  4개 prover에 적용.\n- P2-69 toolpaths.json을 json.dumps로 생성 + O_NOFOLLOW|O_EXCL로 기록 — 경로 바이트\n  무이스케이프 보간과 심링크 추종 덮어쓰기 동시 봉합(사이드카이므로 비차단, 거부는 loud).\n- P2-70 외부 툴체인을 exec하지 않는 3개 entry에 env -i allowlist 재실행 적용\n  (PATH HOME TMPDIR JAVA_HOME BASH_ENV ENV + AX_*), gradle/npm을 exec하는 3개는\n  상속형 유지 + 사유 인라인 기록. 측정: 8 vs 61 환경변수.\n- P3-116 lstat→ls-tree→source의 fd 미결박 race를 사설 0700 디렉터리 사본 + HEAD blob\n  해시 대조로 결박(검증한 바이트가 곧 source되는 바이트). 4개 consumer 대칭 적용.\n- P3-119 (P1 승격) 초기화된 서브모듈의 자체 status를 확인 — .gitmodules(커밋 콘텐츠)의\n  submodule.<n>.ignore=all로 상위 status가 비고 digest가 clean 상수로 복귀하던\n  config 제어형 fail-open 차단. tree_fingerprint.py + recency 12c 대칭.\n- P3-123 결정에 의한 종결: .DS_Store 이름 예외는 거부(임의 바이트를 담는 실제 파일),\n  대신 원인·해결책을 명시하는 메시지로 개선.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77e6c6b1d848e75ac7af6aa4f716c76473dad9f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/77e6c6b1d848e75ac7af6aa4f716c76473dad9f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/9e2a3c3c1f0077828f1190ed46416564dcebe2ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/9e2a3c3c1f0077828f1190ed46416564dcebe2ef","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDllMmEzY