n이었다 — upstream_id를 바꾸면 보호 identity가 사라져 PROTECTED_LEDGER_ANCHOR_ABSENT(exit 2)가 난다.\n보호 원장 래칫은 이 레인의 판단 대상이 아니므로(메인 루프 소관) 인용을 원복한다. 두 인용이 가리키는\nTechniques 색인 본문에 그 문장이 없다는 측정은 잔여로 보고한다. 보호 항목이 아닌\npractices-react/rules/impersonation-banner-...md의 재앵커는 그대로 유지.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea5465c3105bb77ebff3b9d881eabadcf47c11db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/ea5465c3105bb77ebff3b9d881eabadcf47c11db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/ce85dc594ae3ce6ab41d25e57cd3a3add143592c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/ce85dc594ae3ce6ab41d25e57cd3a3add143592c","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGNlODVkYzU5NGFlM2NlNmFiNDFkMjVlNTdjZDNhM2FkZDE0MzU5MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/e25f598f1d09ebf141b04bf23218a3be578410da","sha":"e25f598f1d09ebf141b04bf23218a3be578410da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/e25f598f1d09ebf141b04bf23218a3be578410da"}],"sha":"ce85dc594ae3ce6ab41d25e57cd3a3add143592c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/ce85dc594ae3ce6ab41d25e57cd3a3add143592c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/e25f598f1d09ebf141b04bf23218a3be578410da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:05:53Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:05:53Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"feat(evidence): 만료 임박 47 스냅숏 재fetch + recharts 재앵커 + allowlist 63→49 (P2-58/P2-57/P3-103/P2-63)\n\nP2-58 (URGENT, 만료 D-10) — time_decay 90일 퓨즈에 걸릴 fetched_at < 2026-06-01 전량(47 id)을\ncommitted 파이프라인(practices/scripts/snapshot-extract.sh: curl → 결정론 extractor)으로 재fetch.\nfetched_at의 bulk-touch는 하지 않았다 — 시도한 모든 URL(실패 포함)이 _FETCH-RECEIPTS.yaml의\n`kind: fetch` 행을 갖고, 본문이 갱신된 33 identity는 `kind: assembly` 행까지 갖는다.\n본문 갱신은 append-only: 기존 본문은 바이트 그대로 보존하고 그 아래에 extractor 원출력을\n\"Upstream refresh 2026-08-01\" 절로 덧붙였다 → 기존 인용 185개 전부 그대로 verbatim 유지.\n\nP2-57 — 재fetch한 14 practices-react id의 manifest sha/bytes를 실제 whole-file digest로 동기화하고\nshrink-only 잔여 allowlist에서 제거. 63 → 49. baseline_universe(71)는 불변.\n\nP3-103 — recharts.org/en-US/api 재프로브 결과 여전히 404 SPA 셸(영수증 r057/r058). 그러나 프로젝트\nREADME가 가리키는 recharts.github.io는 정적 본문을 서빙한다 → 호스트 재앵커로 스냅숏 본문 신규 저작\n(ResponsiveContainer/LineChart/BarChart/PieChart + README, 5 URL). 인용 7건 중 6건을 verbatim 텍스트로\n재앵커, heatmap.tsx 1건은 삭제 — 이 컴포넌트는 recharts를 import하지 않고(dependencies: []) 인용문은\n어떤 recharts 출처에도 없는 창작 문장이었다. 템플릿 스윕 findings 7 → 0.\n\nP2-63 — theme-switcher.tsx의 산문·evidence가 여전히 \"next-themes는 쿠키 전략\"이라고 서술. 스냅숏\n대조로 정정: next-themes는 localStorage + 블로킹 인라인 스크립트를 쓴다. 쿠키는 ax-template의 설계\n선택(서버가 읽을 수 있는 유일한 저장소)임을 명시하고 upstream 주장과 분리.\n\n부수: wcag SC 4.1.3 인용 3건을 Techniques 색인(그 문장이 없음)에서 규범 스펙 wcag-2-2로 재앵커.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4aae9126b64cfe4aa393f931877eb3284623edcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/4aae9126b64cfe4aa393f931877eb3284623edcc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/e25f598f1d09ebf141b04bf23218a3be578410da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/e25f598f1d09ebf141b04bf23218a3be578410da","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGUyNWY1OThmMWQwOWViZjE0MWIwNGJmMjMyMThhM2JlNTc4NDEwZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/ea7a8e014a136bf60157e890eb240996b70b069b","sha":"ea7a8e014a136bf60157e890eb240996b70b069b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/ea7a8e014a136bf60157e890eb240996b70b069b"}],"sha":"e25f598f1d09ebf141b04bf23218a3be578410da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/e25f598f1d09ebf141b04bf23218a3be578410da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/ea7a8e014a136bf60157e890eb240996b70b069b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:02:09Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:02:09Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(ratchet): 앵커·감사행·훅 배선의 미검증 표면 7건 봉합 (P3-110/111/112/113/114/117, P3-121)\n\n- P3-110 bootstrap-plausibility의 두 rev-list에 --full-history: merge 단순화가\n  경로 이력을 누락 보고하면 ''한 번도 없던 파일'' = 부트스트랩 SKIP으로 읽힌다.\n- P3-111 동적 스냅숏 경로에 ratchet-critical과 동일한 3중 처리(경로 컴포넌트\n  lstat walk + 앵커측 git mode + id 경로탈출 차단).\n- P3-112 pre-push 시나리오가 --expect-anchor-sha 전달을 단언(양방향).\n- P3-113 anchor_kind를 라이브 루트에서 재해석해 검증.\n- P3-114 감사 스키마 introspection을 blocking + 단일 authoritative 추출점.\n- P3-117 replacement-ref 열거를 전체 ref store로 확대 + GIT_NAMESPACE 거부.\n- P3-121 원장 산문의 백틱 4행 이스케이프 — stderr 소음 + 의도치 않은 명령 실행 제거.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43ae9b5e3c9cd296250d0b5985d74ae03e67317a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/43ae9b5e3c9cd296250d0b5985d74ae03e67317a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/ea7a8e014a136bf60157e890eb240996b70b069b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/ea7a8e014a136bf60157e890eb240996b70b069b","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGVhN2E4ZTAxNGExMzZiZjYwMTU3ZTg5MGViMjQwOTk2YjcwYjA2OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/90e14b0407786b4f8880bd72f27c39d1d221b95c","sha":"90e14b0407786b4f8880bd72f27c39d1d221b95c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/90e14b0407786b4f8880bd72f27c39d1d221b95c"}],"sha":"ea7a8e014a136bf60157e890eb240996b70b069b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/ea7a8e014a136bf60157e890eb240996b70b069b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/90e14b0407786b4f8880bd72f27c39d1d221b95c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:00:08Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T02:00:08Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"feat(final4-closeD): sealed-verdict transcript sha256 binding + M1 rubric fix + frontend-test 게이트 (P3-105/107/108/109)\n\n- P3-105: scheduler-l4-verdict-v3.md — M1(backend_only→full_trio, R49) 정정. v2의\n  실제 context-0 transcript가 이미 정답(full_trio)을 담고 있어 재실행 불필요 —\n  같은 sealed input(README/AGENTS.md)이 안 변했으므로 재실행은 byte-identical\n  답을 재생산할 뿐. MUST 11/12→12/12, SHOULD 4/8 불변, verdict 여전히 FAIL(SHOULD\n  미달) — fidelity, regression 아님.\n- P3-108: skills/_tests/sealed-verdict/TRANSCRIPT-MANIFEST.yaml(신규 sha256 레지스트리)\n  + practices/evals/sealed_verdict_transcript_integrity_guard.sh([105], 3 픽스처:\n  pass_clean/fail_tampered_transcript/fail_unregistered_reference 전량 실행 확인).\n  v1/v2는 sealed라 헤더 편집 불가 — 레지스트리가 사후 결박을 담당, v3는 자기\n  frontmatter에도 동일 필드 병기.\n- P3-107: 검증만 — manifest_snapshot_integrity_guard의 최신-assembly-row 결박 시맨틱은\n  이미 구현·픽스처화·run-all-guards 등재 완료 상태(f3676bf) 확인. 두 픽스처를 직접\n  실행해 재확인: fail_latest_assembly_mismatch exit 2(구세대 매칭이어도 RECEIPT_MISSING),\n  pass_repeat_refresh_latest_assembly exit 0(신세대만 매칭해도 통과) — \"최신에 결박,\n  임의-행-매칭 아님\"을 실측으로 재증명. 코드 변경 없음.\n- P3-109: verification-checklist.yaml에 frontend-test step(`npm run test`) 추가.\n  timeout_seconds는 기존 900s 기본값 상속 — 측정치 아님을 주석에 명시(npm 미실행,\n  75개 vitest 파일이 authoring-time disk truth).\n- doc_headline_count_guard 104→105 가드 카운트 갱신(README/CLAUDE.md/SKILL.md).\n- 공유 워크트리 위생: run-all-guards.sh는 다른 레인이 동시 편집 중이라 hunk 단위로\n  내 [105] 삽입만 스테이징(git apply --cached), 나머지 3개 hunk는 워킹트리에\n  그대로 남김.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"adf51d8e6d9983819810fe600003afb1d2bf5b21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/adf51d8e6d9983819810fe600003afb1d2bf5b21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/90e14b0407786b4f8880bd72f27c39d1d221b95c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":