d":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/6242e65197ff338cd6a891900a142e74bfcc0efa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T00:41:12Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T00:41:12Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(prover): the closing banner''s twin enumeration stopped at round 12\n\nThe paragraph claimed a neutered twin for ''every round-5/6/7/8/9/10/11/12\naddition'' and per-implementation splits for rounds 9-12, while rounds 13, 14 and\n14b all ship both. A summary that understates its own run is the same defect\nclass this harness exists to catch, one direction over.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe80335325889aec080636f26ead0f69c1a7abfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/fe80335325889aec080636f26ead0f69c1a7abfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/6242e65197ff338cd6a891900a142e74bfcc0efa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/6242e65197ff338cd6a891900a142e74bfcc0efa","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDYyNDJlNjUxOTdmZjMzOGNkNmE4OTE5MDBhMTQyZTc0YmZjYzBlZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/5d18303f269f5480065a27b0543ddf0fc74e2c55","sha":"5d18303f269f5480065a27b0543ddf0fc74e2c55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/5d18303f269f5480065a27b0543ddf0fc74e2c55"}],"sha":"6242e65197ff338cd6a891900a142e74bfcc0efa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/6242e65197ff338cd6a891900a142e74bfcc0efa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/5d18303f269f5480065a27b0543ddf0fc74e2c55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T00:29:52Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T00:29:52Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): alias verdict on EVERY resolved component — a trailing slash was a one-character bypass (P1-seal r14b)\n\nRound 14 followed intermediate symlinks correctly and then asked the alias\nquestion ONCE, about the FINAL candidate, so the follow DISCARDED the\nintermediate''s spelling. Found by an independent verification lane on the tree\nround 14 itself shipped (tracked `mid/dirlink -> real`), committed content only:\n\n    ln -s DIRLINK  mid/x   -> exit 15   (final component: the round-13/14 class)\n    ln -s DIRLINK/ mid/x   -> exit 0    (SAME alias, one keystroke, UNREFUSED)\n    ln -s DIRLINK/real.txt -> exit 0    (the same hole without the keystroke)\n\nThe trailing slash is honoured LEGITIMATELY — the kernel follows the final\ncomponent when something follows it — and that legitimacy is what moved the\nalias out of reach: the follow lands on the correctly-spelled `mid/real`, which\npasses at step 5, while `mid/DIRLINK`, the spelling that dangles at a\ncase-sensitive receiver, was never asked about. That is a one-character bypass\nof the shipped GIT_SYMLINK_TARGET_ALIAS refusal, capable of false-green push\nevidence.\n\n`_resolve_link_target` now returns every NON-FINAL component it resolved\n(recorded before the follow pops it off the stack — no extra syscall) and the\nverdict applies steps 3-6 unchanged to each, under the SAME code: the subject\nand the remedy are identical, only the sentence changes. Runs for every walk\noutcome. Both implementations, symmetrically. Every not-this-class exit and both\nbudgets (40/4096) preserved.\n\nPrecision was the risk, so the false-positive control grew: 9 -> 13 legitimate\nshapes (15 tracked symlinks), the four new ones all in the intermediate\nposition — trailing slash on a correctly-spelled tracked directory and on a\ncorrectly-spelled tracked symlink, SEVERAL correctly-spelled intermediates, and\nan UNTRACKED intermediate. Untracked intermediate treatment, stated: NOT\nrefused, no recorded spelling to alias (the step-4 exit an untracked final\ncandidate has always taken). Round 14''s C2 non-block still holds (exit 0).\n\nAlso: 12c comment said R25_SYMLINK_RESOLUTION_UNBOUNDED while the emitted code\nis GIT_SYMLINK_RESOLUTION_UNBOUNDED; and [104]''s descriptive echo quoted its own\nreproduction verbatim, so --advisory-scripts reported one hit on a pristine tree\n— rephrased (an advisory that always fires is one nobody reads), now 0.\n\nP3-134 CLOSED, and the row''s own P3 grading is recorded as the lesson: a\ndefect''s grade follows its reachability, not the tidiness of the argument for\ndeferring it. Convergence 271/310 -> 272/310 (88%).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f0b6b9ef29572df689408308b224c32af1b56a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/0f0b6b9ef29572df689408308b224c32af1b56a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/5d18303f269f5480065a27b0543ddf0fc74e2c55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/5d18303f269f5480065a27b0543ddf0fc74e2c55","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDVkMTgzMDNmMjY5ZjU0ODAwNjVhMjdiMDU0M2RkZjBmYzc0ZTJjNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/0f46936c64c5843cb5fe013d0dbe7a3651d7b105","sha":"0f46936c64c5843cb5fe013d0dbe7a3651d7b105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/0f46936c64c5843cb5fe013d0dbe7a3651d7b105"}],"sha":"5d18303f269f5480065a27b0543ddf0fc74e2c55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/5d18303f269f5480065a27b0543ddf0fc74e2c55"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/0f46936c64c5843cb5fe013d0dbe7a3651d7b105/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T23:38:11Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T23:38:11Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(prover): a backtick in the (AN) label EXECUTED `..`, and the PASS banner was stale\n\nTwo defects in the round-14 harness edit itself, both found by reading its own output:\n\n(1) the (AN) case label read \"POSIX `..` behind a symlink\" inside a DOUBLE-QUOTED shell\n    word, so bash ran command substitution on it — the run printed\n    `line 2220: ..: command not found` and the label rendered with a hole. The verdict was\n    unaffected (the label is only printed), but a harness that executes fragments of its\n    own prose is not one whose transcripts can be trusted verbatim.\n\n(2) the final PASS banner enumerates exactly what the run proved and had not been\n    extended for round 14 — the same stale-banner defect already registered as P3-125.\n    It now names the POSIX component-wise resolution, its pre-round-14 twin, the\n    per-implementation splits and the cycle budget.","tree":{"sha":"dd6d4873fd3e8c40d7328eda74aa954aeb6cda4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/dd6d4873fd3e8c40d7328eda74aa954aeb6cda4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/0f46936c64c5843cb5fe013d0dbe7a3651d7b105","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/0f46936c64c5843cb5fe013d0dbe7a3651d7b105","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDBmNDY5MzZjNjRjNTg0M2NiNWZlMDEzZDBkYmU3YTM2NTFkN2IxMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/81eeb6cd6569a852f0fa1886de316d409b667a05","sha":"81eeb6cd6569a852f0fa1886de316d409b667a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/81eeb6cd6569a852f0fa1886de316d409b667a05"}],"sha":"0f46936c64c5843cb5fe013d0dbe7a3651d7b105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/0f46936c64c5843cb5fe013d0dbe7a3651d7b105"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/81eeb6cd6569a852f0fa1886de316d409b667a05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T23:25:24Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T23:25:24Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): POSIX component-wise symlink resolution + checklist runtime-path spelling (P1-seal r14)\n\nP1-A — the round-13 symlink-target census resolved targets LEXICALLY, collapsing `..`\nbefore following anything, while the kernel pops `..` AFTER the follow. The reviewer''s\ntopology (backend/jump -> real/sub, backend/gradlew -> jump/../GRADLEW-REAL over a\ntracked backend/real/gradlew-real) reaches the tracked file on case-insensitive APFS —\nR25 executes the wrapper and goes green — while the lexical candidate is ABSENT, so both\nimplementations exited silently with the clean-tree constant, and a case-sensitive\nreceiver gets a dangling backend/gradlew. `_resolve_link_target` now walks component by\ncomponent (follow intermediates, never the final one, pop `..` after the follow), bounded\nat 40 follows / 4096 components; exhaustion BLOCKS under the new\nGIT_SYMLINK_RESOLUTION_UNBOUNDED (fingerprint exit 16) rather than going silent. Mirrored\nin the recency guard''s 12c sweep. BACKLOG P3-133 is closed as REJECTED-AND-SUPERSEDED:\nits own remedy (\"go silent on lexical/realpath divergence\") would have preserved this P1;\nits over-inclusive counterexample is re-measured and no longer over-blocks.\n\nP1-B — R25 executes checklist `command`/`working_directory` verbatim, and nothing checked\nthat those strings name RECORDED spellings; rewriting one command''s `practices/` as\n`PRACTICES/` runs, leaves the tree clean and the fingerprint at the clean-tree constant,\nand publishes green evidence for a command that fails on a case-sensitive receiver. New\nguard [104] checklist_command_path_spelling_guard.sh enforces the gate''s OWN inputs using\nthe SHARED fold (imported, not re-implemented); zero false positives measured on the live\nchecklist (367 tokens, 0 aliases). The GENERAL class is undecidable by inspection and is\nregistered OPEN as P2-72 with its true remedy (verify on a case-sensitive,\nnormalization-sensitive checkout); a non-blocking --advisory-scripts probe ships labelled\nas advisory.\n\nProver: (AN)/(AN2)/(AN3)/(AN4) jump topology with split neuters + (AO) the cycle budget.\nNew rows P2-72, P3-134 (intermediate-component alias, unrefused by BOTH resolvers —\nmeasured, register-only). Convergence 271/310.","tree":{"sha":"cc1b20b79b83b7f76de65ca6bcf66f8d443078d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/cc1b20b79b83b7f76de65ca6bcf66f8d443078d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/81eeb6cd6569a852f0fa1886de316d409b667a05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/81eeb6cd6569a852f0fa1886de316d409b667a05","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDgxZWViNmNkNjU2OWE4NTJmMGZhMTg4NmRlMzE2ZDQwOWI2NjdhMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/b259b250b7822bd8c5520db464c727d25712a85f","sha":"b259b250b7822bd8c5520db464c727d25712a85f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/b259b250b7822bd8c5520db464c727d25712a85f"}],"sha":"81eeb6cd6569a852f0fa1886de316d409b667a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/81eeb6cd6569a852f0fa1886de316d409b667a05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/b259b250b7822bd8c5520db464c727d25712a85f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T21:54:54Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T21:54:54Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(gates): lexical .. ''never over-inclusive'' 절대주장 철회 + P3-133 등재\n\n독립 검증(Fable)이 R13 봉합을 VERIFIED 판정하면서 절대주장 1건을 재현으로 반증:\nPOSIX 해석이 리포를 벗어나 dangling하는 링크(ln -s outdirlink/../SECRET.txt, outdirlink ->\n../outside)의 lexical 후보가 추적 경로 secret.txt에 fold-동치로 떨어져 exit 15로 부당 차단.\n방향은 fail-closed(놓친 alias가 아니라 거짓 거부)이고 형태가 병리적이라 메커니즘은 유지하되,\n''결코 over-inclusive하지 않다''고 단언한 문서 2곳(tree_fingerprint.py 클래스 docstring +\n_resolve_link_target docstring)을 재현과 함께 정정하고 P3-133으로 등재. 수렴 270/308.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71fef078a02109965ad4df8170aa5e3d8068571e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/71fef078a02109965ad4df8170aa5e3d8068571e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/b259b250b7822bd8c5520db464c727d25712a85f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/b259b250b7822bd8c