OTHER\nunauditable digest\" as one of three defects it fixed. The first draft of the\nround-13 entry quoted 55441dfd (a transient working-state value) and would have\nrepeated it one round later. Replaced with the same probe recipe round 12 used;\nthe dirty value 8a91e493 is byte-identical across both rounds. Performance\nre-measured as 5-run means (0.300 -> 0.296 s/run).","tree":{"sha":"f0252ac456f8094ca3eee007392bcf57bf38196f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/f0252ac456f8094ca3eee007392bcf57bf38196f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/05330569ef6f6b9f25b498befa7c9704409798a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224275982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-pllet","id":224275982,"login":"d-pllet","node_id":"U_kgDODV4uDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/05330569ef6f6b9f25b498befa7c9704409798a0","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDA1MzMwNTY5ZWY2ZjZiOWYyNWI0OThiZWZhN2M5NzA0NDA5Nzk4YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/6b989db5f9