":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224275982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-pllet","id":224275982,"login":"d-pllet","node_id":"U_kgDODV4uDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/2713dfb307c12ec20d1649f495ddce3f1088425d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T21:20:52Z","email":"admin@doulcomm.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T21:20:52Z","email":"admin@doulcomm.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(ratchet): symlink TARGETS enter the alias census — GIT_SYMLINK_TARGET_ALIAS (round 13 P1)\n\nRounds 9-12 registered only INDEX PATHS. A symlink''s target is blob content,\nread as bytes and never resolved, so the four-round alias census (case,\nnormalization, non-ASCII case, ignorable Cf) did not apply to it at all.\n\nBoth implementations now resolve a tracked symlink''s target lexically against\nthe link''s own recorded directory and refuse a spelling that reaches a tracked\ninode by a FOLD-EQUAL alias of the recorded spelling. Gating on fold-equality\n(not bare inequality) is what keeps .. traversal, chains through an intermediate\nsymlinked directory and absolute targets out of the refusal.\n\nTD-2026-08-01-(P1-symlink-target-alias)","tree":{"sha":"59c1a9bed8a3fc28bf2f50bb14270a6991205a2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/59c1a9bed8a3fc28bf2f50bb14270a6991205a2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/2713dfb307c12ec20d1649f495ddce3f1088425d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224275982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-pllet","id":224275982,"login":"d-pllet","node_id":"U_kgDODV4uDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/2713dfb307c12ec20d1649f495ddce3f1088425d","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDI3MTNkZmIzMDdjMTJlYzIwZDE2NDlmNDk1ZGRjZTNmMTA4ODQyNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/9c8f339fb37682b9784d44a35a10e3be3f5420dc","sha":"9c8f339fb37682b9784d44a35a10e3be3f5420dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9c8f339fb37682b9784d44a35a10e3be3f5420dc"}],"sha":"2713dfb307c12ec20d1649f495ddce3f1088425d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/2713dfb307c12ec20d1649f495ddce3f1088425d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9c8f339fb37682b9784d44a35a10e3be3f5420dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T20:03:50Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T20:03:50Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(decisions): 검증 레인이 넓힌 증거 + 요약 과대 1건 정정 (R12 사후)\n\n독립 검증(Fable)이 R12 봉합을 VERIFIED 판정하면서 두 가지를 남김:\n① 증거 확장 — 구현 레인은 Cf 170자만 프로브했으므로 ''Cf ⊇ HFS+ ignorables''는 TN1150 표의\n   완전성에 기댄 absence assertion이었다. 검증자가 같은 볼륨에서 **BMP 전체 63,486자를\n   스윕(7.9초)해 정확히 16자만 접히고 전부 Cf임**을 실측 → 상위집합 성질이 BMP 완전성으로\n   승격. 미스윕 잔여(astral planes)를 명시.\n② 요약 과대 — ''이번 라운드엔 SIMULATED arm이 없다''는 제목이 거짓(본문은 (AI)가 무조건\n   simulated라고 이미 말하고 있었음). 제목을 실제 주장(공격·오탐 arm이 real)으로 정정하고,\n   ''요약이 자기 본문과 모순되는 것''은 이번 라운드가 prover 배너에서 고친 결함이 한 층 위에서\n   재현된 것임을 기록.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c2131249e60a930a593ec33c94830ff8ace894d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/8c2131249e60a930a593ec33c94830ff8ace894d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/9c8f339fb37682b9784d44a35a10e3be3f5420dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/9c8f339fb37682b9784d44a35a10e3be3f5420dc","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDljOGYzMzlmYjM3NjgyYjk3ODRkNDRhMzVhMTBlM2JlM2Y1NDIwZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/72ebbf09566d9830fb6e52d57c620659f0991464","sha":"72ebbf09566d9830fb6e52d57c620659f0991464","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/72ebbf09566d9830fb6e52d57c620659f0991464"}],"sha":"9c8f339fb37682b9784d44a35a10e3be3f5420dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/9c8f339fb37682b9784d44a35a10e3be3f5420dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224275982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-pllet","id":224275982,"login":"d-pllet","node_id":"U_kgDODV4uDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/72ebbf09566d9830fb6e52d57c620659f0991464/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T19:37:55Z","email":"admin@doulcomm.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T19:37:55Z","email":"admin@doulcomm.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(gates): 라운드 12 DECISION 기록 + 백로그 3행 등재 + 문서 결함 3건 정정\n\n- TD-2026-08-01-(P1-ignorable-fold) 엔트리: 재현/수정/strip 집합 선택 근거표\n  (TN1150 16 vs Cf 170 vs Default_Ignorable 4,174)/증거표/정정/잔여\n- P3-128 NFKC·전각(세 볼륨 전부 distinct — 측정 기반 out-of-scope + Cf 상위집합\n  잔여 동봉) · P3-129 NTFS 8.3(생성 가변, 미재현) · P3-130 터키어 I/ı(반증된 후보)\n- 수렴 표 302→305 분모, 270/305 89% (backlog_convergence_integrity_guard green)\n- 정정 3건: .py:457 ''every pair'' 허위(DECISIONS:2215의 동일 문장도 함께),\n  DECISIONS:2216 outer-normalization 미철회, DECISIONS:2257 감사 불가 digest를\n  또 다른 감사 불가 digest로 교체 → 재현 레시피 동반 숫자로 대체\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9ff374fe6ea207f1a3ae49bcf9a6893d39a1668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/b9ff374fe6ea207f1a3ae49bcf9a6893d39a1668"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/72ebb