llowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-pllet","id":224275982,"login":"d-pllet","node_id":"U_kgDODV4uDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/5f8c42bb76acdf49ed3adf377082f0448480d3d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T19:30:55Z","email":"admin@doulcomm.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T19:30:55Z","email":"admin@doulcomm.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): P1-seal 라운드 12 — HFS+ ignorable-format 별칭 축을 fold에 봉합 (Cf strip)\n\n세 번째 등가 축: case-insensitive HFS+는 지정된 서식 제어문자를 ZERO로 접어\n건너뛴다(Apple TN1150 FastUnicodeCompare). 라운드 11의 canonical caseless 키는\nU+200C/U+202E를 보존했으므로 SAFE/ 와 SAFE<U+200C>/ 가 다른 키가 되어\n(st_dev, st_ino) 판별자가 둘을 비교한 적이 없다.\n\n- 두 구현의 공유 fold에 Cf(general category Format) strip을 정규화 앞단에 추가\n- 실제 case-insensitive HFS+ 볼륨(hdiutil create -fs HFS+)에서 측정:\n  TN1150 표가 0으로 접는 16자 전부 동일 inode(16/16), 나머지 Cf 154자는 전부\n  distinct(0/154) — 표와 라이브 동작이 정확히 일치\n- 프루버에 (AF)/(AG) ZWNJ·RLO RED arm + 구현별 분리 neuter(r12all/r12guard/r12fp)\n  + (AH) 라이브 false-positive 대조 + (AI) strip-set 4개 주장 기계 검증\n- 문서 결함 3건 정정(부분 정정이 같은 반증 주장을 다른 곳에 남기는 패턴)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00b490ca11d8b521ba3a9b38106a22b4ca94e6f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/00b490ca11d8b521ba3a9b38106a22b4ca94e6f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/5f8c42bb76acdf49ed3adf377082f0448480d3d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224275982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-pllet","id":224275982,"login":"d-pllet","node_id":"U_kgDODV4uDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-pllet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/5f8c42bb76acdf49ed3adf377082f0448480d3d9","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDVmOGM0MmJiNzZhY2RmNDllZDNhZGYzNzcwODJmMDQ0ODQ4MGQzZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/e5fbd0ad3210c32fee2a522b707d7a83985ad5ca","sha":"e5fbd0ad3210c32fee2a522b707d7a83985ad5ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/e5fbd0ad3210c32fee2a522b707d7a83985ad5ca"}],"sha":"5f8c42bb76acdf49ed3adf377082f0448480d3d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/5f8c42bb76acdf49ed3adf377082f0448480d3d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/e5fbd0ad3210c32fee2a522b707d7a83985ad5ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T18:07:09Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T18:07:09Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"docs(gates): 독립 검증(Fable)이 잡은 자기증거 과대주장 3건 정정\n\nR11 봉합은 VERIFIED(양 구현 동일 fold·AST 일치, 두 유니코드 형태 차단, 키만 되돌리는\nneuter로 구현별 load-bearing, 실제 대소문자 구분 볼륨 오탐 0, 12,841입력 parity 0불일치).\n검증 레인이 잡은 것은 전부 ''자기 증거에 대한 과대주장'' 클래스라 여기서 정정:\n① tree_fingerprint 주석의 ''OUTER normalization은 load-bearing''이 과대 — inner NFD가 있으면\n   casefold(NFD(s))만으로 인용된 쌍이 전부 동치이고, 14,284입력에서 outer 유무가 동일 분할을\n   유도(측정). 키 정규화로서 유지하되 load-bearing 주장은 철회하고 경위를 기록.\n② prover 요약 문단이 기본 실행에서도 distinct-inode 대조가 통과한 것처럼 서술 — (Z5)가\n   shared-prefix arm으로 폴백했다고 스스로 말한 실행에서도 그랬음. CS_ROOT 유무로 분기시켜\n   실제로 돌린 arm만 주장하게 수정(per-arm 라인은 원래 정직했고 요약만 거짓말했음).\n③ DECISIONS 표의 live-tree digest 751098…이 재유도 불가 — 클린 트리는 구조상 0a815065…를\n   내므로 그 값은 진행 중 dirty 트리의 스냅숏. 주장(''pre/post 동일'')은 참이므로 유지하되\n   감사 불가능한 숫자는 제거하고 사유를 남김.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c561102b3f2bc8c3af415c3466a01c8fb871637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/1c561102b3f2bc8c3af415c3466a01c8fb871637"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/e5fbd0ad3210c32fee2a522b707d7a83985ad5ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/e5fbd0ad3210c32fee2a522b707d7a83985ad5ca","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGU1ZmJkMGFkMzIxMGMzMmZlZTJhNTIyYjcwN2Q3YTgzOTg1YWQ1Y2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/8f469695f2ed9db0e1fbccd2b5318c3314ff673b","sha":"8f469695f2ed9db0e1fbccd2b5318c3314ff673b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/8f469695f2ed9db0e1fbccd2b5318c3314ff673b"}],"sha":"e5fbd0ad3210c32fee2a522b707d7a83985ad5ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/e5fbd0ad3210c32fee2a522b707d7a83985ad5ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/8f469695f2ed9db0e1fbccd2b5318c3314ff673b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:46:40Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:46:40Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): R11 (AD/AE) 프루버가 라이브 트리를 더럽히던 결함 — 유일한 import 프로브에 -B\n\n(AD/AE)는 이 파일에서 라이브 트리의 모듈을 **import**하는 유일한 프로브다.\n-B 없이 돌리면 python이 practices/scripts/lib/__pycache__/를 라이브 트리에\n써서, 프루버 실행 직후 git status가 DIRTY가 되고 이 하네스가 지키려는\npush-evidence 체인이 하네스 자신에 의해 깨진다(측정으로 확인).\n자기가 측정하는 대상을 더럽히는 증명은 증명이 아니다.","tree":{"sha":"66d4d1775c2fb0a9871301e24f1b8220ecca8a7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/66d4d1775c2fb0a9871301e24f1b8220ecca8a7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/8f469695f2ed9db0e1fbccd2b5318c3314ff673b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/8f469695f2ed9db0e1fbccd2b5318c3314ff673b","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKDhmNDY5Njk1ZjJlZDlkYjBlMWZiY2NkMmI1MzE4YzMzMTRmZjY3M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/c0c48f56893e4b8ecc021b0bfa7659eae61c309d","sha":"c0c48f56893e4b8ecc021b0bfa7659eae61c309d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/c0c48f56893e4b8ecc021b0bfa7659eae61c309d"}],"sha":"8f469695f2ed9db0e1fbccd2b5318c3314ff673b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/8f469695f2ed9db0e1fbccd2b5318c3314ff673b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/c0c48f56893e4b8ecc021b0bfa7659eae61c309d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:39:23Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:39:23Z","email":"yours012@gmail.com","name":"kyjin"},"message":"fix(gates): P1-seal 라운드 11 — prefix fold 키를 유니코드 canonical caseless로 (bytes.lower()는 ASCII 전용·정규화 무지)\n\n라운드 9/10의 alias 맵 키가 `bytes.lower()`였다 — A-Z만 소문자화하고 유니코드\n정규화를 모른다. 파일시스템이 한 inode로 서비스하는 두 스펠링이 서로 다른\n그룹에 들어가 공유 inode가 비교조차 되지 않았고, 두 경로 모두 환경 통제가\n필요 없는 **커밋된 내용**이다.\n\nbeee364 기계 재현 (APFS):\n    index: é/check.sh   (NFC   c3a9,   `cat \"é/helper\"` 실행)\n    index: e◌́/helper    (NFD  65cc81, PASS)\n    disk:  한 디렉터리 inode (16777229, 34664959)\n    git status --porcelain -uall → EMPTY\n    bash é/check.sh              → PASS      (모든 게이트 green)\n    tree_fingerprint.py .        → exit 0, 클린트리 상수 0a815065…\n    12c 스윕                     → 9개 violation 버킷 전부 EMPTY\n푸시된 트리엔 `e◌́/helper`만 남아 정규화-민감 수신자에겐 `é/helper`가 없다.\n`É/`(c389) ≡ `é/`(c3a9)는 같은 구멍의 형제(비ASCII 케이스).\n\n봉합: 두 구현 모두 키를 NFC(casefold(NFD(s))) — UAX #21 §1.3 canonical caseless —\n로 교체(`_fold_path_key` / `_ax_fold_path_key`, 동일 함수). inner NFD·outer\nnormalize·casefold(≠lower) 모두 측정으로 load-bearing 확인(U+1E9B U+0323 ≡ U+1E69은\nouter 없으면 놓치고, `É`≡`é`는 lower()로 놓친다). ASCII fast path는 근사가 아니라\n동치. 비UTF-8 경로는 surrogateescape로 크래시도 차단도 아님.\n\n불변 유지: (st_dev, st_ino) 판별자, 13/14 leaf·directory 코드 분기, 그 외\n바이트 수준 경로 처리. 신규 코드 0(시정 방법이 동일하므로).\n\n증거: (AA)(AB) RED · (AA2)(AB2) 양쪽 fold 되돌림 → 공격 재착지 · (AA3/AA4/AB3/AB4)\n구현별 분리 neuter · (AC) R10 ASCII 무회귀 · (Z5)(AA5) 실제 case-sensitive APFS\n볼륨에서 distinct-inode `A/`·`a/` 및 `É/`·`é/` 오탐 0 · (AD) fold parity 8,298 입력\n0 불일치 · (AE) SIMULATED 정규화 control. 라이브 digest 751098… 불변, 0.265→0.266 s/run.\n\n산문 정정: tree_fingerprint.py:252의 \"simulated case-sensitive control\" 주장은\nR10부터 stale(실제 hdiutil 볼륨 arm 존재) — 정정 + 무엇이 실제이고 무엇이\n시뮬레이션인지(정규화 control) 구분 명시. hdiutil 실측: case-insensitive APFS ·\ncase-**sensitive** APFS · case-sensitive HFS+ · ExFAT · FAT32 전부 정규화-무감각.\n\nbacklog: P3-120 closed(이 P1이 escalate한 행), P3-126(병리적 prefix 비용 —\nfail-closed, 우회 아님) · P3-127(Windows 후행 점·공백, NTFS 한정 미검증) 등재.\n수렴 269/300 → 270/302.\n\nDECISIONS: TD-2026-08-01-(P1-unicode-prefix-fold)","tree":{"sha":"31cb6cfe019d35e22b94f9856cafa3c58969af0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/trees/31cb6cfe019d35e22b94f9856cafa3c58969af0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/git/commits/c0c48f56893e4b8ecc021b0bfa7659eae61c309d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4515317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kyjin","id":4515317,"login":"kyjin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTUzMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyjin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/c0c48f56893e4b8ecc021b0bfa7659eae61c309d","node_id":"C_kwDOR3zpP9oAKGMwYzQ4ZjU2ODkzZTRiOGVjYzAyMWIwYmZhNzY1OWVhZTYxYzMwOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commit/beee364f3d2a6fa928271cdca686ff4e122b8b39","sha":"beee364f3d2a6fa928271cdca686ff4e122b8b39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/beee364f3d2a6fa928271cdca686ff4e122b8b39"}],"sha":"c0c48f56893e4b8ecc021b0bfa7659eae61c309d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits/c0c48f56893e4b8ecc021b0bfa7659eae61c309d"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dev-methodologies/ax-template/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=a58cc83332ccd129ca56aee31fb455b88f76f996&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A23%3A01.528Z"}');
